0120-0380,Meleiro-Mariano.pdf,Meleiro-Mariano_0,en,The Essence of Scott’s “Continuous Lattices”,"Following Fernando Zalamea’s call for mathematical criticism [4], we engage in an immersion and reflection on Dana Scott’s seminal paper Continuous Lattices [3]. During that process, we turn to making mathematics by extracting the essence of Scott’s arguments, thereby engaging in what we might call mathematical praxis. We reveal that Scott’s construction of a model of λ-calculus actually happens in a more general setting than it first seems, which includes the use of a particular geometric context [1] to then construct a poset-enriched semicartesian monoidal category in which the inverse system constructions actually take place. We ponder the philosophical implications of this approach","Lambda calculus, domain theory, category theory, philosophy of mathematical practice, mathematical praxis",marcadores,essence scott continuou lattic,follow fernando zalamea call mathematical criticism we engage immersion reflection dana scott seminal paper continuou lattic during proces we turn making mathematic extract essence scott argument thereby engag what we might call mathematical praxi we reveal scott construction model l-calculu actually happen more general sett than first seem which includ use particular geometric context then construct poset-enrich semicartesian monoidal category which inverse system construction actually take place we ponder philosophical implic approach,lambda calculu domain theory category theory philosophy mathematical practice mathematical praxi,essence scott continuou lattic follow fernando zalamea call mathematical criticism we engage immersion reflection dana scott seminal paper continuou lattic during proces we turn making mathematic extract essence scott argument thereby engag what we might call mathematical praxi we reveal scott construction model l-calculu actually happen more general sett than first seem which includ use particular geometric context then construct poset-enrich semicartesian monoidal category which inverse system construction actually take place we ponder philosophical implic approach lambda calculu domain theory category theory philosophy mathematical practice mathematical praxi,1.0.0,8ae2317b87340d5d
0120-0380,Meleiro-Mariano.pdf,Meleiro-Mariano_0,es,bject Classification: 03B40.,"Siguiendo el llamado de Fernando Zalamea por una cr´ıtica matem´atica [4], nos sumergimos y reflexionamos sobre el art´ıculo seminal de Dana Scott, “Continuous Lattices” [3]. Durante ese proceso, pasamos a hacer matem´aticas extrayendo la esencia de los argumentos de Scott, participando as´ı en lo que podr´ıamos llamar praxis matem´atica. Revelamos que la construcci´on de Scott de un modelo de lambda-c´alculo en realidad ocurre en un entorno m´as general de lo que parece a primera vista, que incluye el uso de un contexto geom´etrico particular [1] para luego construir una categor´ıa monoidal semicartesiana enriquecida sobre conjuntos ordenados en la que se hace efectiva la construcci´on con el sistema inverso. Reflexionamos sobre las implicaciones filos´oficas de este enfoque","Lambda c´alculo, teor´ıa de los dominios, teor´ıa de categor´ıas, filosof´ıa de la pr´actica matem´atica, praxis matem´atica. Domain Theory’s wide applicability contrasts with its localized origin by the hands of a single person: Dana Scott. One of the seminal works in the area is his paper entitled “Continuous Lattices” [3], which introduces the titular 1IME, Universidade de S˜ao Paulo, S˜ao Pau",marcadores,bject classification 03b40,sigu llamado fern zalamea cr itica matem atica nos sumergim reflexionam sobre art iculo seminal dana scott continuous lattic durante ese proceso pasam hacer matem atic extrayendo esencia argument scott particip as podr iamos llamar praxis matem atica revelam construcci on scott modelo lambda-c alculo realidad ocurre entorno as general parece primera vista incluye uso contexto geom etrico particular luego construir categor ia monoidal semicartesiana enriquecida sobre conjunt ordenad hace efectiva construcci on sistema inverso reflexionam sobre implic filos ofic este enfoque,lambda alculo teor ia domini teor ia categor ias filosof ia pr actica matem atica praxis matem atica domain the