0120-0380,Tenorio-Mariano.pdf,Tenorio-Mariano_0,desconocido,Tenorio-Mariano,"Bolet´ın de Matem´aticas 30(2) 25–30 (2023) 25 Sheaf Categories on semicartesian monoidal categories: logical and cohomological aspects Categor´ıas de haces en categor´ıas monoidales semicartesianas: aspectos l´ogicos y cohomol´ogicos Ana Luiza Tenorio1,a, Hugo Luiz Mariano2,b Keywords: toposes, sheaves, quantales, monoidal categories. Mathematics Subject Classification: 18F10, 18B25,18F75. Recibido: mayo de 2023 Aceptado: octubre de 2023 Let (O(X), ⊆) denote the category whose objects are the elements of the set O(X) of all open sets of a topological space X, and the morphisms are given by the inclusion ⊆. A presheaf on a topological space X with values in Set is a functor F : (O(X), ⊆)op →Set. Sheaves are presheaves that satisfy a certain gluing property and, categorically, they can be described as follows: for all U an open of X and all U = S i∈I Ui an open cover of U a presheaf is a sheaf if the following diagram is an equalizer in Set F(U) Q i∈I F(Ui) Q (i,j)∈I×I F(Ui ∩Uj) e p q where: 1. e(t) = {t|Ui | i ∈I}, t ∈F(U) 2. p((tk)k∈I) = (ti|Ui∩Uj )(i,j)∈I×I q((tk)k∈I) = (tj|Ui∩Uj )(i,j)∈I×I, (tk)k∈I ∈Q k∈I F(Uk) In other words, F is sheaf if, and only if, given U an open of X and an open cover U = S i∈I Ui of U, for any si ∈F(Ui) a compatible family (i.e., such that si|Ui∩Uj = sj|Ui∩Uj for all i, j ∈I) there is a unique s ∈F(U) such that s|Ui = si, i ∈I. We say s is the gluing of the compatible family. 1Department of Mathematics, Institute of Mathematics and Statistics, Uni",,respaldo_sin_marcadores,tenorio-mariano,bolet matem atic 30 25-30 2023 25 sheaf categori semicartesian monoidal categori logical cohomological aspect categor ias hace categor ias monoidal semicartesian aspect ogic cohomol ogic ana luiza tenorio1 hugo luiz mariano2 keyword topos sheav quantal monoidal categori mathematic subject classification 18f10 18b25 18f75 recibido mayo 2023 aceptado octubre 2023 let denote categ