c-financial analysi macroeconomic factor profitability economic uncertainty classification tree earning growth http doi org 10 17533 udea le n104a359327 este articulo sus anexo se distribuyen por la revista lectura de economia bajo los termino de la licencia creative common atribucion-nocomercial-compartirigual http creativecommon org licens by-nc-sa facteur macroeconomiqu de,1.0.0,b8b75c0ce5ce95bd
0120-2596,4514-1272-PB.pdf,4514-1272-PB_6,en,banco-de-datos/indice-de-precios-al-consumidor-ipcba/,"This paper aims to investigate production costs in industrial companies and verify actual costs through planned cost indicators to improve inventory operations management. The issues related to methodological aspects were identified as separate sections in the management accounting regulation, and through the descriptive systematic analysis, the management accounting accounts were developed, and their interaction with the financial accounting accounts was presented. According to the results of this research paper, the relationship between the development and organization of management accounting techniques, accounting items and accounting units has been proven for the information it provides to managers at various levels by measuring the effectiveness of decision-making and monitoring and evaluating the performance of internal structural units. This has resulted in increased profitability and improved efficiency, as indicated by inventory and cost management. Our proposal facilitated the analysis of the standardized management-reporting guide for production costs in industrial enterprises and verification during the audit of finished products received to be shipped and sold to markets. It serves as a basic criterion for classifying business transactions related to auditing finished products and their sales, thereby improving inventory management","accounting; cost, cost-benefit analysis, contracts, reputation. JEL Classification: M41; D24; D61; L14. Análisis y auditoría de los costes de producción según la información contable en las empresas industriales",marcadores,banco-de-dato indice-de-precios-al-consumidor-ipcba,paper aims investigate production cost industrial compani verify actual cost through plann cost indicator improve inventory oper management issu relat methodological aspect identifi separate section management account regulation through descriptive systematic analysi management account account develop their interaction financial account account present accord result research paper relationship between development organ management account techniqu account item account unit has been proven information provid manager variou level measur effectivenes decision-mak monitor evaluat performance internal structural unit has result increas profitability improv efficiency indicat inventory cost management our proposal facilitat analysi standardiz management-report guide production cost industrial enterpris verification during audit finish product receiv shipp sold market serv basic criterion classify busines transaction relat audit finish product their sale thereby improv inventory management,account cost cost-benefit analysi contract reputation jel classification m41 d24 d61 l14 analisi auditoria de los cost de produccion segun la informacion contable en las empresa industrial,banco-de-dato indice-de-precios-al-consumidor-ipcba paper aims investigate production cost industrial compani verify actual cost through plann cost indicator improve inventory oper management issu relat methodological aspect identifi separate section management account regulation through descriptive systematic analysi management account account develop their interaction financial account account present accord result research paper relationship between development organ management account techniqu account item account unit has been proven information provid manager variou level measur effectivenes decision-mak monitor evaluat performance internal structural unit has result increas profitability improv efficiency indicat inventory cost management our proposal facilitat analysi standardiz management-report guide production cost industrial enterpris verification during audit finish product receiv shipp sold market serv basic criterion classify busines transaction relat audit finish product their sale thereby improv inventory management account cost cost-b