0120-2596,4514-1272-PB.pdf,4514-1272-PB_8,en,ón del Impuesto sobre la Renta,"This article aims to estimate whether a policy focused on reducing personal income tax for low-income groups —namely, the reduction of net income from work, as regulated between 2007 and 2017— led to bunching behavior, understood as the strategic concentration of taxpayers at specific points of the income distribution. To address this question, the study follows the methodology proposed by Saez (2010) and uses tax microdata from the Personal Income Tax Filers Panel for the period 2007–2017. The results obtained do not provide evidence, except in very specific cases, supporting the existence of significant behavioral changes associated with this tax incentive",tax benefits; bunching; tax avoidance; personal income tax. https://doi.org/10.17533/udea.le.n104a358868 Este artículo y sus anexos se distribuyen por la revista Lecturas de Economía bajo los términos de la Licencia Creative Commons Atribución-NoComercial-CompartirIgual 4.0. https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/ Existe-t-il un effet de regroupement dans l’impôt sur le revenu? Une,marcadores,del impuesto sobre la renta,article aims estimate whether policy focus reduc personal income tax low-income group --namely reduction net income work regulat between 2007 2017-- led bunch behavior understood strategic concentration taxpayer specific point income distribution addres question study follow methodology propos saez 2010 uses tax microdata personal income tax filer panel period 2007-2017 result obtain do not provide evidence except very specific case support existence significant behavioral chang associat tax incentive,tax benefit bunch tax avoidance personal income tax http doi org 10 17533 udea le n104a358868 este articulo sus anexo se distribuyen por la revista lectura de economia bajo los termino de la licencia creative common atribucion-nocomercial-compartirigual http creativecommon org licens by-nc-sa existe-t-il un effe