0120-419X,Polinomios+de+Alexander-Conway+y+bracket+de+una+familia+de+enlaces+pretzel.pdf,Polinomios+de+Alexander-Conway+y+bracket+de+una+familia+de+enlaces+pretzel_0,en,Revista Integración,"Polynomial invariants constitute a dynamic and essential area of study in knot theory. From the pioneer Alexander polynomial, the revolutionary Jones polynomial, to the collectively discovered HOMFLYPT polynomial (just to mention a few), these algebraic expressions have been central to the understanding of knots and links. Even more with the recent introduction of Khovanov homology that has sparked significant interest in the categorification of these polynomials, offering deeper insights into their topological and algebraic properties. In this work, we revisit two prominent polynomial invariants–the Alexander-Conway and the Kauffman bracket–and focus specifically on the polynomials associated with the family of three-strand pretzel links P(1, 1, n)","Knots and links, pretzel links, Alexander-Conway polynomial, Kauffman bracket polynomial. MSC2020: 57M25, 57M27, 57M99. Polinomios de Alexander-Conway y bracket de una familia de enlaces pretzel",marcadores,revista integracion,polynomial invariant constitute dynamic essential area study knot theory pioneer alexander polynomial revolutionary jone polynomial collectively discover homflypt polynomial just mention few these algebraic expression have been central understand knot link even more recent introduction khovanov homology has spark significant interest categorification these polynomial offer deeper insight into their topological algebraic properti work we revisit two prominent polynomial invariants-the alexander-conway kauffman bracket-and focu specifically polynomial associat family three-strand pretzel link,knot link pretzel link alexander-conway polynomial kauffman bracket polynomial msc2020 57m25 57m27 57m99 polinomio de alexander-conway bracket de una familia de enlac pretzel,revista integracion polynomial invariant constitute dynamic essential area study knot theory pioneer alexander polynomial revolutionary jone polynomial collectively discover homflypt polynomial just mention few these algebraic expression have been central understand knot link even more recent introduction khovanov homology has spark significant interest categorification these polynomial offer deeper insight into their topological algebraic properti work we revisit two prominent polynomial invariants-the alexander-conway kauffman bracket-and focu specifically polynomial associat family three-strand pretzel link knot link pretzel link alexander-conway polynomial kauffman bracket polynomial msc2020 57m25 57m27 57m99 polinomio de alexander-conway bracket de una familia de enlac pretzel,1.0.0,d127447201d39be7
0120-419X,Polinomios+de+Alexander-Conway+y+bracket+de+una+familia+de+enlaces+pretzel.pdf,Polinomios+de+Alexander-Conway+y+bracket+de+una+familia+de+enlaces+pretzel_0,es,"tudy in knot theory. From the pioneer Alexander polynomial, the revolutionary Jones polynomial, to the collectively discovered HOMFLYPT polynomial","Los invariantes polinómicos constituyen un área dinámica y esencial de estudio en la teoría de nudos. Desde el polinomio de Alexander, el revolucionario polinomio de Jones, hasta el polinomio HOMFLYPT, descubierto colectivamente (por mencionar solo algunos), estas expresiones algebraicas han sido fundamentales para la comprensión de nudos y enlaces. Aún más con la reciente introducción de la homología de Khovanov, que ha despertado 0 E-mail: aalan.hernandez@upr.edu, bgabrielmontoyavega@gmail.com . Received: 28 April 2025, Accepted: 11 October 2025. To cite this article: A. Hernández-Flores and G. Montoya-Vega, Alexander-Conway and bracket polynomials of a family of pretzel links, Rev. Integr. Temas Mat., 43 (2025), No. 2, 27–43. doi: 10.18273/revint.v43n2-2025003 27 28 A. Hernández-Flores & G. Montoya-Vega un gran interés en la categorización de estos polinomios y ofrece una visión más profunda de sus propiedades topológicas y algebraicas. En este trabajo, revisamos dos prominentes invariantes polinómicos: el Alexander-Conway y el bracket, y nos enfocamos específicamente en los polinomios asociados con la familia de enlaces pretzel de tres hebras P(1, 1, n)","Nudos y enlaces, enlaces pretzel, polinomio de AlexanderConway, polinomio bracket. 1",marcadores,tudy in knot theory from the pioneer alexander polynomial the revolutionary jones polynomial to the collectively discovered homflypt polynomial,invariant polinomic constituyen area dinamica esencial estudio teoria nudos desde polinomio alexander revolucionario polinomio jones hasta polinomio homflypt descubierto colectiva mencionar solo algun estas expresion algebraic han sido fundamental comprension nudos enlac aun mas reciente introduccion homologia khovanov ha despertado e-mail aalan hernandez upr edu bgabrielmontoyavega gmail com received 28 april 2025 accepted 11 october 2025 to cite this article hernandez-flor and montoya-vega alexander-conway and bracket polynomials of family of pretzel links rev integr temas mat 43 2025 no 27-43 doi 10 18273 revint v43n2-2025003 27 28 hernandez-flor montoya-vega gran inter categorizacion estos polinomi ofrece vision mas profunda sus propiedad topologic algebraic este trabajo revisam dos prominent invariant polinomic alexander-conway bracket nos enfocam especifica polinomi asociad familia enlac pretzel tres hebr,nudos enlac enlac pretzel polinomio alexanderconway polinomio bracket,tudy in knot theory from the pioneer alexander polynomial the revolutionary jones polynomial to the collectively discovered homflypt polynomial invariant polinomic constituyen area dinamica esencial estudio teoria nudos desde polinomio alexander revolucionario polinomio jones hasta polinomio homflypt descubierto colectiva mencionar solo algun estas expresion algebraic han sido fundamental comprension nudos enlac aun mas reciente introduccion homologia khovanov ha despertado e-mail aalan hernandez upr edu bgabrielmontoyavega gmail com received 28 april 2025 accepted 11 october 2025 to cite this article hernandez-flor and montoya-vega alexander-conway and bracket polynomials of family of pretzel links rev integr temas mat 43 2025 no 27-43 doi 10 18273 revint v43n2-2025003 27 28 hernandez-flor montoya-vega gran inter categorizacion estos polinomi ofrece vision mas profunda sus propiedad topologic algebraic este trabajo revisam dos prominent invariant polinomic alexander-conway bracket nos enfocam especifica polinomi asociad familia enlac pretzel tres hebr nudos enlac enlac pretzel polinomio alexanderconway polinomio bracket,1.0.0,9276265f08a4b2c1
0120-419X,"Una+nota+sobre+“contractibilidad”,+“contractibilidad+con+respecto+a”+y+“contractibilidad+en”.pdf","Una+nota+sobre+“contractibilidad”,+“contractibilidad+con+respecto+a”+y+“contractibilidad+en”_0",en,Revista Integración,"In this article, we present a comparative study of the concepts of contractibility, contractibility with respect to, and contractibility in, applied in topological spaces and in hyperspaces of continua. The aim is to clarify and correct certain statements that appear in some works where these terms are used, either because they contain inaccuracies or inconsistencies, or because they are employed in a manner different from their original introduction. Through this, we seek to clarify the distinctions between their definitions and to facilitate proper understanding for the reader","Contractibility, contractibility with respect to, contractibility in. MSC2020: 54C05, 54B20, 55P10. Una nota sobre “contractibilidad”, “contractibilidad con respecto a” y “contractibilidad en”",marcadores,revista integracion,article we present comparative study concept contractibility contractibility respect contractibility appli topological spac hyperspac continua aim clarify correct certain statement appear some work where these term used either because they contain inaccuraci inconsistenci because they employ manner different their original introduction through we seek clarify distinction between their definition facilitate proper understand reader,contractibility contractibility respect contractibility msc2020 54c05 54b20 55p10 una nota sobre contractibilidad contractibilidad con respecto contractibilidad en,revista integracion article we present comparative study concept contractibility contractibility respect contractibility appli topological spac hyperspac continua aim clarify correct certain statement appear some work where these term used either because they contain inaccuraci inconsistenci because they employ manner different their original introduction through we seek clarify distinction between their definition facilitate proper understand reader contractibility contractibility respect contractibility msc2020 54c05 54b20 55p10 una nota sobre contractibilidad contractibilidad con respecto contractibilidad en,1.0.0,d602967e788cdd5d
0120-419X,"Una+nota+sobre+“contractibilidad”,+“contractibilidad+con+respecto+a”+y+“contractibilidad+en”.pdf","Una+nota+sobre+“contractibilidad”,+“contractibilidad+con+respecto+a”+y+“contractibilidad+en”_0",es,"do Orozco-Zitli d,","En este artículo presentamos, entre otras cosas, un estudio comparativo entre los conceptos de contractibilidad, contractibilidad con respecto a y contractibilidad en, aplicados tanto en espacios topológicos como en hiperespacios de continuos. Uno de los objetivos es precisar y corregir ciertas afirmaciones que aparecen en algunos trabajos donde estos términos se utilizan, ya sea porque presentan imprecisiones, inconsistencias o porque se emplean 0 E-mail: fcapulin@gmail.com a , dmayae@uaemex.mx b, acsierrac@uaemex.mx c, forozcozitli@gmail.com d. Received: 1 December 2025, Accepted: 16 April 2026. To cite this article: F. Capulín, D. Maya, A.C. Sierra-Cuevas y F. Orozco-Zitli, A note regarding “contractibility”, “contractibility with respect to” and “contractibility in”, Rev. Integr. Temas Mat., 44 (2026), No. 1, 17-33. doi: 10.18273/revint.v44n1-2026003 17 18 F. Capulín, D. Maya, A.C. Sierra-Cuevas & F. Orozco-Zitli de manera distinta a como fueron introducidos originalmente. Con ello buscamos clarificar las diferencias entre sus definiciones y facilitar al lector una comprensión adecuada durante la lectura","Contractibilidad, contractibilidad con respecto a, contractibilidad en. 1",marcadores,do orozco-zitli,este articulo presentam entre otras cosas estudio comparativo entre concept contractibilidad contractibilidad respecto contractibilidad aplicad tanto espaci topologic como hiperespaci continu uno objetiv precisar corregir ciert afirm aparecen algun trabaj donde estos termin utilizan ya sea porque presentan imprecision inconsistenci porque emplean e-mail fcapulin gmail com dmayae uaemex mx acsierrac uaemex mx forozcozitli gmail com received december 2025 accepted 16 april 2026 to cite this article capulin maya sierra-cuev orozco-zitli