0121-4705,2_FalsBorda_ok.pdf,2_FalsBorda_ok_0,en,ticipativa y su,"The purpose of this article is to narrate a significant experience of participatory action research and its impact on reality, which took place at the IEPRI and other settings in recent years. To this end, the article analyses the work led by Fals Borda on spatial organization in Colombia. Drawing on a history of the present, it details how issues of territorial organization were analyzed and the proposals formulated to resolve them. It is argued that the activities carried out helped to guide processes of territorial reorganization, shape public debate, influence territorial law, social movements and regional research centers, as well as strengthening geographies of origin and state planning","Fals Borda; IEPRI; Participatory action research; Spatial organization Fecha de recepción: 28/03/2026 Fecha de aprobación: 15/05/2026 Miguel Borja [32] FALS BORDA: TRAVESÍA POR EL IEPRI. PEREGRINACIÓN TRAS UN NUEVO ORDENAMIENTO TERRITORIAL PARA COLOMBIA análisis político n.º 112, Bogotá, enero-junio de 2026, pp. 31-47",marcadores,ticipativa su,purpose article narrate significant experience participatory action research its impact reality which took place iepri other setting recent year end article analys work led fals borda spatial organ colombia draw history present detail how issu territorial organ analyz proposal formulat resolve them argu activiti carri out help guide process territorial reorgan shape public debate influence territorial law social movement regional research center well strengthen geographi origin state plann,fals borda iepri participatory action research spatial organ fecha de recepcion 28 03 2026 fecha de aprobacion 15 05 2026 miguel borja 32 fals borda travesia por el iepri peregrinacion tras un nuevo ordenamiento territorial para colombia analisi politico 112 bogota enero-junio de 2026 pp 31-47,ticipativa su purpose article narrate significant experience participatory action research its