0121-4705,8_Mapeo_ok.pdf,8_Mapeo_ok_0,en,"nvergen campos como la teoría política, las relaciones internacionales,","This article aims to identify and analyze the central themes, most relevant contributions, and research agendas that have shaped the scholarly interest of the journal Análisis Político throughout its history. Through scientific mapping and clustering techniques, six major lines of inquiry were identified that structure the journal’s intellectual output and illustrate the evolution of its analytical concerns. This process allows us to affirm that the journal has evolved toward a broader and more interdisciplinary horizon, where fields such as political theory, international relations, sociology, communication, and cultural studies converge; incorporating new areas of inquiry such as political violence and peace processes, memory and transitional justice, citizenship and democratic legitimacy in Latin America, foreign policy and geopolitics, political communication and digital participation, as well as human rights and social mobility. Beyond serving as a window for monitoring political changes in the region, the publication has been key to promoting research agendas that connect global debates with the prevailing realities in the Latin American context. Mario Hernán López, Pedro Duque, Juan Carlos Yepes [150] MAPEO CIENTÍFICO DE LA REVISTA ANÁLISIS POLÍTICO (1996–2025): ENFOQUES, EJES TEMÁTICOS Y AGENDAS DE INVESTIGACIÓN análisis político n.º 112, Bogotá, enero-junio de 2026, pp. 149-173",Scientific mapping; Armed conflict; Peace processes; Democracy; Geopolitics. Fecha de recepción: 29/01/2026 Fecha de aprobación: 27/04/2026,marcadores,nvergen campo como la teoria politica las relacion internacional,article aims identify analyze central them most relevant contribution research agenda have shap scholarly interest journal analisi politico throughout its history through scientific mapp cluster techniqu six major line inquiry identifi structure journal intellectual output illustrate evolution its analytical concern proces allow us affirm journal has evolv toward broader more interdisciplinary horizon where field such political theory international relation sociology communication cultural studi converge incorporat new area inquiry such political violence peace process memory transitional justice citizenship democratic legitimacy latin america foreign policy geopolitic political communication digital participation well human right social mobility beyond serv window monitor political chang region publication has been key promot research agenda connect global debat prevail realiti latin american context mario hernan lopez pedro duque juan carlo yepe 150 mapeo cientifico de la revista analisi politico 1996-2025 enfoqu ejes tematico agenda de investigacion analisi politico 112 bogota enero-junio de 2026 pp 149-173,scientific mapp armed conflict peace process democracy geopolitic fecha de recepcion 29 01 2026 fecha de aprobacion 27 04 2026,nvergen campo como la teoria politica las relacion internacional article aims identify analyze central them most relevant contribution research agenda have shap scholarly interest journal analisi politico throughout its history through scientific mapp cluster techniqu six major line inquiry identifi structure journal intellectual output illustrate evolution its analytical concern proces allow us affirm journal has evolv toward broader more interdisciplinary horizon where field such political theory international relation sociology communication cultural studi converge incorporat new area inquiry such political violence peace process memory transitional justice citizenship democratic legitimacy latin america foreign policy geopolitic political communication digital participation well human right social mobility beyond serv window monitor political chang region publication has been key promot research agenda connect global debat prevail realiti latin american context mario hernan lopez ped