0122-8803,312-150-PB.pdf,312-150-PB_6,en,"acceso a la propiedad en 1968. Apoyados por movimientos sociales, políticos y culturales, los aparceros transformaron los latifundios en explotaciones campesinas, recibiendo","In the Catalan agrarian structure, the ecclesiastical latifundia of Lleida are a rarity, persisting after the confiscations and being worked by sharecroppers. The inefficient management of the beneficiaries, owners of these lands, contrasted with the efforts of the peasants to improve them, generating a historical awareness that culminated in their access to ownership in 1968. Supported by social, political, and cultural movements, the sharecroppers transformed the large estates into peasant farms, receiving compensation for improvements made. This change fostered technological innovation in agriculture and raised the living conditions of the peasantry","Ecclesiastical latifundia, Sharecropping, Peasant property, Historical consciousness, Lleida (Catalonia), 1960s, Agricultural innovation, Social movements Transição dos meeiros para a propriedade dos latifúndios eclesiásticos em Lleida (Catalunha) durante os anos 1960: luta, contexto e transformação",marcadores,acceso la propiedad en 1968 apoyado por movimiento social politico cultural los aparcero transformaron los latifundio en explotacion campesina recibiendo,catalan agrarian structure ecclesiastical latifundia lleida rarity persist after confisc being work sharecropper inefficient management beneficiari owner these land contrast effort peasant improve them generat historical awarenes culminat their acces ownership 1968 support social political cultural movement sharecropper transform large estat into peasant farm receiv compensation improvement made change foster technological innovation agriculture rais living condition peasantry,ecclesiastical latifundia sharecropp peasant property historical consciousnes lleida catalonia 1960s agricultural innovation social movement transicao dos meeiro para pro