0123-5362,04-16048-RevEconomiaUR-28-1_LCaravaggio.pdf,04-16048-RevEconomiaUR-28-1_LCaravaggio_0,en,a una asociación negativa entre la,"The relationship between local income inequality and subjective well-being in Latin America is analyzed. To do this, daytime satellite images and the average happiness level of a set of more than one thousand urban agglomerations in the region were studied. Objective patterns of visual heterogeneity are extracted from the images using deep neural networks, and an inequality indicator around the selected centroid is computed from them. This inequality indicator offers certain advantages over traditional objective indicators (granularity and periodicity) and subjective indicators (scalability, consistency, and accuracy). A statistically significant negative correlation is found between these objective inequality indicators and the subjective happiness measure. This relationship is particularly strong for images with an approximate radius of 10 kilometers, suggesting that this spatial scale more closely captures the local environments in which social comparisons are formed. Moreover, a negative association between inequality and subjective well-being is observed across the entire distribution: urban areas with higher levels of inequality tend to report, on average, lower levels of happiness","happiness; well-being; inequality; social cohesion. jel Codes: D63, I14, I31, O54, Z13. Desigualdade de renda local e bem-estar subjetivo na América Latina",marcadores,una asociacion negativa entre la,relationship between local income inequality subjective well-be latin america analyz do daytime satellite imag average happines level set more than one thousand urban agglomer region studi objective pattern visual heterogeneity extract imag using deep neural network inequality indicator around select centroid comput them inequality indicator offer certain advantag over traditional objective indicator granularity periodicity subjective indicator scalability consistency accuracy statistically significant negative correlation found between these objective inequality indicator subjective happines measure relationship particularly strong imag approximate radiu 10 kilometer suggest spatial scale more closely captur local environment which social comparison form moreover negative association between inequality subjective well-be observ acros entire distribution urban area higher level inequality tend report average lower level happines,happines well-be inequality social cohesion jel code d63 i14 i31 o54 z13 desigualdade de renda local bem-estar subjetivo na america latina,una asociacion negativa entre la relationship between local income inequality subjective well-be latin america analyz do daytime satellite imag average happines level set more than one thousand urban agglomer region studi objective pattern visual heterogeneity extract imag using deep neural network inequality indicator around select centroid comput them inequality indicator offer certain advantag over traditional objective indicator granularity periodicity subjective indicator scalability consistency accuracy statistically significant negative correlation found between these objective inequality indicator subjective happines measure relationship particularly strong imag approximate radiu 10 kilometer suggest spatial scale more closely captur local environment which social comparison form moreover negative association between inequality subjective well-be observ acros entire distribution urban area higher level inequality tend report average lower level happines happines well-be inequality social cohesion jel code d63 i14 i31 o54 z13 desigualdade de renda local bem-estar subjetivo na america latina,1.0.0,ee1e12a04e7416d8
0123-5362,15853_final+g.pdf,15853_final+g_0,es,ipp como indicador anticipado del ipc,"La transmisión de costos de producción hacia la inflación al consumidor es fundamental para una política monetaria anticipada. Este estudio examina si el índice de precios al productor (ipp) puede ser un buen predictor de índice de precios al consumidor (ipc) en Colombia. Para esto, se desarrolló un modelo var-garch con datos mensuales del periodo 2000-2025. Los resultados confirman que el ipp causa unidireccionalmente al ipc, concentrando 66-78 % del efecto en el primer mes. El ipp anticipa movimientos del ipc con ventana de 1.0-1.5 meses. La persistencia extrema de volatilidad —igarch en cinco series— indica efectos duraderos de los choques de costos","índice de precios al productor; índice de precios al consumidor; inflación; modelo var-garch; Colombia. Clasificación JEL: E31, E37, C32, C58. * Contacto de correspondencia. Universidad Jorge Tadeo Lozano. orcid: https:// orcid.org/0000-0003-4652-5649. Correo electrónico: edgarr.jimenezm@utadeo.edu.co † Universidad Jorge Tadeo Lozano. orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3492-7282 Correo elec",marcadores,ipp como indicador anticipado ipc,transmision cost produccion hacia inflacion consumidor fundamental politica monetaria anticipada este estudio examina si indice preci productor ipp puede ser buen predictor indice preci consumidor ipc colombia esto desarrollo modelo var-garch datos mensual periodo 2000-2025 resultad confirman ipp causa unidireccional ipc concentr 66-78 efecto primer mes ipp anticipa movimient ipc ventana 0-1 meses persistencia extrema volatilidad --igarch cinco series-- indica efect durader choqu cost,indice preci productor indice preci consumidor inflacion modelo var-garch colombia clasificacion jel e31 e37 c32 c58 contacto correspondencia universidad jorge tadeo lozano orcid https orcid org 0000-0003-4652-5649 correo electronico edgarr jimenezm utadeo edu co universidad jorge tadeo lozano orcid https orcid org 0009