acion 28 febrero 2025 fecha publicacion 30 junio 2025 doi https doi org 10 18041 0124-0021 dialog 62 12330 tribunal funcion control garanti vigilante justicia transicional tribunal funcion control garanti vigilante justicia transicional como citar anaya mogollon torrenegra 2025 tribunal funcion control garanti vigilante justicia transicional revista dialog saber 62 93-116 https doi org 10 18041 0124-0021 dialog 62 12330 este articulo resultado proyecto investigacion financiado universidad cooperativa colombia magister derecho penal universidad libre bogota profesora derecho vinculada grupo investigacion constexto psicojuridico universidad cooperativa colombia campus monteria colombia orcid https orcid org 0000-00034863-9156 cvlac https scienti mincienci gov co cvlac visualizador generarcurriculocv do cod_rh 0001418265 google scholar https scholar google com citations user a-b1x8waaaaj hl correo electronico liliana anayac campusucc edu co magister in desarrollo economico territorial profesora investigadora derecho vinculada grupo investigacion constexto psicojuridico universidad cooperativa colombia campus monteria colombia orcid https orcid org 0000-00034043-7891 cvlac https scienti mincienci gov co cvlac visualizador generarcurriculocv do cod_rh 0001463871 gruplac https scienti colcienci gov co gruplac jsp visualiza visualizagr jsp nro 00000000013695 google scholar https scholar goo gle com citations user knlw-icaaaaj hl oi ao correo electronico nuby mogollona campusucc edu co magister derecho profesor facultad derecho vinculada grupo investigacion constexto psicojuridico uni versidad cooperativa colombia campus monteria colombia orcid https orcid org 0000-0002-2997-6184 cvlac https scienti mincienci gov co cvlac visualizador generarcurriculocv do cod_rh 0001562895 google scholar https scholar google com citations user f1pogriaaaaj hl oi ao correo electronico josed torrenegra campusucc edu co adem evidencio existencia estos tribunal resulta fundamental garantizar cre dibilidad legitimidad proces justicia transicional elaboracion este articulo fue necesario emplear instrument diagnostico precis cual permitieron obtener vision mas clara durante desarrollo labor investigativa consecucion objetiv inicial plantead datos recopilaron mediante investigacion tipo descriptivo culmino elaboracion documento solida estructurado argumentado orientado clarificar dudas relacionad tema objeto estudio tribunal control garanti justicia transicional,1.0.0,a678a6a8fc2eaacb
0124-0021,Dialnet-ElTribunalConFuncionDeControlDeGarantias-10731237.pdf,Dialnet-ElTribunalConFuncionDeControlDeGarantias-10731237_0,en,"Además, se evidenció que la existencia de estos tribunales resulta fundamental para garantizar la cre","This article analyzes the crucial role played by courts with the function of judicial oversight in tran sitional justice processes. It examines how these judicial bodies act as guarantors of the human rights of victims, ensuring that proceedings are conducted fairly, impartial and transparently. Furthermore, it explores the challenges these courts in complex and polarized contexts, as well as the strategies they can adopt to overcome such difficulties and contribute to the construction of lasting peace. The research concludes that the court with the function of judicial oversight plays an essential role in the protecting human rights and building effective transitional justice by acting as a guardian of lega lity and a guarantor of procedural impartiality. Additionally, it was found that the existence of these court is fundamental to ensuring the credibility and legitimacy of the transitional justice processes. For the development of this article, precise diagnostic instruments were employed, which provided a clearer understanding during the research process and the achievement of the initially proposed and the achievement of the initially proposed objectives. Data were collected through a descriptive re search approach, resulting in a well-structured and well-argued document aimed at clarifying doubts related to the subject under study","Court, Control, Guarantees and transitional justice. 1",marcadores,adema se evidencio que la existencia de esto tribunal resulta fundamental para garantizar la cre,article analyz crucial role play court function judicial oversight tran sitional justice process examin how these judicial bodi act guarantor human right victim ensur proceeding conduct fairly impartial transparently furthermore explor challeng these court complex polariz context well strategi they can adopt overcome such difficulti contribute construction last peace research conclud court function judicial oversight play essential role protect human right build effective transitional justice acting guardian lega lity guarantor procedural impartiality additionally found existence these court fundamental ensur credibility legitimacy transitional justice process development article precise diagnostic instrument employ which provid clearer understand during research proces achievement initially propos achievement initially propos objectiv data collect through descriptive re search approach result well-structur well-argu document aimed clarify doubt relat subject under study,court control guarante transitional justice,adema se evidencio que la existencia de esto tribunal resulta fundamental para garantizar la cre article analyz crucial role play court function judicial oversight tran sitional justice process examin how these judicial bodi act guarantor human right victim ensur proceeding conduct fairly impartial transparently furthermore explor challeng these court complex polariz context well strategi they can adopt overcome such difficulti contribute construction last peace research conclud court function judicial oversight play essential role protect human right build effective transitional justice acting guardian lega lity guarantor procedural impartiality additionally found existence these court fundamental ensur credibility legitimacy transitional justice process development article precise diagnostic instrument employ which provid clearer understand during research proces achievement initially propos achievement initially propos objectiv data collect through descriptive re search approach result well-structur well-argu document aimed clarify doubt relat subject under study court control guarante transitional justice,1.0.0,972a6d1336392d52
0124-0021,Dialnet-LaExperienciaTeatral-10731238.pdf,Dialnet-LaExperienciaTeatral-10731238_0,es,LA EXPERIENCIA TEATRAL,"En la Poética, Aristóteles ubica a la representación teatral en un lugar secundario, pues el Estagirita considera, en su concepción sobre la tragedia perfecta, que si se encuentran todos los elementos debidamente ordenados que componen la tragedia, no es necesario verla para lograr su finalidad: catarsis y hamartía. La posición secundaria de la representación de la tragedia por parte de Aristóteles ha conllevado que los poemas de los autores de tragedia hayan sido estudiados de manera literaria, y, por tanto, se haya proliferado sus análisis y discusiones a partir del texto del poema y no de su representación. Por ello, el presente texto tiene la finalidad de reivindicar el carácter protagónico de la representación de la tragedia griega no solo desde una lectura propia de las obras, sino, además, porque la representación de la tragedia permite presentar ejercicios de imaginación para la representación de aquello que los poetas, en sentido de Aristóteles, hacen: contar lo que podría ser","experiencia estética, tragedia, verosimilitud, texto, representación, teatro",marcadores,experiencia teatral,poetica aristotel ubica representacion teatral lugar secundario pues estagirita considera concepcion sobre tragedia perfecta si encuentran todos element debida ordenad componen tragedia no necesario verla lograr finalidad catarsis hamartia posicion secundaria representacion tragedia parte aristotel ha conllevado poem autor tragedia hayan sido estudiad manera literaria tanto haya proliferado sus analisis discusion partir texto poema no representacion ello presente texto tiene finalidad reivindicar caracter protagonico representacion tragedia griega no solo desde lectura propia obras sino adem porque representacion tragedia permite presentar ejercici imaginacion representacion aquello poet sentido aristotel hacen contar podria ser,experiencia estetica tragedia verosimilitud texto representacion teatro,experiencia teatral poetica aristotel ubica representacion teatral lugar secundario pues estagirita considera concepcion sobre tragedia perfecta si encuentran todos element debida ordenad componen tragedia no necesario verla lograr finalidad catarsis hamartia posicion secundaria representacion tragedia parte aristotel ha conllevado poem autor tragedia hayan sido estudiad manera literaria tanto haya proliferado sus analisis discusion partir texto poema no representacion ello presente texto tiene finalidad reivindicar caracter protagonico representacion tragedia griega no solo desde lectura propia obras sino adem porque representacion tragedia permite presentar ejercici imaginacion representacion aquello poet sentido aristotel hacen contar podria ser experiencia estetica tragedia verosimilitud texto representacion teatro,1.0.0,e7dbfa97262786e2
0124-0021,Dialnet-LaExperienciaTeatral-10731238.pdf,Dialnet-LaExperienciaTeatral-10731238_0,en,"nte ordenados que componen la tragedia, no es necesario verla para lograr su finalidad:","In Poetics, Aristotle places theatrical representation in a secondary position, since the Stagirite considers, in his conception of the perfect tragedy, that if all the elements that make up tragedy are properly ordered, it is not necessary to see it in order to achieve its purpose: catharsis and hamartia. Aristotle's secondary position on the representation of tragedy has led to the poems of tragedy authors being studied in a literary manner, and, therefore, to a proliferation of analyses and discussions based on the text of the poem rather than its representation. For this reason, the present text aims to vindicate the leading role of the representation of Greek tragedy, not only from a reading of the works themselves, but also because the representation of tragedy allows for exercises of imagination to represent what poets, in Aristotle's sense, do: tell what could be","aesthetic experience, tragedy, verisimilitude, text, representation, theater. Open Access  Artículo producto del trabajo investigativo y de reflexión sobre el referido tema.  Abogado, especialista en derecho constitucional de la Universidad Externado de Colombia, magister en Filosofía y candidato a magíster en Historia de la Universidad Javeriana. Profesor del área de derecho públi",marcadores,nte ordenado que componen la tragedia no es necesario verla para lograr su finalidad,poetic aristotle plac theatrical representation secondary position since stagirite consider his conception perfect tragedy if all element make up tragedy properly order not necessary see order achieve its purpose catharsi hamartia aristotle secondary position representation tragedy has led poem tragedy author being studi literary manner therefore proliferation analys discussion based text poem rather than its representation reason present 