0124-5821,Art.+10.pdf,Art.+10_0,en,"ón, estrategias didácticas y análisis de datos. La configuración de estas","Research training in higher education constitutes a fundamental pillar for the construction of knowledge across professional degree programmes. This qualitative-interpretive study, based on a multiple-case design, analysed the pedagogical content knowledge (PCK) for research of 18 lecturers working in Physical Education and Sport teacher-education programmes in the city of Medellín, Colombia. Eighteen semi-structured interviews were carried out and examined from an interpretive approach. The findings reveal that PCK for research is configured as a systemic structure composed of seven interrelated categories, namely knowledge of research content, disciplinary field, curriculum, context, assessment, teaching strategies and data analysis. The Conocimiento didáctico | Revista Virtual Universidad Católica del Norte, 79, 275-309 ISSN: 0124-5821 (En línea) Conocimiento didáctico 277 configuration of these categories varies significantly according to each institution's mission-driven orientation, which conditions the didactic transposition of the theoretical and practical content of research. It is concluded that PCK operates as an indispensable metacognitive framework through which university teachers transform expert and complex knowledge into teachable and meaningful knowledge. Finally, strengthening this structure is imperative in order to professionalise the teaching of research, foster critical thinking in future physical education teachers and reinforce the scientific identity of the discipline within academia",Pedagogical content knowledge; Physical education; Higher education; Teacher education; Researcher training; Educational research,marcadores,estrategia didactica analisi de dato la configuracion de esta,research train higher education constitut fundamental pillar construction knowledge acros professional degree programm qualitative-interpretive study based multiple-case design analys pedagogical content knowledge pck research 18 lecturer work physical education sport teacher-education programm city medellin colombia eighteen semi-structur interview carri out examin interpretive approach finding reveal pck research configur systemic structure compos seven interrelat categori namely knowledge research content disciplinary field curriculum context assessment teach strategi data analysi conocimiento didactico revista virtual universidad catolica del norte 79 275-309 issn 0124-5821 en linea conocimiento didactico 277 configuration these categori vari significantly accord each institution mission-driven orientation which condition didactic transposition theoretical practical content research conclud pck operat indispensable metacognitive framework through which university teacher transform expert complex knowledge into teachable meaningful knowledge finally strengthen structure imperative order professionalise teach research foster critical think future physical education teacher reinforce scientific identity discipline within academia,pedagogical content knowledge physical education higher education teacher education researcher train educational research,estrategia didactica analisi de dato la configuracion de esta research train higher education constitut fundamental pillar construction knowledge acros professional degree programm qualitative-interpretive study based multiple-case design analys pedagogical content knowledge pck research 18 lecturer work physical education sport teacher-education programm city medellin colombia eighteen semi-structur interview carri out examin interpretive approach finding reveal pck research configur systemic structure compos seven interrelat categori namely knowledge research content disciplinary field curriculum context assessment teach strategi data analysi conocimiento didactico revista virtual universidad catolica del norte 79 275-309 issn 0124-5821 en linea conocimiento didac