1657-463X,Di†logos+entre+la+econom°a+solidaria+y+las+nuevas+ruralidades.pdf,Di†logos+entre+la+econom°a+solidaria+y+las+nuevas+ruralidades_0,en,as y emergentes desde,"This study aims to analyse the dialogues between the Solidarity Economy and New Rurality, considering them integrated strategies to promote sustainable development in rural environments. The methodology used in this research is qualitative and is divided into two complementary methods. First, search equations were used through analytical category bibliometric. Secondly, an exhaustive documentary review is carried out through a triangulation between analytical and emerging categories from the PRISMA method. The main conclusion is that the confluence between the Solidarity Economy and the New rurality creates a favourable space for integrated strategies that promote sustainable development in rural communities. Adopting agro ecological practices, precision technologies and strengthening local markets benefits producers and promotes equity, resilience and environmental conservation. This integrated approach addresses socioeconomic and environmental challenges, to contribute to fairer and more sustainable rural development for the future","collective economy, rural economy, economic and social development, sustainable development. No. 21 enero – diciembre de 2023 - ISSN 1657-463X - e-ISSN: 2389-9638 pp. 1 - 20 4 Cultura Científica ""Las Nuevas Ruralidades buscan identificar estos desafíos y aprovechar las oportunidades emergentes para crear comunidades rurales más dinámicas y sostenibles"" 1",marcadores,emergent desde,study aims analyse dialogu between solidarity economy new rurality consider them integrat strategi promote sustainable development rural environment methodology used research qualitative divid into two complementary method first search equation used through analytical category bibliometric secondly exhaustive documentary review carri out through triangulation between analytical emerg categori 