1657-4702,01_7109_RLB+26(1)+(2).pdf,01_7109_RLB+26(1)+(2)_0,en,clave en la satisfacción sexual. En el análisis cualitativo emergen dos posturas principales: una que,"This article analyzes beliefs and practices surrounding sexuality in adults aged 35 to 55 years, from a personalist bioethical perspective. This population has been scarcely explored from this approach; despite the multiple challenges and transformations it faces during this life stage. A mixed-methods study was developed, collecting data through an online survey administered to 201 individuals and in-depth interviews conducted with four intentionally selected participants. The study was carried out in the metropolitan area of Valle de Aburrá, Colombia, using a non-probabilistic self-selection sampling method. Quantitative results show that adults value sexuality as a space for affection, communication, and physical-emotional well-being, highlighting mutual respect and health as key factors in sexual satisfaction. The qualitative analysis reveals two main positions: one that prioritizes individual freedom and bodily pleasure, challenging traditional norms regarding partnership; and another that values commitment, fidelity, and pleasure as expressions of love and meaning. From a personalist bioethical perspective, these positions are interpreted as expressions of the principle of human dignity and the need to integrate affectivity, corporeality, and responsibility. The study proposes developing sex education strategies aimed at this population that recognize the diversity of experiences, risks, and meanings that shape sexuality in adulthood",Sexuality; social practices; cultural beliefs; bioethics; adults. Análise da Sexualidade em Adultos sob uma Perspectiva Personalista,marcadores,clave en la satisfaccion sexual en el analisi cualitativo emergen dos postura principal una que,article analyz belief practic surround sexuality adult aged 35 55 year personalist bioethical perspective population has been sca