1657-4702,06_8027_RLB+26(1)+(3).pdf,06_8027_RLB+26(1)+(3)_0,en,a la beneficencia. Los médicos de cuidados intensivos y de urgencias deben conocer cómo aplicar el,"The formulation of the principle of double effect and its application have been the subject of intense debate in recent years, due to a history of misunderstandings or incorrect applications in the clinical field. Bioethics plays a significant role in moral decision-making due to its connection to human behavior, principles, and values in the realms of life and health, as well as the application of the principle of double effect: in every medical act where the moral agent is compelled to act, the viable solution presents, simultaneously, a positive effect and one contrary to beneficence. Intensive care and emergency physicians must understand how to apply the principle of double effect in the medical act of orotracheal intubation and mechanical ventilation in special situations of advanced chronic pathologies that present as acute respiratory failure. To this end, a non-systematic review was conducted in PubMed and Google Scholar, as well as in the Bioéticaweb and Bioéticawiki search engines, to determine how to explain the principles of double effect, therapeutic proportionality, and autonomy",Bioethics; orotracheal intubation; principle of double effect; advanced illness; acute respiratory failure; proportionality; autonomy. Bioética e o Princípio do Duplo Efeito no Ato Médico de Intubação Orotraqueal em Situações Especiais,marcadores,la beneficencia los medico de cuidado intensivo de urgencia deben conocer como aplicar el,formulation principle double effect its application have been subject intense debate recent year due history misunderstanding incorrect applic clinical field bioethic play significant role moral decision-mak due its connection human behavior principl valu realm life health well application principle double effect every medical act where moral agent compell act viable solution present s