1657-7663,"mprada,+a13v8n2.pdf","mprada,+a13v8n2_0",en,Resumen─ El artículo presenta una propuesta de herramientas,"─ We presented a proposal of lean manufacturing tools applied to software development within the framework of agile methods, in particular Lean Software Development; this will enable development teams to obtain a systemic quality of the software (product, process and people involved). We recommend using these tools and constantly evaluate with the implementation of iterative and incremental quality cycle proposed by Deming: Plan, Do, Check and Act. This proposal contributes to the development of quality software projects on scientific-academic environments, tight the scheduled time and budgeted resources, using own tools of engineering","─ Lean software development, Software quality, Agile",marcadores,resumen- el articulo presenta una propuesta de herramienta,we present proposal lean manufactur tool appli software development within framework agile method particular lean software development will enable development team obtain systemic quality software product proces people involv we recommend using these tool constantly evaluate implementation iterative incremental quality cycle propos deming plan do check act proposal contribut development quality software project scientific-academic environment tight schedul time budget resourc using own tool engineer,lean software development software quality agile,resumen- el articulo presenta una propuesta de herramienta we present proposal lean manufactur tool appli software development within framework agile method particular lean software development will enable development team obtain systemic quality software product proces people involv we recommend using these tool constantly evaluate implementation iterative incremental quality cycle propos deming plan do check act proposal contribut development quality software project scientific-academic environment tight schedul time budget resourc using own tool engin