1692-5238,"joseignacio,+16.47.4+(VF).pdf","joseignacio,+16.47.4+(VF)_0",es,groups and the electric substation of the “Cayo Santa María” isolated electrics y stem,"En la sociedad actual, la monitorización y el con trol de todo proceso industrial son requisitos indispensables para lograr una eficiente productividad. Este trabajo se enmarca en la implementación de un Sistema de Control Supervisorio y Ad quisición de Datos [SCADA] que integra los grupos de genera ción y la subestación eléctrica del sistema eléctrico aislado Cayo Santa María (Cuba). Para su diseño se utilizó la plataforma de desarrollo Eros v.5.9 y para la adquisición de las variables de campo: el protocolo Modbus y el estándar OPC. Como parte de este sistema se diseñó también la red de comunicaciones entre los objetivos tecnológicos a nivel físico, se configuró un sistema de reportes con las mediciones más significativas y se codificó un cliente web para la monitorización de los parámetros del SCADA desde la red corporativa. La solución obtenida supone un ahorro económico considerable, satisface los requerimientos funcionales y de operación preestablecidos, y brinda una elevada flexibilidad frente a modificaciones futuras","SCADA; Eros; Modbus; OPC; Cliente Web. Sistemas SCADA e cliente Web para a supervisão do sistema elétrico iso lado ""Cayo Santa María""",marcadores,groups and the electric substation of the cayo santa maria isolated electrics stem,sociedad actual monitorizacion trol todo proceso industrial son requisit indispensabl lograr eficiente productividad este trabajo enmarca implementacion sistema control supervisorio ad quisicion datos scada integra grup genera cion subestacion electrica sistema electrico aislado cayo santa maria cuba diseno utilizo plataforma desarrollo eros adquisicion variabl campo protocolo modbus estandar opc como parte este sistema diseno tambien red comunic entre objetiv tecnologic nivel fisico configuro sistema report medicion mas significativ codifico cliente web monitorizacion parametr scada desde red corporativa solucion obtenida supone ahorro economico considerable satisface requer funcional operacion preestablecid brinda elevada flexibilidad frente modific futur,scada eros modbus opc cliente web sistem scada cliente web supervisao do sistema eletrico iso lado cayo santa maria,groups and the electric substation of the cayo santa maria isolated electrics stem sociedad actual monitorizacion trol todo proceso industrial son requisit indispensabl lograr eficiente productividad este trabajo enmarca implementacion sistema control supervisorio ad quisicion datos scada integra grup genera cion subestacion electrica sistema electrico aislado cayo santa maria cuba diseno utilizo plataforma desarrollo eros adquisicion variabl campo protocolo modbus estandar opc como parte este sistema diseno tambien red comunic entre objetiv tecnologic nivel fisico configuro sistema report medicion mas significativ codifico cliente web monitorizacion parametr scada desde red corporativa solucion obtenida supone ahorro economico considerable satisface requer funcional operacion preestablecid brinda elevada flexibilidad frente modific futur scada eros modbus opc cliente web sistem scada cliente web supervisao do sistema eletrico iso lado cayo santa maria,1.0.0,873dddd717179802
1692-5777,173-129-PB.pdf,173-129-PB_0,en,bears full responsibility for,"Lexical chunks are essential for fluent language use, yet many EFL learners struggle to notice them in authentic input. This study investigated the effectiveness of a ChatGPT-aided chunking approach designed to enhance learners’ awareness of lexical chunks through explicit instruction and contextualized noticing activities. Seventy first-year Chinese EFL learners participated in a 13-week intervention integrated into a College English course, with complete data obtained from 62 students for statistical analysis. Using a one-group pretest–posttest design, learners completed chunk-recognition tasks before and after the intervention, followed by a language proficiency test and a perception questionnaire. Results showed a significant increase in the mean number of chunks recognized, from 11.39 (SD = 7.19) in the pretest to 20.81 (SD = 8.17) in the posttest, t(61) = −11.96, p < .001. Chunk recognition ability was also positively correlated with overall English proficiency, r(60) = .618, p < .001. Questionnaire results indicated that learners perceived the approach positively and reported improvements in multiple language skills. Despite these gains, chunk recognition remained relatively limited, suggesting that noticing lexical chunks is a more challenging process than is often assumed. The findings highlight the importance of explicitly fostering chunk awareness and suggest that generative AI can serve as a valuable tool for supporting chunk-based instruction in EFL classrooms","lexical chunks, chunk recognition, chunk awareness, ChatGPT, EFL learners, Noticing Hypothesis",marcadores,bear full responsibility,lexical chunk essential fluent language use yet many efl learner struggle notice them authentic input study investigat effectivenes chatgpt-aid chunk approach design enhance learner awarenes lexical chunk through explicit instruction contextualiz notic activiti seventy first-year chinese efl learner participat 13-week intervention integrat into college english course complete data obtain 62 student statistical analysi using one-group pretest-posttest design learner complet chunk-recognition task before after intervention follow language proficiency test perception questionnaire result show significant increase mean number chunk recogniz 11 39 sd 19 pretest 20 81 sd 17 posttest 61 -11 96 001 chunk recognition ability also positively correlat overall english proficiency 60 618 001 questionnaire result indicat learner perceiv approach positively report improvement multiple language skill despite these gain chunk recognition remain relatively limit suggest notic lexical chunk more challeng proces than often assum finding highlight importance explicitly foster chunk awarenes suggest generative ai can serve valuable tool support chunk-bas instruction efl classroom,lexical chunk chunk recognition chunk awarenes chatgpt efl learner notic hypothesi,bear full responsibility lexical chunk essential fluent language use yet many efl learner struggle notice them authentic input study investigat effectivenes chatgpt-aid chunk approach design enhance learner awarenes lexical chunk through explicit instruction contextualiz notic activiti seventy first-year chinese efl learner participat 13-week intervention integrat into college english course complete data obtain 62 student statistical analysi using one-group pretest-posttest design learner complet chunk-recognition task before after intervention follow language proficiency test perception questionnaire result show significant increase mean number chunk recogniz 11 39 sd 19 pretest 20 81 sd 17 posttest 61 -11 96 001 chunk recognition ability also positively correlat overall english proficiency 60 618 001 questionnaire result indicat learner perceiv approach positively report improvement multiple language skill despite these gain chunk recognition remain relatively limit suggest notic lexical chunk more challeng proces tha