1692-6013,NOVUM+JUS+20-2+art+9+MAKIGN.pdf,NOVUM+JUS+20-2+art+9+MAKIGN_0,en,Making Mobility Work: The Impact of,"The 21st century brings along challenges in the urban landscape. This article examines the role of pedicabs, or bicitaxis, in Colombia as a crucial component of urban mobility and their contribution to achieving environmental sustainability in cities. As traffic congestion and pollution worsen in many Colombian urban centers, pedicabs provide an efficient, eco-friendly alternative to traditional transportation methods at a reasonable price. This paper explores how these bicitaxis align with Colombia’s environmental policies while providing transportation services to low- and middle-income sections of the city, thereby reducing overall carbon emissions. Using a comparative law approach, this paper assesses the economic and social impacts of pedicabs in other jurisdictions and the normative frameworks governing these services. Additionally, it analyzes the legal and regulatory frameworks governing pedicabs and proposes policy recommendations to enhance their role in creating greener, more resilient urban environments. It concludes that it is paramount to integrate pedicabs into broader urban planning strategies aimed at sustainable mobility and climate action in Colombia","pedicabs, mobility, regulation, environment, sustainability. https://doi.org/10.14718/NovumJus.2026.20.2.9 * Attorney. LL.M. in International Legal Studies from Georgetown University. Professor of International Law at the Universidad Católica de Colombia, Bogotá, Colombia. Email: lcgamarra@ucatolica.edu.co; Laura.gamarra.esq@ gmail.com. ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0823-6224. SCOPUS ID: 5",marcadores,making mobility work impact,21st century bring along challeng urban landscape article examin role pedicab bicitaxi colombia crucial component urban mobility their contribution achiev environmental sustainability citi traffic congestion pollution worsen many colombian urban center pedicab provide efficient eco-friendly alternative traditional transportation method reasonable price paper explor how these bicitaxi align colombia environmental polici while provid transportation servic low- middle-income section city thereby reduc overall carbon emission using comparative law approach paper assess economic social impact pedicab other jurisdiction normative framework govern these servic additionally analyz legal regulatory framework govern pedicab propos policy recommend enhance their role creat greener more resilient urban environment conclud paramount integrate pedicab into broader urban plann strategi aimed sustainable mobility climate action colombia,pedicab mobility regulation environment sustainability http doi org 10 14718 novumju 2026 20 attorney ll international legal studi georgetown university professor international law universidad catolica de colombia bogota colombia email lcgamarra ucatolica edu co laura gamarra esq gmail com orcid http orcid org 0000-0002-0823-6224 scopu id,making mobility work impact 21st century bring along challeng urban landscape article examin role pedicab bicitaxi colombia crucial component urban mobility their contribution achiev environmental sustainability citi traffic congestion pollution worsen many colombian urban center pedicab provide efficient eco-friendly alternative traditional transportation method reasonable price paper explor how these bicitaxi align colombia environmental polici while provid transportation servic low- middle-income section city thereby reduc overall carbon emission using comparative law approach paper assess economic social impact pedicab other jurisdiction normative framework govern these servic additionally analyz legal regulatory framework govern pedicab propos policy recommend enhance their role creat greener more resilient urban environment conclud paramount integrate pedicab into broader urban plann strategi aimed sustainable mobility climate action colombia pedicab mobility regulation environment sustainability http doi org 10 14718 novumju 2026 20 attorney ll international legal studi georgetown university professor international law universidad catolica de colombia bogota colombia email lcgamarra ucatolica edu co laura gamarra esq gmail com orcid http orcid org 0000-0002-0823-6224 scopu id,1.0.0,bdd47d2254a17e2d
1692-6013,NOVUM+JUS+20-2+art+9+MAKIGN.pdf,NOVUM+JUS+20-2+art+9+MAKIGN_0,es,cabs into broader urban planning strategies aimed at sustainable mobility and climate,"Este artículo examina el papel de los bicitaxis en Colombia como componente crucial de la movilidad urbana y su contribución a la sostenibilidad ambiental en las ciudades. A medida que la congestión del tráfico y la contaminación empeoran en muchos centros urbanos colombianos, los bicitaxis ofrecen una alternativa eficiente y ecológica a los métodos de transporte tradicionales a un precio razonable. Este artículo explora cómo los bicitaxis se alinean con las políticas ambientales de Colombia, al tiempo que brindan servicios de transporte a sectores de ingresos bajos y medios de la ciudad, lo que se traduce en una reducción de las emisiones de carbono en general. A través de un enfoque de derecho comparado, este artículo evalúa el impacto económico y social de los bicitaxis en otras jurisdicciones, así como el marco normativo aplicable a estos servicios. Además, analizamos los marcos legales y regulatorios que rigen los bicitaxis y proponemos recomendaciones de política pública para mejorar su papel en el fomento de entornos urbanos más verdes y resilientes. Este estudio subraya la importancia de integrar los bicitaxis en estrategias de planificación urbana más amplias orientadas a la movilidad sostenible y a la acción climática en Colombia",bicitaxis; movilidad; regulación; medio ambiente; sostenibilidad. https://doi.org/10.14718/NovumJus.2026.20.2.9 269 Making Mobility Work: The Impact of Pedicabs in Colombia and Their Role in Achieving Environmental Standards in Cities NOVUM JUS • ISSN: 1692-6013 • E-ISSN: 2500-8692 • Volumen 20 No. 2 • mayo-agosto 2026 • Págs. 267-289,marcadores,cabs into broader urban planning strategi aimed at sustainable mobility and climate,este articulo examina papel bicitaxis colombia como componente crucial movilidad urbana contribucion sostenibilidad ambiental ciudad medida conge