ldren with ADHD diagnosis was intended to be known, the presence of symptoms associated with this disorder in patients diagnosed with insufficient convergence and even clinical trials comparing changes in The results of this study were based on the results of a study conducted by the European Commission in March 1998. The results of this review lead to the conclusion that an association between ADHD and HF in children is evident, but not a causal relationship, studies on representative samples are therefore necessary","Eye motility disorders, convergence insufficiency, attention deficit and hyperactivity disorder, child behavioural disorders",marcadores,articulo en los que se pretendia conocer la funcion visual de los nino con diagnostico de tdah,children subject high demand visual task early age associat their school activiti can cause alter oculomotor system generat symptom sometim affect your school performance emotional state which lead closer study binocular vision disorder such convergence insufficiency ci child behavioral disorder they characteriz being persistent repetitive inappropriate such attention deficit hyperactivity disorder adhd objective review identify describe definition prevalence clinical sign symptomatology treatment convergence facultad de medicina programa de optometria universidad el bosque bogota colombia facultad de medicina programa de optometria universidad el bosque bogota colombia facultad de ciencia de la salud programa de optometria universidad de la salle bogota colombia facultad de medicina programa de optometria universidad el bosque bogota colombia cien tecnol salud vis ocul colombia vol 22 deg1 enero-junio de 2024 issn 1692-8415 issn-e 2389-8801 en linea http doi org 10 19052 sv vo22 iss1 online first esta revista incorpora la opcion online first mediante la cual las version definitiva de los trabajo aceptado son publicada en linea ante de iniciar el proceso de diseno de la revista impresa esta pendiente la asignacion del numer