1794-8932,S-1377.pdf,S-1377_0,en,"interculturalidad, prácticas educativas, pedagógica, ruralidad, territorio.","The research article explores about territorial and cultural meanings that build the teachers at primary school in territories of difference cultural, affair from as, analyze how the teachers position in circulation the cultural knowledge in their educational practices. The inquiring intends contribution the teachers training in intercultural perspective, from relation between their meanings of territory whit the scholar culture, also search revelated the understanding of interculturality that have the teacher in their vital and educative experience. To this end, we propose an undisciplined methodological posture, a frontier thinking that contributes to the construction of relevant and contextualized educational and pedagogical knowledge, therefore, it is assumed a collaborative action materialized through pedagogical social mapping, with semi-structured open interviews and word spirals, with primary school teachers from two institutions located in the Urabá region of Antioquia. The analysis of the information was carried out through the Territorio/Saberes/Escuela matrix. The findings and results show some relationships, tensions and articulations between the knowledge of the territory and the teachers' educational practices. Also, some of the teachers' meanings about interculturality are revealed from their territorial experiences, an issue that was assumed from their territorialized educational and cultural practices. It is concluded that educational practices are in tension and uncertainty in relation to cultural practices; likewise, interculturality is found as an action that is constructed daily","social cartography, teacher training, interculturality, educational practices, pedagogy, rurality, territory",marcadores,interculturalidad practica educativa pedagogica ruralidad territorio,research article explor about territorial cultural meaning build teacher primary school territori difference cultural affair analyze how teacher position circulation cultural knowledge their educational practic inquir intend contribution teacher train intercultural perspective relation between their meaning territory whit scholar culture also search revelat understand interculturality have teacher their vital educative experience end we propose undisciplin methodological posture frontier think contribut construction relevant contextualiz educational pedagogical knowledge therefore assum collaborative action materializ through pedagogical social mapp semi-structur open interview word spiral primary school teacher two institution locat uraba region antioquia analysi information carri out through territorio saber escuela matrix finding result show some relationship tension articul between knowledge territory teacher educational practic also some teacher meaning about interculturality reveal their territorial experienc issue assum their territorializ educational cultural practic conclud educational practic tension uncertainty relation cultural practic likewise interculturality found action construct daily,social cartography teacher train interculturality educational practic pedagogy rurality territory,interculturalidad practica educativa pedagogica ruralidad territorio research article explor about territorial cultural meaning build teacher primary school territori difference cultural affair analyze how teacher position circulation cultural knowledge their educational practic inquir intend contribution teacher train intercultural perspective relation between their meaning territory whit scholar culture also search revelat understand interculturality have teacher their vital educative experience end we propose undisciplin methodological posture frontier think contribut construction relevant contextualiz educational pedagogical knowledge therefore assum collaborative action materializ through pedagogical social mapp semi-structur open int