1794-8932,S-1530.pdf,S-1530_0,en,cticas ambientales.,"This article analyzes the social imaginaries surrounding environmental practices among students in cycle IV at the Santa Isabel Rural Educational Institution in Puerto Asís (Putumayo, Colombia). The study was conducted within a qualitative, critical, and interpretative paradigm, using a hermeneutic methodology based on the complementarity approach. Data were collected through in-depth interviews, focus groups, and document analysis, and were subsequently organized into institutional and social coordinates. Discourse analysis was structured around three language functions—referential, expressive, and pragmatic—enabling the identification of instituted, instituting, and radical social imaginaries. The findings reveal a strong presence of instituted imaginaries in institutional coordinates (educational community and environmental education classes), where normative and legitimized practices predominate. In contrast, social coordinates (waste management and final disposal of waste) show a higher recurrence of the pragmatic function, reflecting aspirations for transformation and critique of the established order. Emotional expressions identified through the expressive function suggest emerging processes of ecological subjectivation. It is concluded that school-based environmental practices are not solely the result of instructional processes but are shaped by complex symbolic tensions. In this context, social imaginaries offer a key lens through which to understand and transform environmental education from a situated, critical, and participatory perspective","complementarity, discourse functions, environmental education, environmental practices, social imaginaries. __________________________________________________________________________",marcadores,ctica ambiental,article analyz social imaginari surround environmental practic among student cycle iv santa isabel rural educational institution puerto asis putumayo colombia study conduct within qualitative critical interpretative paradigm using hermeneutic methodology based complementarity approach data collect through in-depth interview focu group document analysi subsequently organiz into institutional social coordinat discourse analysi structur around three language functions--referential expressive pragmatic--enabl identification institut institut radical social imaginari finding reveal strong presence institut imaginari institutional coordinat educational community environmental education class where normative legitimiz practic predominate contrast social coordinat waste management final disposal waste show higher recurrence pragmatic function reflect aspir transformation critique establish order emotional expression identifi through expressive function suggest emerg process ecological subjectivation conclud school-bas environmental practic not solely result instructional process but shap complex symbolic tension context social imaginari offer key lens through which understand transform environmental education situat critical participatory perspective,complementarity discourse function environmental education environmental practic social imaginari __________________________________________________________________________,ctica ambiental article analyz social imaginari surround environmental practic among student cycle iv santa isabel rural educational institution puerto asis putumayo colombia study conduct within qualitative critical interpretative paradigm using hermeneutic methodology based complementarity approach data collect through in-depth interview focu group document analysi subsequently organiz into institutional social coordinat discourse analysi structur around three language functions--referential expressive pragmatic--enabl identification institut institut radical social imaginari finding reveal strong presence institut imaginari institutional coordinat educational community environmental education class where normative legitimiz practic predominate contrast social coordinat waste management final disposal waste show higher recurrence pragmatic function reflect aspir transformation critique establish order emotional expression identifi through expressive function suggest emerg process ecological subjectivation conclud school-bas environmental practic not solely result instructional process but shap complex symbolic tension context social imaginari offer key lens through which understand transform environmental education situat critical participatory perspective complementarity discourse function environmental education environmental practic social imaginari __________________________________________________________________________,1.0.0,457d3266d67ae0d0
1794-8932,S-1549.pdf,S-1549_0,es,Revista Σοφία-SOPHIA,"Por el encargo social que las universidades poseen el currículo, se debe atemperar a la realidad circundante. En Cuba, por vez primera, encuentra respaldo legal la mediación familiar como método alternativo de solución de conflictos; sin embargo, dentro de los modos de actuación del Licenciado en Derecho no se incluye el perfil de mediador familiar. Por tanto, no se forma al estudiante para ello; se propuso una concepción didáctica con el objetivo de contribuir a la formación en mediación familiar del estudiante de Licenciatura en Derecho. La investigación en su conjunto, estuvo regida por el método dialectico materialista, el cual se concreta en la aplicación de los siguientes métodos por niveles: métodos del nivel teórico: el histórico-lógico, métodos del nivel empírico: la revisión de documentos. El resultado científico pedagógico que se obtiene, se presenta a partir de sus elementos estructurales: fundamentos, componentes teóricos y didácticos y orientaciones metodológicas. Finalmente, el proceso de transmisión-recepción de conocimientos, habilidades y valores descrito contribuyó a reforzar la importancia de incorporar el perfil profesional de mediador dentro de los modos de actuación del Licenciado en Derecho",educación; calidad de la educación; significación; organizaciones internacionales. ____________________________________________________________________________,marcadores,revista sophia-sophia,encargo social universidad poseen curriculo debe atemperar realidad circundante cuba vez primera encuentra respaldo legal mediacion familiar como metodo alternativo solucion conflict sin embargo dentro modos actuacion licenciado derecho no incluye perfil mediador familiar tanto no forma estudiante ello propuso concepcion didactica objetivo contribuir formacion mediacion familiar estudiante licenciatura derecho investigacion conjunto estuvo regida metodo dialectico materialista cual concreta aplicacion siguient m