1794-8932,S-1549.pdf,S-1549_0,en,"cenciatura en Derecho. La investigación en su conjunto, estuvo","Given the social responsibility universities have for curriculum development, it must be adapted to the surrounding reality. In Cuba, for the first time, family mediation has found legal support as an alternative method of conflict resolution; however, the profile of family mediator is not included among the professional responsibilities of law graduates. Therefore, students are not trained in this role. A didactic approach was proposed with the objective of contributing to the training of law students in family mediation. The research as a whole was guided by the dialectical materialist method, which is implemented through the application of the following methods at different levels: theoretical methods: the historical-logical method; empirical methods: document review. The resulting scientific and Información del artículo Recibido: abril de 2023 Aceptado: septiembre de 2025 Publicado: noviembre de 2025 Como citar: Martínez V, Haydee M. Rodríguez Morell, J L (2025). Concepción didáctica para la formación en mediación familiar del Licenciado en Derecho. (2025). Sophia, 21(1). https://revistas.ugca.edu.co/ index.php/sophia/article/vi ew/1549 Sophia-Education Copyright 2025. Universidad La Gran Colombia Esta obra está bajo una Licencia AttributionShareAlike 4.0 International Conflicto de intereses: Los autores declaran no tener conflictos de intereses. *Autor para la correspondencia: haydee.martinez@umcc.cu DOI: https://doi.org/10.18634/sophiaj.21v.1i.1549 Volumen 21, número 1, 2025, p: e1549 ISSN − −SOPHIA e1549 pedagogical findings are presented based on their structural elements: foundations, theoretical and didactic components, and methodological guidelines. Finally, the described process of knowledge, skills, and values transmission and reception contributed to reinforcing the importance of incorporating the professional profile of mediator into the professional responsibilities of law graduates",education; quality of education; significance; international organizations. __________________________________________________________________________,marcadores,cenciatura en derecho la investigacion en su conjunto estuvo,given social responsibility universiti have curriculum development must adapt surround reality cuba first time family mediation has found legal support alternative method conflict resolution however profile family mediator not includ among professional responsibiliti law graduat therefore student not train role didactic approach propos objective contribut train law student family mediation research whole guid dialectical materialist method which implement through application follow method different level theoretical method historical-logical method empirical method document review result scientific informacion del articulo recibido abril de 2023 aceptado septiembre de 2025 publicado noviembre de 2025 como citar martinez haydee rodriguez morell 2025 concepcion didactica para la formacion en mediacion familiar del licenciado en derecho 2025 sophia 21 http revista ugca edu co index php sophia article vi ew 1549 sophia-education copyright 2025 universidad la gran colombia esta obra esta bajo una licencia attributionsharealike international conflicto de interes los autor declaran no tener conflicto de interes autor para la correspondencia haydee martinez umcc cu doi http doi org 10 18634 sophiaj 21v 1i 1549 volumen 21 numero 2025 e1549 issn -sophia e1549 pedagogical finding present based their structural element found theoretical didactic component methodological guidelin finally describ proces knowledge skill valu transmission reception contribut reinforc importance incorporat professional profile mediator into professional responsibiliti law graduat,education quality education significance international organiz __________________________________________________________________________,cenciatura en derecho