1794-9920,art_6+maquetado.pdf,art_6+maquetado_0,en,imientos emergentes en escenarios locales.,"Productivity is a critical factor in the sustainability of emerging ventures, especially in local contexts where access to financial, technological, and management resources is limited. In Colombia, the National Learning Service (SENA) Entrepreneurship Fund has established itself as a tool for supporting entrepreneurship, offering seed capital and technical support. However, persistent gaps in productivity indicators require the formulation of more effective strategies to ensure the consolidation and permanence of business initiatives in the market. This article analyzes strategic productivity models applicable to ventures supported by the Fondo Emprender in Barrancabermeja, Santander, with the aim of designing strategies to strengthen their performance. To this end, it characterizes the current status of projects underway, identifies processes that affect their productivity, and proposes actions aimed at improving their sustainability and competitiveness. The methodology used is a mixed approach, with a documentary analysis and a descriptive study of cases linked to the Entrepreneurship Fund in the region. The results show that the main difficulties faced by start-ups are related to financial management, technological innovation, and coordination with business support networks. Consequently, strategies focused on specialized training, process digitization, the implementation of management indicators, and the strengthening of inter-institutional alliances are proposed. The contribution of this research lies in the proposal of a contextualized strategic model that contributes to improving the productivity of emerging enterprises in local settings","Productivity, emerging entrepreneurship, Fondo Emprender, SENA, business strategies. Modelos estratégicos de produtividade em empreendimentos emergentes: uma abordagem a partir do Fundo Empreender do SENA em Barrancabermeja, Santander",marcadores,imiento emergent en escenario local,productivity critical factor sustainability emerg ventur especially local context where acces financial technological management resourc limit colombia national learn service sena entrepreneurship fund has establish itself tool support entrepreneurship offer seed capital technical support however persistent gaps productivity indicator require formulation more effective strategi ensure consolidation permanence busines initiativ market article analyz strategic productivity model applicable ventur support fondo emprender barrancabermeja santander aim design strategi strengthen their performance end characteriz current statu project underway identifi process affect their productivity propos action aimed improv their sustainability competitivenes methodology used mixed approach documentary analysi descriptive study case link entrepreneurship fund region result show main difficulti faced start-up relat financial management technological innovation coordination busines support network consequently strategi focus specializ train proces digit implementation management indicator strengthen inter-institutional allianc propos contribution research lies proposal contextualiz strategic model contribut improv productivity emerg enterpris local setting,productivity emerg entrepreneurship fondo emprender sena busines strategi modelo estrategico de produtividade em empreendimento emergent uma abordagem partir do fundo empreender do sena em barrancabermeja santander,imiento emergent en escenario local productivity critical factor sustainability emerg ventur especially local context where acces financial technological management resourc limit colombia national learn service sena entrepreneurship fund has establish itself tool support entrepreneurship offer seed capital technical support however persistent gaps productivity indicator require formulation more effective strategi ensure consolidation permanence busines initiativ market 