1909-2814,Dialnet-EntornosVirtualesDeAprendizajeYDidacticaDeLaLengua-3989798.pdf,Dialnet-EntornosVirtualesDeAprendizajeYDidacticaDeLaLengua-3989798_0,en,formación y Comunicación,"Several studies have emphasized students´ difficulties in writing and reading activities in Higher Education. With information and Communications technologies advances, there are new alternatives which can be used to overcome writing and reading problems. In this context, the aim of this study is to describe two experiences (in Moodle and in Facebook) held in a major survey which was carried out to develop reformulation skills in Pre-university students with didactic devices given by learning networks. Our hypothesis is that, if reformulation is practiced, reading and writing would improve. Palabras clave Aprendizaje, didácticos, dispositivos, educación, entornos, escritura, lectura, virtuales. Vol. 6 No. 12 | Enero - Junio de 2012 | Medellín - Colombia | ISSN: 1909-2814 2","Devices, didactic, education, environment, learning, reading, virtual, writing. Datos de la investigación, a la experiencia o la tesis Este artículo de investigación expone los resultados del proyecto: “Una propuesta didáctica a través de redes de aprendizaje para mejorar las habilidades de reformulación de estudiantes preuniversitarios”. Este proyecto, actualmente dirigido por la Prof. Laura",marcadores,formacion comunicacion,several studi have emphasiz student difficulti writ read activiti higher education information communic technologi advanc there new alternativ which can used overcome writ read problem context aim study describe two experienc moodle facebook held major survey which carri out develop reformulation skill pre-university student didactic devic given learn network our hypothesi if reformulation practic read writ would improve palabra clave aprendizaje didactico dispositivo educacion entorno escritura lectura virtual vol no 12 enero junio de 2012 medellin colombia issn 1909-2814,devic didactic education