1909-5775,romero+pic.pdf,romero+pic_0,en,unicación RS232. En este sistema el control reside en el microcontrolador,"The stepper motor has been highlighted as a key component to achieve controlled and precise movements. This article focuses on the design and development of a stepper motor control system, with a subsequent application on a crane that will lift a small mass vertically. Each single aspect of the process has been examined in detail: from the selection and configuration of the 28BYJ-48 motor, to the implementation of the interfaces control such as the 4x4 matrix keypad and RS232 communication. In this system the control resides on the PIC18F4550 microcontroller. The control approach has had two modes: manual and automatic. In manual mode, the matrix keyboard has been used to allow direct interaction with the crane, adjusting parameters such as speed or direction. The automatic mode has demonstrated the ability to perform predefined movements, with a specific number of steps that ensure positioning accuracy. Overall, present study shows a comprehensive electronic control system, offering applicability in various technological areas. As research in this field progresses, this system provides a solid foundation for future improvements and optimizations in similar systems","PIC18F4550 microcontroller, stepper motor, high-level programming, delays. DOI: https://doi.org/10.57173/ritc.v1n18a5 Recibido: 08/08/2024 Aceptado: 02/11/2024 Fecha de Publicación:27/11/2024 Derechos de autor: © 2024 I + T + C Investigación, Tecnología y Ciencia -Vol. 1, Número 18. Enero – Diciembre 2024 2 1",marcadores,unicacion rs232 en este sistema el control reside en el microcontrolador,stepper motor has been highlight key component achieve controll precise movement article focus design development stepper motor control system subsequent application crane will lift small mass vertically each single aspect proces has been examin detail selection configuration 28byj-48 motor implementation interfac control such 4x4 matrix keypad rs232 communication system control resid pic18f4550 microcontroller control approach has had two mode manual automatic manual mode matrix keyboard has been used allow direct interaction crane adjust parameter such speed direction automatic mode has demonstrat ability perform predefin movement specific number step ensure position accuracy overall present study show comprehensive electronic control system offer applicability variou technological area research field progress system provid solid foundation future improvement optimiz similar system,pic18f4550 microcontroller stepper motor high-level programm delay doi http doi org 10 57173 ritc v1n18a5 recibido 08 08 2024 aceptado 02 11 2024 fecha de publicacion 27 11 2024 derecho de autor 2024 investigacion tecnologia ciencia -vol numero 18 enero diciembre 2024,unicacion rs232 en este sistema el control reside en el microcontrolador stepper motor has been highlight key component achieve controll precise movement article focus design development stepper motor control system subsequent application crane will lift small mass vertically each single aspect proces has been examin detail selection configuration 28byj-48 motor implementation interfac control such 4x4 matrix keypad rs232 communication system control resid pic18f4550 microcontroller control approach has had two mode manual automatic manual mode matrix keyboard has been used allow direct interaction crane adjust parameter such speed direction automatic mode has demonstrat ability perform predefin movement specific number step ensure position accuracy overall present study show comprehensive electronic control system offer applicability variou technological area research field progress system provid solid foundation future improvement optimiz similar system pic18f4550 microcontroller stepper motor high-level programm delay doi http doi org 10 57173 ritc v1n18a5 recibido 08 08 2024 aceptado 02 11 2024 fecha de publicacion