solv mathematic mercader-ruiz nacher-ortiz abellan-rosello siegenthaler-hierro vol 19 no mayo agosto 2026,1.0.0,1838d9713aaf975e
2011-3080,7927-+Interventions+to+Foster+Positive+Psychological+Capital+in+the+Organizational+Context.pdf,7927-+Interventions+to+Foster+Positive+Psychological+Capital+in+the+Organizational+Context_0,en,tps://revistas.ces.edu.co/index.php/psicologia,"Introduction: Psychological capital is a significant concept in organizational literature, known for improving work outcomes and workers' mental health, thus offering organizations a competitive edge. Objective: This review aimed to identify instruments, types of intervention and results associated with the promotion of Psychological Capital in organizations. Method: This research covered articles published from 2004-2023, involving working adults over 18, and in Portuguese, English, or Spanish. Using databases PubMed, Scopus, EBSCOhost, and Web of Science, 3.240 articles were identified, with 11 selected through the PRISMA methodology. Results: The primary studies involved an average of 189 workers (SD=202), mainly using the Psychological Capital Questionnaire-24 for data collection, with ANOVA as the most frequent statistical method (63.63%). Conclusion: This review highlights the benefits of PsyCap interventions and synthesizes how they have been applied, revealing a key gap: the lack of replicable models due to insufficient methodological detail. The findings emphasize the need for a structured, evidence-based PsyCap program to guide future research and practice. The study was limited to the work context, which may have restricted the scope and excluded interventions from other settings",Positive Psychological Capital; PsyCap; Positive Organizational Psychology; Organizational Interventions; Workplace Well-being; Human Resource Development,marcadores,tps revista ces edu co index php psicologia,introduction psychological capital significant concept organizational literature known improv work outcom worker mental health thus offer organiz competitive edge objective review aimed identify instrument type intervention result associat promotion psychological capital organiz method research cover articl publish 2004-2023 involv work adult over 18 portuguese english spanish using databas pubm scopu ebscohost web science 240 articl identifi 11 select through prisma methodology result primary studi involv average 189 worker sd 202 mainly using psychological capital questionnaire-24 data collection anova most frequent statistical method 63 63 conclusion review highlight benefit psycap intervention synthesiz how they have been appli reveal key gap lack replicable model due insufficient methodological detail finding emphasize need structur evidence-bas psycap program guide future research practice study limit work context which may have restrict scope exclud intervention other setting,positive psychological capital psycap positive organizational psychology organizational intervention workplace well-be human resource development,tps revista ces edu co index php psicologia introduction psychological capital significant concept organizational literature known improv work outcom worker mental health thus offer organiz competitive edge objective review aimed identify instrument type intervention result associat promotion psychological capital organiz method research cover articl publish 2004-2023 involv work adult over 18 portuguese english spanish using databas pubm scopu ebscohost web science 240 articl identifi 11 select through prisma methodology result primary studi involv average 189 worker sd 202 mainly using psychological capital questionnaire-24 data collection anova most frequent statistical method 63 63 conclusion review highlight benefit psycap intervention synthesiz how they have been appli reveal key gap lack replicable model due insufficient methodological detail finding emphasize need structur evidence-bas psycap program guide future research practice study limit work context which may have restrict scope exclud intervention other setting positive psychological capital psycap positive organizational psychology organizational intervention workplace well-be human resource development,1.0.0,d37ff2e09859b11f
2011-3080,7927-+Interventions+to+Foster+Positive+Psychological+Capital+in+the+Organizational+Context.pdf,7927-+Interventions+to+Foster+Positive+Psychological+Capital+in+the+Organizational+Context_0,es,"ed, with 11 selected through the PRISMA methodology. Results: The primary studies involved an average of 189","Introducción: el capital psicológico es un concepto significativo en la literatura organizacional, conocido por mejorar los resultados laborales y la salud mental de los trabajadores, ofreciendo así a las organizaciones una ventaja competitiva. Objetivo: esta revisão tuvo como objetivo identificar instrumentos, tipos de intervenção e resultados associados com a promoção do capital psicológico nas organizações. Métodos: esta investigación abarcó artículos publicados entre 2004 y 2023, involucrando a adultos trabajadores mayores de 18 anos, y en portugués, inglés o español. Utilizando las bases de datos PubMed, Scopus, EBSCOhost y Web of Science, se identificaron 3.240 artículos, de los cuales 11 fueron selecionados mediante la metodología PRISMA. Resultados: los estudios primarios involucraron un promedio de 189,18 trabajadores (DE=201,87), utilizando principalmente el Cuestionario de Capital Psicológico-24 para la recolección de datos, siendo ANOVA el método estadístico más frecuente (63,63%). Conclusão: independientemente del tipo de intervención, fueron eficaces para los empleados y las organizaciones, contribuyendo a un ambiente de trabajo más saludable y sostenible. Aunque el estudio destacó los beneficios de las intervenciones de PsyCap, estuvo limitado por sus criterios de selección restrictivos y no abordó el posible sesgo de publicación. Ruiz, A.P.P.S., Viseu, J.N.R., Cifuentes-Tinjaca, C.D., & Jesus, S. N. Vol. 19 No. 2 / May – August 2026 2",Capital Psicológico Positivo; PsyCap; Psicología Organizacional Positiva; Intervenciones Organizacionales; Bienestar Laboral; Desarrollo de Recursos Humanos,marcadores,ed with 11 selected through the prisma methodology results the primary studi involved an average of 189,introduccion capital psicologico concepto significativo literatura organizacional conocido mejorar resultad laboral salud mental trabajador ofrec asi organiz ventaja competitiva objetivo esta revisao tuvo como objetivo identificar instrument tipos intervencao resultad associad com promocao do capital psicologico nas organizaco metod esta investigacion abarco articul publicad entre 2004 2023 involucr adult trabajador mayor 18 anos portugu ingl espanol utiliz bases datos pubmed scopus ebscohost web of science identificaron 240 articul cual 11 fueron selecionad mediante metodologia prisma resultad estudi primari involucraron promedio 189 18 trabajador 201 87 utiliz principal cuestionario capital psicologico-24 recoleccion datos siendo anova metodo estadistico mas frecuente 63 63 conclusao independiente tipo intervencion fueron eficac emplead organiz contribuyendo ambiente trabajo mas saludable sostenible aunque estudio destaco benefici intervencion psycap estuvo limitado sus criteri seleccion restrictiv no abordo posible sesgo publicacion ruiz viseu cifuentes-tinjaca jesus vol 19 no may august 2026,capital psicologico positivo psycap psicologia organizacional positiva intervencion organizacional bienestar laboral desarrollo recurs human,ed with 11 selected through the prisma methodology results the primary studi involved an average of 189 introduccion capital psicologico concepto significativo literatura organizacional conocido mejorar resultad laboral salud mental trabajador ofrec asi organiz ventaja competitiva objetivo esta revisao tuvo como objetivo identificar instrument tipos intervencao resultad associad com promocao do capital psicologico nas organizaco metod esta investigacion abarco articul publicad entre 2004 2023 involucr adult trabajador mayor 18 anos portugu ingl espanol utiliz bases datos pubmed scopus ebscohost web of science identificaron 240 articul cual 11 fueron selecionad mediante metodol