2011-8643,"cangulomuoz,+Gestor_a+de+la+revista,+Magistro+Vol.+8+No.+16-Maestro.pdf","cangulomuoz,+Gestor_a+de+la+revista,+Magistro+Vol.+8+No.+16-Maestro_0",en,"a sociedad. Es así, que","This subject review deals on the loss of relevance of philosophical education in the current school, a loss that is evidenced in aspects such as, the reduced time for this discipline, the little importance given to philosophy by the teacher, the abundance of technicality awarded today to the education in school and the fluidity of knowledge that permeates young people of this era. However, with all these issues that make the teaching of El maestro de filosofía: al rescate de una educación filosófica en la escuela 103 m ISSN: 2011-8643, Magistro, vol. 8, n.º 16, julio-diciembre de 2014, pp. 101-121 philosophy a “ghost” at school, a key aspect appears that can grant value to philosophy, it is the teacher who becomes the guide in a teaching and learning process in philosophy, in order to understand the need to think it and recreate it, not as a mere “short course” of history or a conversation on “charlatans”; what it seeks is to think of it as a philosophical education, where the true value of this knowledge is emphasized in the formation of individuals and the construction of critical thinking that consolidates innovative and objective ideas for society. Thus, for the construction of philosophical education it is important the role of the teacher in a context lacking contemplative thinking, to accomplish to bring to the student a reflection and ask about the things themselves; a teacher that must assume the challenge of contributing philosophical thinking to the school, that achieves rescuing the meaning of actual discussion and debate of philosophical concepts, that accomplishes to think and make think philosophy as a form of life, where it is questioned, critiqued and built a new knowledge through dialogue and the bet for education from philosophy and in favor a society more conscious of its becoming and acting in context","Philosophical education, teaching, school, teacher training Le maitre en philosophie: Au sauvetage d’une éducation philosophique à l’école. Résumé Cette révision du sujet, examine la perte de pertinence de l’éducation philosophique dans l’école actuelle, une perte qui est mise en évidence par des aspects tels que, le temps réduit pour cette discipline, le manque d’importance que l’enseignant",marcadores,sociedad es asi que,subject review deal loss relevance philosophical education current school loss evidenc aspect such reduc time discipline little importance given philosophy teacher abundance technicality award today education school fluidity knowledge permeat young people era however all these issu make teach el maestro de filosofia al rescate de una educacion filosofica en la escuela 103 issn 2011-8643 magistro vol 16 julio-diciembre de 2014 pp 101-121 philosophy ghost school key aspect appear can grant value philosophy teacher who becom guide teach learn proces philosophy order understand need think recreate not mere short course history conversation charlatan what seek think philosophical education where true value knowledge emphasiz formation individual construction critical think consolidat innovative objective idea society thus construction philosophical education important role teacher context lack contemplative think accomplish bring student reflection ask about thing themselv teacher must assume challenge contribut philosophical think school achiev rescu mean actual discussion debate philosophical concept accomplish think make think philosophy form life where question critiqu built new knowledge through dialogue bet education philosophy favor society more consciou its becom acting context,philosophical education teach school teacher train le maitre en philosophie au sauvetage une education philosophique ecole resume cette revision du sujet examine la perte de pertinence de education philosophique dans ecole actuel