itative research,marcadores,pesquisa descritivo-explicativa em detrimento de estudo interventivo com concentracao geografica nas regio sul sudeste,professor adjunto universidade estadual do ceara diego adaylano uece br aluno de maestria en el profbio universidade estadual do ceara fernand faria aluno uece br aluno de maestria universidade estadual do ceara romario fernand aluno uece br aluna de licenciatura em biologia universidade estadual do ceara franscisca daiana aluno uece br 116 bio-investigacion bio-grafia escrito sobre la biologia su ensenanza vol 19 no 36 enero-junio 2026 issn 2619-3531 e23365 article analyz how scientific denialism has been address academic production present brazilian science education event between 2017 2024 based bibliographic study both qualitative quantitative approach 50 paper six national scientific event examin analysi guid discursive textual analysi result descriptive metatext organiz into four emergent categori study reveal predominance descriptive-explanatory research over interventional studi geographic concentration south southeast region brazil focu secondary higher education most work use term denialism although only portion them provide conceptual definition three main conception scientific denialism identifi political-ideological psychological socio-historical first being most recurrent few studi propose pedagogical strategi addres issue mainly focus fake news relat pandemic finding indicate field still theoretical methodological development highlight urgent need educational strategi integrate diverse methodologi addres multiple educational social context,literature review science education qualitative research,pesquisa descritivo-explicativa em detrimento de estudo interventivo com concentracao geografica nas regio sul sudeste professor adjunto universidade estadual do ceara diego adaylano uece br aluno de maestria en el profbio universidade estadual do ceara fernand faria aluno uece br aluno de maestria universidade esta