2027-1034,851-239-PB.pdf,851-239-PB_11,en,Estos resultados suponen un escalón más elaborado en el negacionismo científico porque no se niegan ni se cuestionan los hechos,"The resounding spread of fake news and the intensive use of social networks by adolescents served as a starting point in the intention to address scientific denialism, specifically fake news and the reinterpretation of evidence in the teaching of genetics using as a means, the analysis of the recent article published by Japanese researchers on trisomic rescue (crispr-Cas9) for Down Syndrome and a search and categorization of the “light” publication of this news on social networks, analyzing 25 publications (reels, short videos, TikToks) in the categories: a) literal denial; b) interpretive denial and c) implicatory denial, which were organized through the qualitative analysis software NVivo, from an interpretive qualitative methodology with ninth grade students from Colegio el Paraíso de Manuela Beltrán. The results showed that the most tracked and coded category wass Interpretive Denial, with 65.5 % relevance. These results represent a more elaborate step in scientific denialism because the facts published in the scientific article were not denied or questioned, but rather they were reinterpreted, and great relevance was evident in the ethical implication and symbolic distortion of information. It was concluded that addressing scientific denialism through exploration and active involvement of students strengthens their learning, their analytical capacity and critical stances, as well as the redefinition of school science; it enhances inquiry, participation, and motivation in the classroom in writing processes, and promotes debates and ethical stances related to science, the forms of science, and the realities of the context",biology class; denialism; ethical perspective; reinterpretation of evidence; Down syndrome,marcadores,esto resultado suponen un escalon mas elaborado en el negacionismo cientifico porque no se niegan ni se cuestionan los hecho,resound spread fake news intensive use social network adolescent serv start point intention addres scientific denialism specifically fake news reinterpretation evidence teach genetic using mean analysi recent article publish japanese researcher trisomic rescue crispr-cas9 down syndrome search categor light publication news social network analyz 25 public reel short video tiktok categori literal denial interpretive denial implicatory denial which organiz through qualitative analysi software nvivo interpretive qualitative methodology ninth grade student colegio el paraiso de manuela beltran result show most track coded category wass interpretive denial 65 relevance these result represent more elaborate step scientific denialism because fact publish scientific article not deni question but rather they reinterpret great relevance evident ethical implication symbolic distortion information conclud address scientific denialism through exploration active involvement student strengthen their learn their analytical capacity critical stanc well redefinition school science enhanc inquiry participation motivation classroom writ process promot debat ethical stanc relat science form science realiti context,biology clas denialism ethical perspective reinterpretation evidence down syndrome,esto resultado suponen un escalon mas elaborado en el negacionismo cientifico porque no se niegan ni se cuestionan los hecho resound spread fake news intensive use social network adolescent serv start point intention addres scientific denialism specifically fake news reinterpretation evidence teach genetic using mean analysi recent article publish japanese researcher trisomic rescue crispr-cas9 down syndrome search categor light publication news social network analyz 25 public reel short video tiktok categori literal denial interpretive denial implicatory denial which organiz through qualitative analysi software nvivo interpretive qualitative methodology ninth grade student colegio el paraiso de manuela beltran result show most track coded category wass interpretive denial 65 relevance these result represent more elaborate step scientific denialism because fact publish scientific article not deni question but rather they reinterpret great relevance evident ethical implication symbolic distortion information conclud address scientific denialism through exploration active involvement student strengthen their learn their analytical capacity critical stanc well redefinition school science enhanc inquiry participation motivation classroom writ process promot debat ethical stanc relat science form science realiti context biology clas denialism ethical perspective reinterpretation evidence down syndrome,1.0.0,63d0b7a0427bd604
2027-1034,851-239-PB.pdf,851-239-PB_12,es,Leandry Pavón-Gutiérrez,"El cambio climático es uno de los mayores desafíos globales por su naturaleza multidimensional y las urgentes transformaciones que requiere; sin embargo, el negacionismo climático, constituye una problemática que dificulta la acción urgente contra la crisis, cuya raíz histórica está en la Revolución Industrial y en la hegemonía del capitalismo extractivista. Frente a ello, se propone una educación para el cambio climático (ecc) crítica e inclusiva, que integre dimensiones naturales, sociales y culturales, generando diálogos entre ciencia y saberes tradicionales. La inclusión de la perspectiva epistemológica permite cuestionar cómo se construye el conocimiento sobre el cambio climático, afrontando la desinformación, entre otros factores asociados. Específicamente la observación, entendida como una práctica epistemológica situada y mediada, se plantea como puente para fortalecer la ecc plural, crítica y transformadora, capaz de desmontar narrativas negacionistas y promover respuestas sostenibles y culturalmente pertinentes","cuidado de la vida; educación para el cambio climático; conocimiento ancestral; conocimiento tradicional; negacionismo científico; observación 1 Magíster en Docencia de las Ciencias Naturales. Estudiante del Doctorado Interinstitucional en Educación, Universidad Pedagógica Nacional. iverao@pedagogica.edu.co 174 Bio-grafía. Escritos sobre la Biología y su enseñanza Vol. 19 No. 36, enero-junio",marcadores,leandry pavon-gutierrez,cambio climatico uno mayor desafi global naturaleza multidimensional urgent transform requiere sin embargo negacionismo climatico constituye problematica dificulta accion urgente contra crisis cuya raiz historica esta revolucion industrial hegemonia capitalismo extractivista frente ello propone educacion cambio climatico ecc critica inclusiva integre dimension natural social cultural gener dialog entre ciencia saber tradicional inclusion perspectiva epistemologica permite cuestionar como construye conocimiento sobre cambio climatico afront desinformacion entre otros factor asociad especifica observacion entendida como practica epistemologica situada mediada plantea como puente fortalecer ecc plural critica transformadora capaz desmontar narrativ negacionist promover respuest sostenibl cultural pertinent,cuidado vida educacion cambio climatico conocimiento ancestral conocimiento tradicional negacionismo cientifico observacion magister docencia cienci natural estudiante doctorado interinstitucional educacion universidad pedagogica nacional iverao pedagogica edu co 174 bio-grafia escrit sobre biologia ensenanza vol 19 no 36 enero-junio,leandry pavon-gutierrez cambio climatico uno mayor desafi global naturaleza multidimensional urgent transform requiere sin embargo negacionismo climatico constituye problematica dificulta accion urgente contra crisis cuya raiz historica esta revolucion industrial hegemonia capitalismo extractivista frente ello propone educacion cambio climatico ecc critica inclusiva integre dimension natural social cultural gener dialog entre ciencia saber tradicional inclusion perspectiva epistemologica permite cuestionar como construye conocimiento sobre cambio climatico afront desinformacion entre otros factor asociad especifica observacion entendida como practica epistemologica situada mediada plantea como puente fortalecer ecc plural critica transformadora capaz desmontar narrativ negacionist promover respuest sostenibl cultural pertinent cuidado vida educacion cambio climatico conocimiento ancestral conocimiento tradicional negacionismo cientifico observacion magister docencia cienci natural estudiante doctorado interinstitucional educacion universidad pedagogica nacional iverao pedagogica edu co 174 bio-grafia escrit sobre biologia ensenanza vol 19 no 36 enero-junio,1.0.0,b2c76d4e6d9a434a
2027-1034,851-239-PB.pdf,851-239-PB_12,en,iva epistemológica permite cuestionar cómo se construye el conocimiento,"Climate change is one of the greatest global challenges due to its multidimensional nature and the urgent transformations it requires; however, climate denial constitutes a problem that hinders urgent action against the crisis, whose historical roots lie in the Industrial Revolution and the hegemony of extractivist capitalism. In response, a critical and inclusive Education for Climate Change (ecc) is proposed, integrating natural, social, and cultural dimensions, fostering dialogues between science and traditional knowledges. The inclusion of an epistemological perspective allows questioning how knowledge about climate change is constructed, addressing misinformation and other associated factors. Specifically, observation—understood as a situated and mediated epistemological practice—is presented as a bridge to strengthen a plural, critical, and transformative ecc capable of dismantling denialist narratives and promoting sustainable and culturally relevant responses",care of life; climate change education; ancestral knowledge; traditional knowledge; scientific denialism; observation,marcadores,iva epistemologica permite cuestionar como se construye el conocimiento,climate change one greatest global challeng due its multidimensional nature urgent transform requir however climate denial constitut problem hinder urgent action against crisi whose historical root lie industrial revolution hegemony extractivist capitalism response critical inclusive education climate change ecc propos integrat natural social cultural dimension foster dialogu between science traditional knowledg inclusion epistemological perspective allow question how knowledge about climate change construct address misinformation other associat factor specifically observation--understood situat mediat epistemological practice--i present bridge strengthen plural critical transformative ecc capable dismantl denialist narrativ promot sustainable culturally relevant respons,care life climate change education ancestral knowledge traditional knowledge scientific denialism observation,iva epistemologica permite cuestionar como se construye el conocimiento climate change one greatest global challeng due its multidimensional nature urgent transform requir however climate denial constitut problem hinder urgent action against crisi whose historical root lie industrial revolution hegemony extractivist capitalism response critical inclusive education climate change ecc propos integrat natural social cultural dimension foster dialogu between science traditional knowledg inclusion epistemological perspective allow question how knowledge about climate change construct address misinformation other associat factor specifically observation--understood situat mediat epistemological practice--i present bridge strengthen plural critical transformative ecc capable dismantl denialist narrativ promot sustainable culturally relevant respons care life climate change education ancestral knowledge traditional knowledge scientific denialism observation,1.0.0,0c7b4f84e33379d5
2027-1034,851-239-PB.pdf,851-239-PB_13,es,LA COMPETENCIA ARGUMENTATIVA,"En las últimas décadas, la enseñanza de la Biología ha presentado un desafío considerable ante el creciente fenómeno del negacionismo científico, el cual requiere un pensamiento analítico desde diversas perspectivas educativas para mitigar su influencia en el aula de clase y en el contexto social. Por ello, este ensayo tuvo como objetivo identificar estrategias metodológicas para fomentar el análisis crítico en los docentes, el uso de medios didácticos y el desarrollo de la competencia argumentativa en los estudiantes, que les permitan apropiarse de habilidades para analizar, evaluar y razonar situaciones cotidianas y académicas con un enfoque dialógico. Se realizó una revisión de literatura publicada entre el año 2020 y el 2025, que permitió identificar espacios de aprendizaje mediados por el conocimiento significativo, el juicio fundamentado y la capacidad de diferenciar datos objetivos de conclusiones erróneas o sesgadas. Los resultados mostraron que la enseñanza y el aprendizaje de la Biología en tiempos de negacionismo científico se deben fundamentar desde principios pedagógicos y epistemológicos de la educación, donde el aprendizaje significativo permita conectar el conocimiento con la realidad. De igual forma, es importante una enseñanza crítica que propicie el reconocimiento de sesgos en la construcción de reflexiones propias y el desarrollo de competencias argumentativas como medio para cuestionar y tomar decisiones informadas. 1 Magíster en Educación. Docente, Secretaría de Educación de Medellín. gustavo.bonilla@medellin.edu.co 2 Magíster en Educación. Docente de la Secretaría de Educación de Medellín. bibiana.chica@medellin.edu.co 182 Bio-grafía. Escritos sobre la Biología y su enseñanza Vol. 19 No. 36, enero-junio 2026 ISSN 2619-3531. e23170 Bio-Ensayo",aprendizaje significativo; competencia argumentativa; educación en ciencias; pensamiento crítico; formación docente; negacionismo científico,marcadores,competencia argumentativa,ultim decad ensenanza biologia ha presentado desafio considerable ante creciente fenomeno negacionismo cientifico cual requiere pensamiento analitico desde divers perspectiv educativ mitigar influencia aula clase contexto social ello este ensayo tuvo como objetivo identificar estrategi metodologic fomentar analisis critico docent uso medi didactic desarrollo competencia argumentativa estudiant les permitan apropiarse habilidad analizar evaluar razonar situ cotidian academic enfoque dialogico realizo revision literatura publicada entre ano 2020 2025 permitio identificar espaci aprendizaje mediad conocimiento significativo juicio fundamentado capacidad diferenciar datos objetiv conclusion errone sesgad resultad mostraron ensenanza aprendizaje biologia tiemp negacionismo cientifico deben fundamentar desde principi pedagogic epistemologic educacion donde aprendizaje significativo permita conectar conocimiento realidad igual forma importante ensenanza critica propicie reconocimiento sesg construccion reflexion propi desarrollo competenci argumentativ como medio cuestionar tomar decision informad magister educacion docente secretaria educacion medellin gustavo bonilla medellin edu co magister educacion docente secretaria educacion medellin bibiana chica medellin edu co 182 bio-grafia escrit sobre biologia ensenanza vol 19 no 36 enero-junio 2026 issn 2619-3531 e23170 bio-ensayo,aprendizaje significativo competencia argumentativa educacion cienci pensamiento critico formacion docente negacionismo cientifico,competencia argumentativa ultim decad ensenanza biologia ha presentado desafio considerable ante creciente fenomeno negacionismo cientifico cual requiere pensamiento analitico desde divers perspectiv educativ mitigar influencia aula clase contexto social ello este ensayo tuvo como objetivo identificar estrategi metodologic fomentar analisis critico docent uso medi didactic desarrollo competencia argumentativa estudiant les permitan apropiarse habilidad analizar evaluar razonar situ cotidian academic enfoque dialogico realizo revision literatura publicada entre ano 2020 2025 permitio identificar espaci aprendizaje mediad conocimiento significativo juicio fundamentado capacidad diferenciar datos objetiv conclusion errone sesgad resultad mostraron ensenanza aprendizaje biologia tiemp negacionismo cientifico deben fundamentar desde principi pedagogic epistemologic educacion donde aprendizaje significativo permita conectar conocimiento realidad igual forma importante ensenanza critica propicie reconocimiento sesg construccion reflexion propi desarrollo competenci argumentativ como medio cuestionar tomar decision informad magister educacion docente secretaria educacion medellin gustavo bonilla medellin edu co magister educacion docente secretaria educacion medellin bibiana chica medellin edu co 182 bio-grafia escrit sobre biologia ensenanza vol 19 no 36 enero-junio 2026 issn 2619-3531 e23170 bio-ensayo aprendizaje significativo competencia argumentativa educacion cienci pensamiento critico formacion docente negacionismo cientifico,1.0.0,87d574928d9adef2
2027-1034,851-239-PB.pdf,851-239-PB_13,en,"n fundamentar desde principios pedagógicos y epistemológicos de la educación, donde el aprendizaje significativo permita","In recent decades, Biology teaching has presented a considerable challenge in the face of the growing phenomenon of Scientific Denialism, which requires analytical thinking from diverse educational perspectives to mitigate its influence in the classroom and in the social context. Therefore, this essay aimed to identify methodological strategies to foster critical analysis in teachers, the use of teaching aids, and the development of argumentative competence in students. This allow them to acquire skills to analyze, evaluate, and reason in everyday and academic situations with a dialogical approach. A review of literature published between 2020 and 2025 was conducted, which allowed identifying learning spaces mediated by meaningful knowledge, reasoned judgment, and the ability to differentiate objective data from erroneous or biased conclusions. The results showed that the teaching and learning of Biology in times of scientific denialism must be based on pedagogical and epistemological principles of education, where meaningful learning allows for connecting knowledge with reality, highlighting the importance of critical teaching that encourages the recognition of biases in the construction of one’s own reflections and the development of argumentative skills as a means to question and make informed decisions",meaningful learning; argumentative competence; science education; critical thinking; teacher training; scientific denialism,marcadores,fundamentar desde principio pedagogico epistemologico de la educacion donde el aprendizaje significativo permita,recent decad biology teach has present considerable challenge face grow phenomenon scientific denialism which requir analytical think diverse educational perspectiv mitigate its influence classroom social context therefore essay aimed identify methodological strategi foster critical analysi teacher use teach aids development argumentative competence student allow them acquire skill analyze evaluate reason everyday academic situ dialogical approach review literature publish between 2020 2025 conduct which allow identify learn spac mediat meaningful knowledge reason judgment ability differentiate objective data erroneou bias conclusion result show teach learn biology time scientific denialism must based pedagogical epistemological principl education where meaningful learn allow connect knowledge reality highlight importance critical teach encourag recognition bias construction one own reflection development argumentative skill mean question make inform decision,meaningful learn argumentative competence science education critical think teacher train scientific denialism,fundamentar desde principio pedagogico epistemologico de la educacion donde el aprendizaje significativo permita recent decad biology teach has present considerable challenge face grow phenomenon scientific denialism which requir analytical think diverse educational perspectiv mitigate its influence classroom social context therefore essay aimed identify methodological strategi foster critical analysi teacher use teach aids development argumentative competence student allow them acquire skill analyze evaluate reason everyday academic situ dialogical approach review literature publish between 2020 2025 conduct which allow identify learn spac mediat meaningful knowledge reason judgment ability differentiate objective data erroneou bias conclusion result show teach learn biology time scientific denialism must based pedagogical epistemological principl education where meaningful learn allow connect knowledge reality highlight importance critical teach encourag recognition bias construction one own reflection development argumentative skill mean question make inform decision meaningful learn argumentative competence science education critical think teacher train scientific denialism,1.0.0,ca97bec038f29600
2027-1034,851-239-PB.pdf,851-239-PB_14,es,CIÊNCIAS: UMA LEITURA CRÍTICA A,"Este artigo investiga o conceito de esperantismo filosófico e científico elaborado por Antonio Gramsci, articulando-o à figura do intelectual orgânico, com o objetivo de compreender os impactos da fragmentação do saber e da separação entre teoria e prática no fortalecimento de discursos negacionistas. O esperantismo filosófico e científico designa uma forma de pensamento descolada da realidade concreta, que apresenta o conhecimento como neutro, técnico e universal, desconsiderando suas dimensões histórica e política. Essa visão favorece a alienação cultural e enfraquece a capacidade crítica dos sujeitos, abrindo espaço para a difusão de discursos anticientíficos e negacionistas, que se proliferam justamente quando o conhecimento é separado das vivências sociais. Em oposição, Gramsci propõe o conceito de intelectual orgânico — sujeito que constrói saberes em diálogo com as contradições de seu 1 Mestranda na Universidade Federal de Ouro Preto (Brasil). mariannaversiani@gmail.com 2 Professor do Programa de Pós-Graduação em Educação da Universidade Federal Fluminense (Brasil). josesepulveda@id.uff.br 3 Professor da Universidade do Estado de Minas Gerais (uemg) (Brasil). rodrigo.borba@uemg.br 190 Bio-grafía. Escritos sobre la Biología y su enseñanza Vol. 19 No. 36, enero-junio 2026 ISSN 2619-3531. e23364 Bio-Ensayo grupo social e atua na disputa pela hegemonia cultural. Esse intelectual tem papel fundamental na mediação entre o conhecimento científico e as classes populares, promovendo uma pedagogia crítica capaz de enfrentar o obscurantismo contemporâneo. O artigo sustenta que a crise de autoridade da ciência está relacionada à perda de sua função educativa e à despolitização dos saberes no espaço público, agravada pelas reformas neoliberais que fragilizam a educação como espaço de formação crítica. Reafirma-se, assim, a urgência de se recuperar uma concepção de ciência comprometida com a historicidade e com os interesses coletivos, como instrumento de emancipação e resistência ao negacionismo. Palavras-chave: base nacional comum curricular; filosofia; novo ensino médio; pedagogia crítica; reformas neoliberais Abstract This article investigates the concept of philosophical and scientific esperantism, developed by Antonio Gramsci, linking it to the figure of the organic intellectual, with the aim of understanding the impacts of the fragmentation of knowledge and the separation between theory and practice in strengthening denialist discourses. Philosophical and scientific esperantism refers to a form of thought detached from concrete reality, presenting knowledge as neutral, technical, and universal, while disregarding its historical and political dimensions. This perspective fosters cultural alienation and weakens individuals' critical capacity, creating space for the spread of anti-scientific and denialist discourses, which tend to proliferate precisely when knowledge is disconnected from social experience. In contrast, Gramsci proposes the concept of the organic intellectual — a subject who constructs knowledge in dialogue with the contradictions of their social group and actively participates in the struggle for cultural hegemony. This intellectual plays a crucial role in mediating between scientific knowledge and the popular classes, promoting a critical pedagogy capable of confronting contemporary obscurantism. The article argues that the crisis of scientific authority is linked to the loss of its educational function and to the depoliticization of knowledge in the public sphere, a process exacerbated by neoliberal reforms that weaken education as a space for critical formation. It thus reaffirms the urgency of reclaiming a conception of science committed to historicity and collective interests, as a tool for emancipation and resistance to denialism",national common core curriculum; philosophy; new high school reform; critical pedagogy; neoliberal reforms,marcadores,cienci uma leitura critica,este artigo investiga conceito esperantismo filosofico cientifico elaborado antonio gramsci articulando-o figura do intelectual organico com objetivo compreender os impact da fragmentacao do saber da separacao entre teoria pratica no fortalecimento discurs negacionist esperantismo filosofico cientifico designa uma forma pensamento descolada da realidade concreta apresenta conhecimento como neutro tecnico universal desconsider suas dimenso historica politica essa visao favorece alienacao cultural enfraquece capacidade critica dos sujeit abrindo espaco difusao discurs anticientific negacionist proliferam justa quando conhecimento separado das vivenci sociais em oposicao gramsci propoe conceito intelectual organico -- sujeito constroi saber em dialogo com as contradico seu mestranda na universidade federal ouro preto brasil mariannaversiani gmail com professor do programa pos-graduacao em educacao da universidade federal fluminense brasil josesepulveda id uff br professor da universidade do estado minas gerais uemg brasil rodrigo borba uemg br 190 bio-grafia escrit sobre biologia ensenanza vol 19 no 36 enero-junio 2026 issn 2619-3531 e23364 bio-ensayo grupo social atua na disputa pela hegemonia cultural esse intelectual tem papel fundamental na mediacao entre conhecimento cientifico as class popular promovendo uma pedagogia critica capaz enfrentar obscurantismo contemporaneo artigo sustenta crise autoridade da ciencia esta relacionada perda sua funcao educativa despolitizacao dos saber no espaco publico agravada pelas reform neoliberais fragilizam educacao como espaco formacao critica reafirma-se assim urgencia recuperar uma concepcao ciencia comprometida com historicidade com os interess coletiv como instrumento emancipacao resistencia ao negacionismo palavras-chave base nacional comum curricular filosofia novo ensino medio pedagogia critica reform neoliberais abstract this article investigat the concept of philosophical and sc