2027-1557,Dialnet-ConexionesEntreElementosCompositivosDeLasArtesPlas-10273676.pdf,Dialnet-ConexionesEntreElementosCompositivosDeLasArtesPlas-10273676_0,es,Conexiones Entre Elementos Compositivos De Las Artes,"Este artículo explora la interconexión entre los elementos compositivos de las artes plásticas y la gramática visual en el diseño gráfico publicitario. Se destaca cómo la fusión de la expresión visual y la comunicación efectiva responde a las demandas del entorno contemporáneo. Al sumergirse en el imaginario colectivo, se desarrolló una guía de aplicación que subraya la importancia de explorar el arte desde la perspectiva de la imagen, utilizando sus elementos como una gramática visual en las composiciones gráficas. Esta herramienta pedagógica no solo redefine, sino que también amplía el horizonte de creación en el diseño publicitario. Palabra clave: Diseño; artes plásticas; creación gráfica; comunicación; procesos creativos. Recibido: 15 de octubre de 2024. Aceptado: 10 de junio de 2025 Received: October 15th, 2024. Accepted: June 10th, 2025 Connections Between Compositional Elements of the Visual Arts and Visual Grammar: An Approach to Advertising Graphic Creation. Abstract: The purpose of this article is to expose the relationship between the compositional elements that characterize the plastic arts and the visual grammar inherent to the field of graphic design, in the creation of persuasive and innovative graphic pieces since visual expression and effective communication come together to respond to the needs of the contemporary environment. Thus, from immersion in the collective imagination of the designer, an application guide was proposed and made that showed the importance of exploring art from the perspective of the elements of the image, with the purpose of using them as visual grammar in the compositions. graphics, thus generating a pedagogical tool that leads to redefining and expanding the horizon of creation","Design; plastic arts; graphic creation; communication; creative processes. Villegas, Moreno, V; Naranjo, Ortiz, A. _________________________________________________________________________________________________________ DOI:10.33571/revistaluciernaga.v17n33.a3 33 1",marcadores,conexion entre element compositiv artes,este articulo explora interconexion entre element compositiv artes plastic gramatica visual diseno grafico publicitario destaca como fusion expresion visual comunicacion efectiva responde demand entorno contemporaneo sumergirse imaginario colectivo desarrollo guia aplicacion subraya importancia explorar arte desde perspectiva imagen utiliz sus element como gramatica visual composicion grafic esta herramienta pedagogica no solo redefine sino tambien amplia horizonte creacion diseno publicitario palabra clave diseno artes plastic creacion grafica comunicacion proces creativ recibido 15 octubre 2024 aceptado 10 junio 2025 received october 15th 2024 accepted june 10th 2025 connections between compositional elements of the visual arts and visual grammar an approach to advertising graphic creation abstract the purpose of this article is to expose the relationship between the compositional elements that characterize the plastic arts and the visual grammar inherent to the field of graphic design in the creation of persuasive and innovative graphic piec since visual expression and effective communication come together to respond to the needs of the contemporary environment thus from immersion in the collective imagination of the designer an application guide was proposed and made that showed the importance of exploring art from the perspective of the elements of the image with the purpose of using them as visual grammar in the compositions graphics thus generating pedagogical tool that leads to redefining and expanding the horizon of creation,design plastic arts graphic creation communication creative process villeg moreno naranjo ortiz _______________________________________________________________