2027-2103,96802828017.pdf,96802828017_0,en,a zona Patrimonio,"e objective is to establish strategic determinations to increase the biodiversity values within the World Heritage area of the city of Camagüey, without compromising the conservation of its historical attributes. An exploratory methodology was followed, within the framework of the update of the special plan for the comprehensive development of the zone. e need to enhance ecosystem services and broad potential in the adjacent territory to function as a center for issuing living organisms to the urban space is Notas de autor a Autor de correspondencia. Correo electrónico: iemendezs58@gmail.com Cuadernos de Vivienda y Urbanismo, 2025, vol. 18, ISSN: 2027-2103 / 2145-0226 diagnosed. Alternatives are identied to promote interactions with peripheral reservoirs, guarantee the necessary bioconnectivity and promote green spaces in paved areas. At the same time, guidelines are established to, in accordance with bioethical principles and in compliance with Cuban legislation, control pests, minimize stray animal populations, limit unwanted vegetation growth and reduce the effects of synanthropic species that interfere with the conservation of built heritage","Biological Diversity, Ecosystem Services, Heritage Cities, Sustainable Development, Urban Environment",marcadores,zona patrimonio,objective establish strategic determin increase biodiversity valu within world heritage area city camaguey without compromis conservation its historical attribut exploratory methodology follow within framework update special plan comprehensive development zone need enhance ecosystem servic broad potential adjacent territory function center issu living organism urban space nota de autor autor de correspondencia correo electronico iemendezs58 gmail com cuaderno de vivienda urbanismo 2025 vol 18 issn 2027-2103 2145-0226 diagnos alternativ identi promote interaction peripheral reservoir guarantee necessary bioconnectivity promote green