manifest physical emotional psychological verbal sexual economic form physical violence being most prevalent conclusion although there government effort curb reduce type violence statistic do not indicate successful outcome statu women family environment domestic violence gender-bas violence los termino clave han sido recuperado partir del tesauro http vocabulari unesco org browser thesauru es domestic violence gender perspective peru during 2024 recurr problem violencia intrafamiliar na perspectiva de genero no peru em 2024 um problema recorrente articulo de revision do,1.0.0,79994ab0d0a255c6
2027-2448,2026-2+ART-5+(1).pdf,2026-2+ART-5+(1)_0,en,ARTÍCULO DE REFLEXIÓN,"Introduction: The incorporation of artificial intelligence into contract law has promoted automated forms of creating and performing obligations, including smart contracts, whose operation raises questions concerning their legal nature, validity, and regulation. Objective: To analyze the impact of these technologies on contractual relationships, define the concept of smart contracts, and assess their advantages and risks. Methodology: The study followed a qualitative research design with a descriptive and analytical scope, based on a documentary review of legal scholarship, comparative legislation, and specialized academic sources examined through legal and comparative analysis. Results: Smart contracts are not necessarily artificial intelligence systems, since they generally operate through previously programmed instructions. Although they may improve speed, reduce costs, and increase predictability, their rigidity, immutability, and potential anonymity create difficulties regarding party identification, error correction, and the application of legal remedies. Conclusions: Their development requires combining general principles of contract law with rules on transparency, identity verification, cybersecurity, and safe interruption, together with specialized dispute resolution mechanisms, among which arbitration stands out",Artificial intelligence; Automation; Security; Smart contracts,marcadores,articulo de reflexion,introduction incorporation artificial intelligence into contract law has promot automat form creat perform oblig includ smart contract whose operation rais question concern their legal nature validity regulation objective analyze impact these technologi contractual relationship define concept smart contract asses their advantag risk methodology study follow qualitative research design descriptive analytical scope based documentary review legal scholarship comparative legislation specializ academic sourc examin through legal comparative analysi result smart contract not necessarily artificial intelligence system since they generally operate through previously programm instruction although they may improve speed reduce cost increase predictability their rigidity immutability potential anonymity create difficulti regard party identification error correction application legal remedi conclusion their development requir combin general principl contract law rule transparency identity verification cybersecurity safe interruption together specializ dispute resolution mechanism among which arbitration stand out,artificial intelligence automation security smart contract,articulo de reflexion introduction incorporation artificial intelligence into contract law has promot automat form creat perform oblig includ smart contract whose operation rais question concern their legal nature validity regulation objective analyze impact these technologi contractual relationship define concept smart contract asses their advantag risk methodology study follow qualitative research design descriptive analytical scope based documentary review legal scholarship comparative legislation specializ academic sourc examin through legal comparative analysi result smart contract not necessarily artificial intelligence system since they generally operate through previously programm instruction although they may improve speed reduce cost increase predictability their rigidity immutability potential anonymity create difficulti regard party identification error correction application legal remedi conclusion their development requir combin general principl contract law rule transparency identity verification cybersecurity safe interruption together specializ dispute resolution mechanism among which arbitration stand out artificial intelligence automation security smart contract,1.0.0,7939e28df4c0274f
2027-2448,2026-2+ART-5+(1).pdf,2026-2+ART-5+(1)_0,es,"pe, based on a documentary review of legal scholarship, comparative legislation,","Introducción: La incorporación de la inteligencia artificial al derecho contractual ha impulsado formas automatizadas de celebración y ejecución de obligaciones, entre ellas los smart contracts, cuyo funcionamiento plantea dudas sobre su naturaleza jurídica, validez y regulación. Objetivo: Analizar la incidencia de estas tecnologías en las relaciones contractuales, delimitar el concepto de smart contract y valorar sus ventajas y riesgos. Metodología: Se desarrolló una investigación cualitativa, de alcance descriptivo y analítico, sustentada en la revisión documental de doctrina, legislación comparada y fuentes académicas especializadas, examinadas mediante el análisis jurídico y comparativo. Resultados: Los smart contracts no constituyen necesariamente sistemas de inteligencia artificial, pues suelen operar mediante instrucciones previamente programadas. Aunque favorecen la rapidez, la reducción de costos y la previsibilidad, su rigidez, inmutabilidad y posible anonimato dificultan la identificación de las partes, la corrección de errores y la aplicación de remedios jurídicos. Conclusiones: Su desarrollo requiere combinar los principios generales del derecho contractual con reglas sobre transparencia, verificación de identidad, ciberseguridad e interrupción segura, además de mecanismos especializados de solución de controversias, entre los cuales destaca el arbitraje",Inteligencia artificial; Automatización; Contratos inteligentes; Seguridad. La inteligencia artificial y el derecho contractual: Contratos inteligentes y retos jurídicos Inteligência Artificial e Direito dos Contratos: Contratos Inteligentes e Desafios Jurídicos RESEARCH ARTICLE DOI: https://doi.org/10.21803/penamer.19.40.1070 2 Artificial Intelligence and Contract Law: Smart Contracts and Legal,marcadores,pe based on documentary review of legal scholarship comparativ