alecta politica construccion observatorio asi como metodologi alinead propuesta discursivocritica redes pragmatic fin observar lugar educacion proceso reinsercion social observo trabajo gener discursiv multimodal --estructurad partir practica text discursiva orientada-- ayudo visualizar desencuentr posibl camin discursiv reexistencia entre person socioeducand participant investigacion politic public brasil adolescent situacion vulnerabilizacion social socioeducacion discurso estudi critic discurso redes pragmatic practica text discursiva orientada,1.0.0,d7bb67ee9c6ab4f6
2027-7458,Dialnet-AdolescenciaDiscursosEntrecruzadosEReexistencias-10837066.pdf,Dialnet-AdolescenciaDiscursosEntrecruzadosEReexistencias-10837066_0,en,"de justicia) de la Capital Federal, las secciones de esta reflexión abordarán el proceso","Grounded in the 1988 Federal Constitution, Brazil has been known by its legal frameworks on defending the rights of minority groups over the last twenty years. Despite the diverse multidimensional problems, the country has developed a landmark path in providing citizen support to historically vulnerable social groups. This is the case of adolescents in conflict with the law, who, supported by the Child and Adolescent Statute (ECA), find in Socio-education a means of redefining their life trajectories in society. Drawing on Critical Discourse Studies (ECD), this text intends to contribute to the socio-educational debate, interchanging considerations derived from the completed experience of developing a multisectoral project focused on Socio-education structure in Distrito Federal (Brazilian Federal District). The process of building a critic observatory, as well as methodologies aligned, were based on the discursive-critical approach of Pragmatic Networks. The Observatory project aimed to examine the role of education in the process of adolescents in conflict with the law social reintegration. It was observed that working with multimodal discursive genre structure based on Discursively Oriented Textual Practice - helped to visualize disagreements but also potential discursive ways for re-existence among the socio-educational participants who participated on the project","Public policies in Brazil; Adolescents in situations of social vulnerability; Socioeducation; Discourse; Critical Discourse Studies; Pragmatic Networks; Discursively Oriented Textual Practice. | 4 Gersiney Santos Enero - junio 2026 | Vol. 16 | No. 30 | Analecta Política Introdução No Brasil, com a oficialização da Carta Magna (Constituição Federal de 1988), foi 