2027-7458,Dialnet-EstudiarDiscursivamenteLasPoliticasPublicas-10837059.pdf,Dialnet-EstudiarDiscursivamenteLasPoliticasPublicas-10837059_0,en,"amos los enfoques y métodos empleados; 3) corpus, donde caracterizamos brevemente los","In this article, we reflect on the contributions that critical and interdisciplinary discourse studies can make to the formulation, implementation, and assessment of public policies, based on a case study. Using Critical Discourse Analysis and Critical Legal Studies, we analyze two public policy documents that regulate, in opposing ways, the right to gender identity in Argentina: Law 26.743, passed by the National Congress in 2012, and Presidential Decree 62, issued in 2025. The methodology is qualitative and inductive, and analysis was conducted using argumentation theory and the Method of Convergent Linguistic Approaches. The article includes the following sections: 1) introduction, where we address legal aspects of the right to gender identity; 2) theoreticalmethodological framework, where we explain the approaches and methods employed; 3) corpus, where we briefly describe the texts analyzed; 4) analytical results, where we present and exemplify the discursive representations that emerge from the analysis; and 5) reflections on the contributions of discourse studies to public policies. On this point, we argue that an important contribution of these studies is their effectiveness in measuring, assessing, and/or adjusting the adequacy between | 3 Matías Soich y Emiliano Litardo Enero - junio 2026 | Vol. 16 | No. 30 | Analecta Política the meanings produced by the linguistic materiality of public policy instruments, the orientations and demands they respond to, and their outcomes. To achieve this, we maintain, it is necessary to deepen the intersectoriality between academia and politics through activism","critical discourse analysis, critical legal studies, discursive representations, public policies, gender identity, minors",marcadores,amos los enfoqu metodo empleado corpu donde caracterizamo brevemente los,article we reflect contribution critical interdisciplinary discourse studi can make formulation implementation assessment public polici based case study using critical discourse analysi critical legal studi we analyze two public policy document regulate oppos ways right gender identity argentina law 26 743 pass national congres 2012 presidential decree 62 issu 2025 methodology qualitative inductive analysi conduct using argumentation theory method convergent linguistic approach article includ follow section introduction where we addres legal aspect right gender identity theoreticalmethodological framework where we explain approach method employ corpu where we briefly describe text analyz analytical result where we present exemplify discursive represent emerge analysi reflection contribution discourse studi public polici point we argue important contribution these studi their effectivenes measur assess adjust adequacy between matia soich emiliano litardo enero junio 2026 vol 16 no 30 analecta politica meaning produc linguistic materiality public policy instrument orient demand they respond their outcom achieve we maintain necessary deepen intersectoriality between academia politic through activism,critical discourse analysi critical legal studi discursive represent public polici gender identity minor,amos los enfoqu metodo empleado corpu donde caracterizamo brevemente los article we reflect contribution critical interdisciplinary discourse studi can make formulation implementation assessment public polici based case study using critical discourse analysi critical legal studi we analyze two public policy document regulate oppos ways right gender identity argentina law 26 743 pass national congres 2012 presidential decree 62 issu 2025 methodology qualitative inductive analysi conduct using argumentation theory method convergent linguistic approach article includ follow section introduction where we a