2145-132X,"gpalzate,+2145132X226__Cabrera_MAM_Vidal_OA.pdf","gpalzate,+2145132X226__Cabrera_MAM_Vidal_OA_0",en,debatirse entre la sostenibilidad del negocio y la esencia de,"In order to make lucrative cultural aspects of life (usually related with anthropological, ludic or artistic approaches) in recent years, there has increased concern and, speeches, about cultural organizations and cultural entrepreneurship. As a consequence of this boom in cultural management speeches, there have appeared movements against them then, there is prevention about more comprehensive views of management that could be useful. Some, in favor of this speeches, are between skepticism on business sustainability and, the maintenance of the essence about what cultural heritage symbolizes. Alejandra María Cabrera Martínez 387 Antonino Vidal Ortega HiSTOReLo. Revista de Historia Regional y Local ISSN: 2145-132X [vol 9, No. 18] Julio - diciembre de 2017 This paper evaluates the scientific production around the concept of organization and cultural heritage in Colombia, mainly because the term organization (not company or enterprise), reveals a more inclusive management perspective. This, required a systematic review in major publications. There were found just 8 papers containing the terms of interest. Finally, the word Organization is unusual, being more frequent Private institution or Company. It is expected an increasing of additional research, and transdisciplinary work about cultural heritage organization","organization, heritage, cultural heritage organization, management & complexity. Alejandra María Cabrera Martínez 388 Antonino Vidal Ortega HiSTOReLo. Revista de Historia Regional y Local ISSN: 2145-132X [vol 9, No. 18] Julio - diciembre de 2017",marcadores,debatirse entre la sostenibilidad del negocio la esencia de,order make lucrative cultural aspect life usually relat anthropological ludic artistic approach recent year there has increas concern speech about cultural organiz cultural entrepreneurship consequence boom cultural management speech there have appear movement against them then there prevention about more comprehensive view management could useful some favor speech between skepticism busines sustainability maintenance essence about what cultural heritage symboliz alejandra maria cabrera martinez 387 antonino vidal ortega historelo revista de historia regional local issn 2145-132x vol no 18 julio diciembre de 2017 paper evaluat scientific production around concept organ cultural heritage colombia mainly because term organ not company enterprise reveal more inclusive management perspective requir systematic review major public there found just paper contain term interest finally word organ unusual being more frequent private institution company expect increas additional research transdisciplinary work about cultural heritage organ,organ heritage cultural heritage organ management complexity alejandra maria cabrera martinez 388 antonino vidal ortega historelo revista de historia regional local issn 2145-132x vol no 18 julio diciembre de 2017,debatirse entre la sostenibilidad del negocio la esencia de order make lucrative cultural aspect life usually relat anthropological ludic artistic approach recent year there has increas concern speech about cultural organiz cultural entrepreneurship consequence boom cultural management speech there have appear movement against them then there prevention about more comprehensive view management could useful some favor speech between skepticism busines sustainability maintenance essence about what cultural heritage symboliz alejandra maria cabrera martinez 387 antonino vidal ortega historelo revista de historia regional local issn 2145-132x vol no 18 julio diciembre de 2017 paper evaluat scientific production around concept organ cultural heritage colombia mainly because term organ not company enterprise reveal more inclusive management perspective requir systematic review major public there found just p