2145-4531,15487-Rev+SocioJuridicos+27-2_JRMiranda+(1).pdf,15487-Rev+SocioJuridicos+27-2_JRMiranda+(1)_0,en,trascendencia: la Comisión Interamericana de Derechos Humanos (cidh) y la Corte,"In this opportunity, a general approach to the regional system for the protection of human rights enshrined in the Convention is made, highlighting the participation of two institutions of great importance: the Inter-American Commission on Human Rights (iachr) and the Inter-American Court of Human Rights (iachr Court). It also mentions issues related to the functioning and ineffectiveness of some of its instruments, including those methods or mechanisms available to the system to coerce States to comply with the content of the Court’s judgments. Finally, an analysis is made of the experience of the Colombian State with regard to the sentences imposed by the Inter-American Court, highlighting the types of orders that usually ensure compliance and the events in which compliance is usually difficult",Inter-American System; human rights; international respon sibility; Inter-American Court; reparation,marcadores,trascendencia la comision interamericana de derecho humano cidh la corte,opportunity general approach regional system protection human right enshrin convention made highlight participation two institution great importance inter-american commission human right iachr inter-american court human right iachr court also mention issu relat function ineffectivenes some its instrument includ those method mechanism available system coerce stat comply content court judgment finally analysi made experience colombian state regard sentenc impos inter-american court highlight type order usually ensure compliance event which compliance usually difficult,inter-american system human right international respon sibility inter-american court reparation,trascendencia la comision interamericana de derecho humano cidh la corte opportunity general approach regional system protection human right enshrin 