2145-6445,RLEF+17(2)_7.pdf,RLEF+17(2)_7_0,en,"ijos e hijas, las dualidades relativas a la","this article exposes the trajectory regarding the process of configuration of homosexual parenthood in men who were fathers in previous heterosexual relationships. He realizes their tensions, adjustments, expectations and challenges that they had to go through to assume a comprehensive parenthood that does not exclude them from their sexual orientation. In-depth interviews were conducted with 13 gay men from Santiago de Chile in times of pandemic, who recounted the transition they experienced between their sexual disclosure to their sons and daughters, the dualities related to homosexuality and fatherhood. Emotional tensions associated with internalized homophobia were found in the participants as a result of identity conflicts, initial perceptions of exclusion from fatherhood to homosexual life and fears of social stigmatization. Despite everything, the participants declare that they manage to integrate homosexuality and fatherhood with the support of their sons and daughters, incorporating models of “involved fatherhood.”","homosexuality, fatherhood, gay parents, internalized homophobia, , (Source: Thesaurus of the Real Academia Española)",marcadores,ijos hija las dualidad relativa la,article expos trajectory regard proces configuration homosexual parenthood men who father previou heterosexual relationship he realiz their tension adjustment expect challeng they had go through assume comprehensive parenthood does not exclude them their sexual orientation in-depth interview conduct 13 gay men santiago de chile time pandemic who recount transition they experienc between their sexual disclosure their sons daughter dualiti relat homosexuality fatherhood emotional tension associat internaliz homophobia found participant result identity conflict initial perception exclusion fatherhood homosexual life fear social stigmat despite everyth participant declare they manage integrate homosexuality fatherhood support their sons daughter incorporat model involv fatherhood,homosexuality fatherhood gay parent internaliz homophobia source thesauru real academia espanola,ijos hija las dualidad relativa la article expos trajectory regard proces configuration homosexual parenthood men who father previou heterosexual relationship he realiz their tension adjustment expect challeng they had go through assume comprehensive parenthood does not exclude them their sexual orientation in-depth interview conduct 13 gay men santiago de chile time pandemic who recount transition they experienc between their sexual disclosure their sons daughter dualiti relat homosexuality fatherhood emotional tension associat internaliz homophobia found participant result identity conflict initial perception exclusion fatherhood homosexual life fear social stigmat despite everyth participant declare they manage integrate homosexuality fatherhood support their sons daughter incorporat model involv fatherhood homosexuality fatherhood gay parent internaliz homophobia source thesauru real academia espanola,1.0.0,de6796313646fd35
2145-6569,ESCALA DE ACTITUD SOBRE EL CONSUMO DE SUSTANCIAS PSICOACTIVAS.pdf,ESCALA DE ACTITUD SOBRE EL CONSUMO DE SUSTANCIAS PSICOACTIVAS_0,es,/revistadepsicologiagepu.es.tl/Vol-.--14-No-.--1.htm,"El presente artículo presenta los pasos del proceso de elaboración de una escala de actitud sobre el consumo de sustancias psicoactivas ilícitas en estudiantes universitarixs, creada por estudiantes de pregrado en psicología en su proceso formativo para su curso de diseño de instrumentos en psicología. Son presentados cinco capítulos, que relatan características generales de la prueba, su análisis estadístico y la utilidad y valor de este ejercicio para el proceso formativo de los estudiantes. Se espera que este material sirva para otorgar perspectiva respecto a los intereses de psicólogos en formación en la actualidad y la metodología utilizada para gestar y afianzar sus conocimientos en psicometría","Escala Likert, estudiantes universitarixs, sustancias psicoactivas",marcadores,revistadepsicologiagepu tl vol- 14-no- htm,presente articulo presenta pasos proceso elaboracion escala actitud sobre consumo sustanci psicoactiv ilicit estudiant universitarixs creada estudiant pregrado psicologia proceso formativo curso diseno instrument psicologia son presentad cinco capitul relatan caracteristic general prueba analisis estadistico utilidad valor este ejercicio proceso formativo estudiant espera este material sirva otorgar perspectiva respecto interes psicolog formacion actualidad metodologia utilizada gestar afianzar sus conoc psicometria,escala likert estudiant universitarixs sustanci psicoactiv,revistadepsicologiagepu tl vol- 14-no- htm presente articulo presenta pasos proceso elaboracion escala actitud sobre consumo sustanci psicoactiv ilicit estudiant universitarixs creada estudiant pregrado psicologia proceso formativo curso diseno instrument psicologia son presentad cinco capitul relatan caracteristic general prueba analisis estadistico utilidad valor este ejercicio proce