2145-7778,3860_18(39).pdf,3860_18(39)_0,en,encia artificial,"The purpose of this article is to explore the uses and applications of generative artificial intelligence in advancing knowledge within the field of educational research in Mexico. It also aims to examine the positions adopted by the academic community regarding the advantages, disadvantages, and future prospects that this technology presents in the professional sphere. To this end, an exploratory study was conducted using a predominantly quantitative approach, complemented by qualitative methods. Through non-probabilistic convenience sampling, a sample of 140 active educational researchers registered in the National System of Researchers in Mexico was selected for the study, representing 27 states across the country. Data were collected by means of a specially designed digital questionnaire. Quantitative analyses (including descriptive statistics and chi-square tests) were performed in spss, while the qualitative data were analyzed through thematic coding in atlas.ti. The results reveal an emerging yet consistent association between the use of generative artificial intelligence and knowledge production in the field of educational research. At the same time, participants expressed significant reservations concerning its advantages, disadvantages, and future prospects. In conclusion, the findings emphasize the need to develop regulatory frameworks that promote the ethical use of these emerging technologies, while also highlighting the importance of restructuring the education and training of new generations of educational researchers","higher education, academic ethics, generative artificial intelligence, educational research in Mexico, knowledge production",marcadores,encia artificial,purpose article explore uses applic generative artificial intelligence advanc knowledge within field educational research mexico also aims examine position adopt academic community regard advantag disadvantag future prospect technology present professional sphere end exploratory study conduct using predominantly quantitative approach complement qualitative method through non-probabilistic convenience sampl sample 140 active educational researcher register national system researcher mexico select study represent 27 stat acros country data collect mean specially design digital questionnaire quantitative analys includ descriptive statistic chi-square test perform spss while qualitative data analyz through thematic coding atla ti result reveal emerg yet consistent association between use generative artificial intelligence knowledge production field educational research same time participant express significant reserv concern its advantag disadvantag future prospect conclusion finding emphasize need develop regulatory framework promote ethical use these emerg technologi while also highlight importance restructur education train new gener educational researcher,higher education academic ethic generative artificial intelligence educational research mexico knowledge production,encia artificial purpose article explore uses applic generative artificial intelligence advanc knowledge within field educational research mexico also aims examine position adopt academic community regard advantag disadvantag future prospect technology present professional sphere end exploratory study conduct using predominantly quantitative approach complement qualitative method through non-probabilistic convenience sampl sample 140 active educational researcher register national system researcher mexico select study represent 27 stat acros country data collect mean specially design digital questionnaire quantitative analys includ descriptive statistic chi-square test perform spss while qualitative data analyz through thematic coding atla ti result reveal emerg yet consistent association between use generative artificial intelligence knowledge production field educational research same time participant express significan