2215-8405,Dialnet-EstudioPreliminarDeLaCadenaDeValorGeneradaPorElTur-10408985.pdf,Dialnet-EstudioPreliminarDeLaCadenaDeValorGeneradaPorElTur-10408985_0,en,l que intervienen diferentes actividades y,"This research aimed to analyze how the various components of the value chain are integrated into the tourism offer of the main destinations in the Province of Chubut. Since tourism involves a wide range of activities and processes, this analysis allows us to identify the stakeholders participating in the creation of each product and the relationships formed at each stage of the value chain. Data was gathered from accommodation providers, tour operators, and gastronomy businesses through surveys targeted at their owners and/or managers. The study analyzed variables characterizing the companies, such as size, source of capital, and age, alongside factors related to the value chain, including internal cost structures, investments in construction and equipment, inputs, and supply forms","Tourism economy; economic development; regional economy; production and organizations; statistical methodology Análise preliminar da cadeia de valor gerada pelo turismo na Província de Chubut, Argentina",marcadores,que intervienen diferent actividad,research aimed analyze how variou component value chain integrat into tourism offer main destin province chubut since tourism involv wide range activiti process analysi allow us identify stakeholder participat creation each product relationship form each stage value chain data gather accommodation provider tour operator gastronomy business through survey target their owner manager study analyz variabl characteriz compani such size source capital age alongside factor relat value chain includ internal cost structur investment construction equipment input supply form,tourism economy economic development regional economy production organiz statistical methodology analise preliminar da cadeia de valor gerada pelo turismo na provincia de chubut argenti