2215-8405,Dialnet-MadurezEmpresarialYGestionDeProyectosCasoDeEstudio-10408986.pdf,Dialnet-MadurezEmpresarialYGestionDeProyectosCasoDeEstudio-10408986_0,en,Resumen: la gestión de proyecto (GP) es determinante en la madurez empresarial (ME) para medir,"Project management (PM) plays a crucial role in business maturity (BM), serving as a means to assess the state and processes of companies. This article reports on a study that measured BM in 34 Colombian Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs) in the textile and apparel sector using an applied case study and the Colombian Project Management Maturity Model (CP3M). Multiple regression analysis was used to identify the CP3M variables most significant in explaining BM. The findings revealed that 94% of the SMEs studied exhibited BM, primarily driven by project conceptualization and the planning process",Company performance; other non-durable consumer goods; clothing; textiles; project evaluation; production management. Maturidade de negócios e gestão de projetos. Estudo de caso em pymes colombianas do setor têxtil,marcadores,resumen la gestion de proyecto gp es determinante en la madurez empresarial me para medir,project management pm play crucial role busines maturity bm serv mean asses state process compani article report study measur bm 34 colombian small medium enterpris smes textile apparel sector using appli case study colombian project management maturity model cp3m multiple regression analysi used identify cp3m variabl most significant explain bm finding reveal 94 smes studi exhibit bm primarily driven project conceptual plann proces,company performance other non-durable consumer good cloth textil project evaluation production management maturidade de negocio gestao de projeto estudo de caso em pyme colombiana do setor textil,resumen la gestion de proyecto gp es determinante en la madurez empresarial me para medir project management pm play crucial role busines maturity bm serv mean asses state process compani article r