2215-8405,Dialnet-SignificadosDeExperienciasEspiritualesEnElMundoOrg-10408982.pdf,Dialnet-SignificadosDeExperienciasEspiritualesEnElMundoOrg-10408982_0,en,a diversos trabajadores de diferentes empresas de la ciudad,"This article presents the findings of a qualitative, descriptive-interpretative study with a phenomenological approach applied to a case study based on semi-structured interviews with workers from various companies in Medellín. The study aimed to characterize the meanings of individual experiences of spirituality in the organizational and work environment. The results indicate that spirituality fosters well-being, helps individuals understand and manage emotions, cope with stress, find meaning in their work, and feel connected to their community and teams. In essence, workplace spirituality is experienced as a motivating and energizing force that supports selfactualization and a sense of transcendence","spirituality, spirituality at work, experiences of spirituality. Significados das experiências espirituais no mundo organizacional e do trabalho",marcadores,diverso trabajador de diferent empresa de la ciudad,article present finding qualitative descriptive-interpretative study phenomenological approach appli case study based semi-structur interview worker variou compani medellin study aimed characterize meaning individual experienc spirituality organizational work environment result indicate spirituality foster well-be help individual understand manage emotion cope stres find mean their work feel connect their community team essence workplace spirituality experienc motivat energiz force support selfactual sense transcendence,spirituality spirituality work experienc spirituality significado das experiencia espirituai no mundo organizacional do trabalho,diverso trabajador de diferent empresa de la ciudad article present finding qualitative descriptive-interpretative study phenomenological approach appli case study based semi-structur interview worker variou