2215-8944,(11).+(2025).+RA&D.+Artículo.+El+juvenicidio....pdf,(11).+(2025).+RA&D.+Artículo.+El+juvenicidio..._0,en,rena Cecilia Mancera Panza,"This article analyzes the role of the media in the coverage of cases of juvenicide in Comuna 13 of Medellín between 2009 and 2018. Based on a qualitative study, news reports published in the newspapers El Tiempo and El Colombiano related to this area of the city were reviewed. The results of the research made it possible to describe the representations constructed by the press, understood as symbolic forms through which stigmatized identities of youth were configured. Likewise, the study identified the themes that predominated in the way the reality of Comuna 13 was narrated, the characteristics that were highlighted regarding the murdered individuals, and the ideas that contributed to consolidating a partial view of juvenicide. Finally, it concludes that the media played an important role in the production of stigmatizing representations that tended to criminalize youth from popular sectors and that influenced, in different ways, their processes of identity construction",discourse analysis; identities; juvenicide; media; violence,marcadores,rena cecilia mancera panza,article analyz role media coverage case juvenicide comuna 13 medellin between 2009 2018 based qualitative study news report publish newspaper el tiempo el colombiano relat area city review result research made possible describe represent construct pres understood symbolic form through which stigmatiz identiti youth configur likewise study identifi them predominat way reality comuna 13 narrat characteristic highlight regard murder individual idea contribut consolidat partial view juvenicide finally conclud media play important role production stigmatiz represent tend criminalize youth popular sector influenc different ways their process identity construction,discourse analysi identiti juvenicide media violence,rena cecilia mancera panza article analyz role media 