ccion academica especifica restitucion tierr justificacion transicional colombia otros pais latinoamerican cual tienen mayoria experienci similar postconflicto principal line investigacion presente estudio abordan efectividad restitucion como mecanismo reparacion seguridad retorno victim asi como consolidacion paz desde punto vista territorial cual evidencia vaci analisis regional proces evaluacion goce efectivo derech cual indica reto formulacion politic orientad equidad sostenibilidad concluye tierr aunque aplicacion representa limit asociad desigualdad territorial falta seguridad proteccion zonas rural plantea necesidad profundizar estudio goce efectivo derech desde enfoque regional permita valorar avanc desafi diferencial construccion paz reconciliacion social construccion paz garantia derech restitucion tierr violencia,1.0.0,d76b15cbf89db410
2215-8944,(6).+(2025).+RA&D.+Artículo.+Garantía+de+derechos+en+restitución+de+tierras+y+el+aporte+a+la+construcción+de+paz.pdf,(6).+(2025).+RA&D.+Artículo.+Garantía+de+derechos+en+restitución+de+tierras+y+el+aporte+a+la+construcción+de+paz_0,en,en la restitución como un mecanismo de reparación para la seguridad y el retorno de,"This article provides a systematic review of the literature on the guarantee of rights in land restitution processes and their contribution to peacebuilding in Colombia. The discussion is framed within Law 1448 of 2011, which established the guidelines for public policy on comprehensive reparations for victims of armed conflict, highlighting the progress made and the challenges faced in its implementation throughout the country. A documentary methodology was adopted, using bibliometric analysis techniques applied to scientific publications indexed in databases such as Web of Science (WoS), Scopus, and Google Scholar, for the period between 2019 and 2024. Production, impact, and scientific collaboration indicators were analyzed to identify authors, countries, and institutions that have led the theoretical and empirical development of the topic. The main lines of research address the effectiveness of restitution as a mechanism for reparation, the security and return of victims, and the consolidation of peace from a territorial perspective. Gaps are identified in the regional analysis of processes and in the evaluation of the effective enjoyment of rights, which represents a challenge for the formulation of more equitable and sustainable policies. It is concluded that Law 1448 of 2011 has enabled significant progress in terms of land reparations and restitution, although its implementation has limitations associated with territorial inequality and security conditions in rural areas. There is a need to further study the effective enjoyment of rights from a regional perspective, which would allow for an assessment of the differential progress and challenges in peacebuilding and social reconciliation. Garantía de derechos en restitución de tierras y el aporte a la construcción de paz 3 Revista Academia & Derecho, Año 16. No. 31, p.p. 1- 25 Julio – Diciembre 2025. E-ISSN: 2539 – 4983 Artículo de Investigación","Land restitution, peacebuilding, rights guarantees, violence",marcadores,en la restitucion como un mecanismo de reparacion para la seguridad el retorno de,article provid systematic review literature guarantee right land restitution process their contribution peacebuild colombia discussion fram within law 1448 2011 which establish guidelin public policy comprehensive repar victim armed conflict highlight progres made challeng faced its implementation throughout country documentary methodology adopt using bibliometric analysi techniqu appli scientific public index databas such web science wos scopu google scholar period between 2019 2024 production impact scientific collaboration indicator analyz identify author countri institution have led theoretical empirical development topic main line research addres effectivenes restitution mechanism reparation security return victim consolidation peace territorial perspective gaps identifi regional analysi process evaluation effective enjoyment right which represent challenge formulation more equitable sustainable polici conclud law 1448 2011 has enabl significant progres term land repar restitution although its implementation has limit associat territorial inequality security condition rural area there need further study effective enjoyment right regional perspective which would allow assessment differential progres challeng peacebuild social reconciliation garantia de derecho en restitucion de tierra el aporte la construccion de paz revista academia derecho ano 16 no 31 1- 25 julio diciembre 2025 e-issn 2539 4983 articulo de investigacion,land restitution peacebuild right guarante violence,en la restitucion como un mecanismo de reparacion para la seguridad el ret