2215-9959,A5_MAVAE+21-2_vf2.pdf,A5_MAVAE+21-2_vf2_0,en,"de Recursos Hídricos,","] [RESUMO] This article reflects on the creation process behind Río polifónico: Partitura colectiva para leer en voz alta, a text that inhabits the border between sound, drawing, body, voice, editorial curation, research, musical composition and graphic design. Inspired by the Chorus of Singing Rivers, a collaborative artistic-research project that proposes choral listening as a pedagogical practice that attends to the polyphonic voices of rivers, we conduct workshops about reading mediated with neighbors of the Bogotá River in five public libraries in the city. Through listening exercises and creative writing, we activate our sound imagination and explore ways to coexist with a river that has been declared dead, but still insists on life through various everyday care actions. The texts that resulted from these workshops have inspired the creative process of a polyphonic river, where the singularity of each voice-text is maintained while multiple voices interweave. In this article, first, we address the conceptual reflection offered in the Chorus of Singing Rivers through the lens of interdisciplinary sound studies and political ecology of water. Second, we center our reflection on four dimensions of the creative process: listening and creative writing, curation, drawing, and musical composition, as well as in the rehersals as a process of permanent listening, experimentation, and mutual attunement. We share learnings from this path of creating a living text to be read aloud, by multiple voices and with the body","choral listening; polyphony; performance; graphical score; Bogotá River; reading mediation Este artigo reflete sobre o processo criativo por trás de Rio polifônico: Partitura coletiva para leitura em voz alta, uma publicação que habita a fronteira entre som, desenho, corpo, voz, curadoria editorial, pesquisa, composição musical e design gráfico. Inspirados pelo Coro de rios que cantam, um pr",marcadores,de recurso hidrico,resumo article reflect creation proces behind rio polifonico partitura colectiva para leer en voz alta text inhabit border between sound draw body voice editorial curation research musical composition graphic design inspir choru sing river collaborative artistic-research project propos choral listen pedagogical practice attend polyphonic voic river we conduct workshop about read mediat neighbor bogota river five public librari city through listen exercis creative writ we activate our sound imagination explore ways coexist river has been declar dead but still insist life through variou everyday care action text result these workshop have inspir creative proces polyphonic river where singularity each voice-text maintain while multiple voic interweave article first we addres conceptual reflection offer choru sing river through lens interdisciplinary sound studi political ecology water second we center our reflection four dimension creative proces listen creative writ curation draw musical composition well rehersal proces permanent listen experimentation mutual attunement we share learning path creat living text read aloud multiple voic body,choral listen polyphony performance graphical score bogota river read mediation este artigo reflete sobre processo criativo por tras de rio polifonico partitura coletiva para leitura em voz alta uma publicacao que habita fronteira entre som desenho corpo voz curadoria editorial pesquisa composicao musical design grafico inspirado pelo coro de rios que cantam um pr,de recurso hidrico resumo article reflect creation proces behind rio polifonico partitura colectiva para leer en voz alta text inhabit border between sound draw body voice editorial curation research musical composition graphic design inspir choru sing river collaborative artistic-research project propos choral listen pedagogical practice attend polyphonic voic river we conduct workshop about read mediat neighbor bogota river f