2215-9959,A9_MAVAE+21-2_vfw.pdf,A9_MAVAE+21-2_vfw_0,en,Fecha de recepción: 9 de enero de 2026,"] [RESUMO] This article is a theatrical, peripheral essay that attempts to link living systems with the purpose of rewilding creativity and enswamping thought around the intelligence of water. Through various speculative gestures, we weave threads of water in which stories, theories, declarations and experiences come together, moving us to submerge our imaginations in the landwaters of the Ciénaga de la Virgen and the Amazonian rainforest, in such a way that their (in) fluence might allow us to become marshy, jungly creatures. As a result of this four-handed creative writing process, we present a manifesto that performs a swampy, marshy, jungly ontoepistemology, from which opportunities to wetxist ourselves emerge. We end this proposal with an invitation to act out aqueous thought practices, based on ecosomatic listening, immersion and composting, to imagine hereafters that conjure a life on the edges of our apocalyptic stories of the future. This article is a part of the artistic-research project Aqua Sapiens","water; posthumanism; manifesto; ecosomatics; Amazon rainforest, Ciénaga de la Virgen. Aqua Sapiens: um manifesto cênico para alagar o pensamento e reselvaginizar a criatividade Este artigo constitui um ensaio cênico de fronteira que visa propor, em torno da inteligência da água, conexões entre sistemas vivos para reselvaginizar a criatividade e alagar o pensamento. Através de diversos gesto",marcadores,fecha de recepcion de enero de 2026,resumo article theatrical peripheral essay attempt link living system purpose rewild creativity enswamp thought around intelligence water through variou speculative gestur we weave thread water which stori theori declar experienc come together moving us submerge our imagin landwater cienaga de la virgen amazonian rainforest such way their fluence might allow us become marshy jungly creatur result four-hand creative writ proces we p