2256-2958,361359_compressed.pdf,361359_compressed_0,en,eISSN: 2256-2958,"Background: Bovine trichomoniasis, caused by Tritrichomonas foetus, is a venereal disease that affects the reproductive efficiency of cattle, especially in extensive breeding systems. Infected bulls could spread the protozoan by artificial insemination if the semen is contaminated. Loop-mediated isothermal amplification (LAMP) is an alternative assay for detecting pathogen genetic material without the need to purify inhibitors from a biological sample. Objective: To detect T. foetus in cryopreserved semen and genital fluids from bulls raised in Sonora, Mexico, by a colorimetric LAMP assay. Methods: The conditions for a colorimetric LAMP assay were standardized using PCR as an analytical reference to detect T. foetus (crLAMP-TF). A total of 110 preputial samples were tested by crLAMP-TF. From positive males to T. foetus (bTF+), seminal samples were collected, cryopreserved, and tested by crLAMP-TF. Results: The crLAMP-TF assay was sensitive and allowed visual detection at 35 minutes, without the need for inhibitors or purification of biological samples, prior to DNA extraction. The 29.1% of the bulls were bTF+, and 27.3% of the cryopreserved semen from bTF+ pools were contaminated. Conclusion: This survey confirms the presence of T. foetus in Sonora, Mexico, and the ability of the protozoan to contaminate semen, which represents a potential risk of transmission during assisted reproduction programs by artificial insemination. The crLAMPTF assay represents a viable alternative to traditional molecular techniques, with potential in the epidemiological surveillance of pathogens under field conditions","biosafety, esmegma, LAMP, molecular diagnostics, semen, trichomoniasis. Detección colorimétrica mediante ensayo LAMP de Tritrichomonas foetus en fluido prepucial y semen de toros criados en Sonora, México Detecção colorimétrica por ensaio LAMP de Tritrichomonas foetus em fluido prepucial e sêmen de touros criados em Sonora, México Gustavo-Francisco Oroz-Rojo1 ; Carlos-Eduardo Aragón-López1",marcadores,eissn 2256-2958,background bovine trichomoniasi caus tritrichomona foetu venereal disease affect reproductive efficiency cattle especially extensive breed system infect bull could spread protozoan artificial insemination if semen contaminat loop-mediat isothermal amplification lamp alternative assay detect pathogen genetic material without need purify inhibitor biological sample objective detect foetu cryopreserv semen genital fluid bull rais sonora mexico colorimetric lamp assay method condition colorimetric lamp assay standardiz using pcr analytical reference detect foetu crlamp-tf total 110 preputial sampl test crlamp-tf positive male foetu btf seminal sampl collect cryopreserv test crlamp-tf result crlamp-tf assay sensitive allow visual detection 35 minut without need inhibitor purification biological sampl prior dna extraction 29 bull btf 27 cryopreserv semen btf pool contaminat conclusion survey confirm presence foetu sonora mexico ability protozoan contaminate semen which represent potential risk transmission during assist reproduction program artificial insemination crlamptf assay represent viable alternative traditional molecular techniqu potential epidemiological surveillance pathogen under field condition,biosafety esmegma lamp molecular diagnostic semen trichomoniasi deteccion colorimetrica mediante ensayo lamp de tritrichomona foetu en fluido prepucial semen de toro criado en sonora mexico deteccao colorimetrica por ensaio lamp de tritrichomona foetu em fluido prepucial semen de touro criado em sonora mexico gustavo-francisco oroz-rojo1 carlos-eduardo aragon-lopez1,eissn 2256-2958 background bovine trichomoniasi caus tritrichomona foetu venereal disease affect reproductive efficiency cattle especially extensive breed system infect bull could spread protozoan artificial insemination if semen contaminat loop-mediat isothermal amplification lamp alternat