2256-5248,Rhela-28-48-m-15-42.pdf,Rhela-28-48-m-15-42_0,en,rategia investigativa se,"Objective: This article aims to analyse the historical development of women’s education in Manizales during Colombia’s Liberal Republic in (1930-1946), identifying the political, religious, and cultural tensions that influenced women’s access to the educational system. Originality/Contribution: This study is relevant because it contributes to the historiography of Colombian education from a gender perspective. This is a relatively unexplored field at regional and national levels, particularly in relation to the role of educational reforms and the ideological disputes between liberalism and conservatism. The method used corresponds to the socio-historical approach, based on the heuristic method of historical research, oriented 17 Rev. hist.edu.latinoam - Vol. 28 No. 48, enero - junio 2026 - ISSN: 0122-7238 - pp. 15 - 42 Origen de la educación femenina en Manizales y el impacto de la hegemonía liberal towards the search, location, selection, and critical analysis of primary and secondary sources. Method: The research was conducted in four phases: heuristics, doxography, etiology, and historical synthesis. This enabled the organization, interpretation, and comparison of documentary information from archives, statistical yearbooks, educational legislation, historical newspapers, and historiographical studies. Strategies/Information Gathering: The research strategy employed critical analysis of documentary sources and the historical contextualization of the educational process in relation to liberal reforms and the influence of the Church on the organization of the educational system. Conclusions: It is concluded that, although the Liberal Republic promoted legal reforms aimed at expanding educational opportunities for women, in the context of Manizales these reforms coexisted with cultural, religious, and political resistance that conditioned their implementation. This shaped a gradual process of female educational inclusion marked by tensions, progress, and persistent inequalities",history of education; women’s education; social history; educational reforms; liberal republic; religious education. As Origens da Educação Feminina em Manizales e o Impacto da Hegemonia Liberal,marcadores,rategia investigativa se,objective article aims analyse historical development women education manizal during colombia liberal republic 1930-1946 identify political religiou cultural tension influenc women acces educational system originality contribution study relevant because contribut historiography colombian education gender perspective relatively unexplor field regional national level particularly relation role educational reform ideological disput between liberalism conservatism method used correspond socio-historical approach based heuristic method historical research orient 17 rev hist edu latinoam vol 28 no 48 enero junio 2026 issn 0122-7238 pp 15 42 origen de la educacion femenina en manizal el impacto de la hegemonia liberal toward search location selection critical analysi primary secondary sourc method research conduct four phas heuristic doxography etiology historical synthesi enabl organ interpretation comparison documentary information archiv statistical yearbook educational legislation historical newspaper historiographical studi strategi information gather research strategy employ critical analysi documentary sourc historical contextual educational proces relation liberal reform influence church organ educational system conclusion conclud although liberal republic promot legal reform aimed expand educational opportuniti women context manizal these reform coexist cultural religiou political resistance condition their implementation shap gradual proces female educational inclusion mark tension progres persistent inequaliti,history education women education social history educational reform liberal republic religiou education origen da educacao feminina em manizal impacto da hegemonia liberal,rategia investigativa se objective article aims analyse historical development women education manizal during colombia liberal republic 1930-1946 identify political religiou cultural tension influenc women acces educational system originality contribution study relevant because contribut historiography colombian education gender perspective relatively unexplor field regional national level particularly relation role educational reform ideological disput between liberalism conservatism method used correspond socio-historical approach based heuristic method historical research orient 17 rev hist edu latinoam vol 28 no 48 enero junio 2026 issn 0122-7238 pp 15 42 origen de la educacion femenina en manizal el impacto de la hegemonia liberal toward search location selection critical analysi primary secondary sourc method research conduct four phas heuristic doxography etiology historical synthesi enabl organ interpretation comparison documentary information archiv statistical yearbook educational legislation historical newspaper historiographical studi strategi information gather research strategy employ critical analysi documentary sourc historical contextual educational proces relation liberal reform influence church organ educational system conclusion conclud although liberal republic promot legal reform aimed expand educational opportuniti women context manizal these reform coexist cultural religiou political resistance condition their implementation shap gradual proces female educational inclusion mark tension progres persistent inequaliti history education women education social history educational reform liberal republic religiou education origen da educacao feminina em manizal impacto da hegemonia liberal,1.0.0,101d9ff603643122
2256-5248,Rhela-28-48-m-165-184.pdf,Rhela-28-48-m-165-184_0,es,Elisângela Cândido da Silva Dewes1,"Objetivo: este estudio tiene como objetivo identificar cómo se reconfiguraron las instituciones escolares en el contexto de las inundaciones que afectaron al estado de Río Grande del Sur entre abril y mayo de 2024, y propone entendimientos sobre los significados construidos a partir de la transformación de las escuelas en espacios de refugio para la comunidad afectada. 166 Rev. hist.edu.latinoam - Vol. 28 No. 48, enero - junio 2026 - ISSN: 0122-7238 - pp. 165 - 184 Elisângela Cândido da Silva Dewes, José Edimar de Souza Originalidad/Contribución: este artículo contribuye a recomponer una historia de estas escuelas de refugio, a través de la protección y la resonancia de los recuerdos de esta comunidad escolar, más allá de la investigación. Método: se apoya teórica y metodológicamente en la perspectiva de la historia cultural en diálogo con la historia de la educación, para aportar de manera original al ámbito educativo, ya que busca resaltar cómo la escuela se ha reinventado y reorganizado ante una situación de crisis climática, y ha cooperado para la resiliencia y reconstrucción de las comunidades afectadas. Estrategias/Recolección de información: el estudio articula la historia oral con el análisis documental, para lo cual la trayectoria metodológica comprende la recolección y análisis de documentos de organismos gubernamentales, registros de la prensa regional y nacional, además de recuerdos de personas de la comunidad escolar que trabajaron en la recepción de los afectados por las inundaciones, a través de entrevistas (semiestructuradas) recolectadas en el primer semestre de 2025. Conclusiones: entre los resultados se evidencia que la reconfiguración física de las escuelas en el contexto de las inundaciones, no se limitó a una adaptación funcional, sino que constituyó un proceso de resignificación institucional, en el que las escuelas asumieron un papel significativo en la producción de redes de solidaridad, resiliencia y reconstrucción comunitaria. De esta manera, ampliaron el sentido social y se afirmaron como espacios de formación ciudadana y de promoción del bienestar colectivo",Revista de Historia de la Educación Latinoamericana; inundaciones; Río Grande del Sur; historia de la educación; memorias; escuelas-refugio. Floods in Rio Grande do Sul: Reconfigurations and Perceptions of Schools as Spaces of Refuge,marcadores,elisangela candido da silva dewes1,objetivo este estudio tiene como objetivo identificar como reconfiguraron institucion escolar contexto inund afectaron estado rio grande sur entre abril mayo 2024 propone entend sobre significad construid partir transformacion escuel espaci refugio comunidad afectada 166 rev hist edu latinoam vol 28 no 48 enero junio 2026 issn 0122-7238 pp 165 184 elisangela candido da silva dewes jose edimar souza originalidad contribucion este articulo contribuye recomponer historia estas escuel refugio trav proteccion resonancia recuerd esta comunidad escolar mas alla investigacion metodo apoya teorica metodologica perspectiva historia cultural dialogo historia educacion aportar manera original ambito educativo ya busca resaltar como escuela ha reinventado reorganizado ante situacion crisis climatica ha cooperado resiliencia reconstruccion comunidad afectad estrategi recoleccion informacion estudio articula historia oral analisis documental cual trayectoria metodologica comprende recoleccion analisis document organism gubernamental registr prensa regional nacional adem recuerd person comunidad escolar trabajaron recepcion afectad inund trav entrevist semiestructurad recolectad primer semestre 2025 conclusion entre resultad evidencia reconfiguracion fisica escuel contexto inund no limito adaptacion funcional sino constituyo proceso resignificacion institucional escuel asumieron papel significativo produccion redes solidaridad resiliencia reconstruccion comunitaria esta manera ampliaron sentido social afirmaron como espaci formacion ciudadana promocion bienestar colectivo,revista historia educacion latinoamericana inund rio grande sur historia educacion memori escuelas-refugio floods in rio grande do sul reconfigurations and perceptions of schools as spac of refuge,elisangela candido da silva dewes1 objetivo este estudio tiene como objetivo identificar como reconfiguraron institucion escolar contexto inund afectaron estado rio grande sur entre abril mayo 2024 propone entend sobre significad construid partir transformacion escuel espaci refugio comunidad afectada 166 rev hist edu latinoam vol 28 no 48 enero junio 2026 issn 0122-7238 pp 165 184 elisangela candido da silva dewes jose edimar souza originalidad contribucion este articulo contribuye recomponer historia estas escuel refugio trav proteccion resonancia recuerd esta comunidad escolar mas alla investigacion metodo apoya teorica metodologica perspectiva historia cultural dialogo historia educacion aportar manera original ambito educativo ya busca resaltar como escuela ha reinventado reorganizado ante situacion crisis climatica ha cooperado resiliencia reconstruccion comunidad afectad estrategi recoleccion informacion estudio articula historia oral analisis documental cual trayectoria metodologica comprende recoleccion analisis document organism gubernamental registr prensa regional nacional adem recuerd person comunidad escolar trabajaron recepcion afectad inund trav entrevist semiestructurad recolectad primer semestre 2025 conclusion entre resultad evidencia reconfiguracion fisica escuel contexto inund no limito adaptacion funcional sino constituyo proceso resignificacion institucional escuel asumieron papel significativo produccion redes solidaridad resiliencia reconstruccion comunitaria esta manera ampliaron sentido social afirmaron como espaci formacion ciudadana promocion bienestar colectivo revista historia educacion latinoamericana inund rio grande sur historia educacion memori escuelas-refugio floods in rio grande do sul reconfigurations and perceptions of schools as spac of refuge,1.0.0,96c47024e947cc4c
2256-5248,Rhela-28-48-m-165-184.pdf,Rhela-28-48-m-165-184_0,en,n de los afectados por,"Objective: This study aims to identify how school institutions were reconfigured in the context of the floods that affected the state of Rio Grande do Sul between April and May 2024, and proposes understandings about the meanings constructed from the transformation of schools into spaces of refuge for the affected community. Originality/Contribution: This paper contributes to reconstructing a history of these refuge schools, through the protection and the resonance of the memories of this school community, beyond the research itself. Method: The article is theoretically and methodologically based on the perspective of cultural history in dialogue with the history of education, to 167 Rev. hist.edu.latinoam - Vol. 28 No. 48, enero - junio 2026 - ISSN: 0122-7238 - pp. 165 - 184 Inundaciones en Río Grande del Sur: reconfiguraciones y percepciones sobre las escuelas como espacios de refugio contribute in an original way to the educational field, as it seeks to highlight how the school has reinvented and reorganized itself in the face of a climate crisis situation, and has cooperated for the resilience and reconstruction of the affected communities. Data Collection Strategies: The study combines oral history and documentary analysis, including government documents, press records, and semi-structured interviews conducted in the first half of 2025 with members of the school community involved in assisting those affected. Conclusions: The reconfiguration of schools went beyond functional adaptation, becoming a process of institutional resignification. Schools played a key role in building solidarity networks, resilience, and community reconstruction, strengthening their social function as spaces for citizenship education and collective well-being",Journal of the History of Latin American Education; floods; Rio Grande do Sul; history of education; memory; refuge schools. Inundações no Rio Grande do Sul: reconfigurações e percepções das escolas como espaços de refúgio,marcadores,de los afectado por,objective study aims identify how school institution reconfigur context flood affect state rio grande do sul between april may 2024 propos understanding about meaning construct transformation school into spac refuge affect community originality contribution paper contribut reconstruct history these refuge school through protection resonance memori school community beyond research itself method article theoretically methodologically based perspective cultural history dialogue history education 167 rev hist edu latinoam vol 28 no 48 enero junio 2026 issn 0122-7238 pp 165 184 inundacion en rio grande del sur reconfiguracion percepcion sobre las escuela como espacio de refugio contribute original way educational field seek highlight how school has reinvent reorganiz itself face climate crisi situation has cooperat resilience reconstruction affect communiti data collection strategi study combin oral history documentary analysi includ government document pres record semi-structur interview conduct first half 2025 member school community involv assist those affect conclusion reconfiguration school went beyond functional adaptation becom proces institutional resignification school play key role build solidarity network resilience community reconstruction strengthen their social function spac citizenship education collective well-be,journal history latin american education flood rio grande do sul history education memory refuge school inundaco no rio grande do sul reconfiguraco percepco das escola como espaco de refugio,de los afectado por objective study aims identify how school institution reconfigur context flood affect state rio grande do sul between april may 2024 propos understanding about meaning construct transformation school into spac refuge affect community originality contribution paper contribut reconstruct history these refuge school through protection