2256-5248,Rhela-28-48-m-43-68.pdf,Rhela-28-48-m-43-68_0,en,ción Secretaría,"Objective: this article aims to outline the socialist reform of education in Mexico and its impact on the creation of the IPN, the main institution of higher education founded during the Cárdenas era. 45 Rev. hist.edu.latinoam - Vol. 28 No. 48, enero - junio 2026 - ISSN: 0122-7238 - pp. 43 - 68 La educación socialista y la creación del Instituto Politécnico Nacional (1935-1938) Originality/Contribution: this article presents novel insights into the impact of the socialist reform of Article 3 of the Constitution on Mexican higher education, particularly its technological dimension. It also reveals previously unpublished information on the participation of Manuel R. Palacios, Manuel Gamio, and Enrique Beltrán, intellectuals affiliated with the Institute of Socialist Orientation (IOS), in the founding of the IPN. Method: based on the reconstruction of the intellectual dilemmas surrounding higher education in post-revolutionary Mexico, the thoughts and experiences of the IOS members are revealed, as are their expectations regarding higher education in Mexico, particularly the IPN. Strategies/Information Gathering: much of this research is based on unpublished documentary sources rescued from the Public Education Secretariat section of the General Archive of the Nation’s “Origins and Foundation of the IPN” collection, and from the National Institute of Anthropology and History’s Gonzalo Vázquez Vela Historical Archive. It is also based on recent historical research on the founding of the IPN. Conclusions: this study concludes that the members of the IOS (Institute of Socialist Organizations) played a significant role in the development of Mexican higher education, which was manifested through the main ideas that Manuel R. Palacios, Manuel Gamio and Enrique Beltrán disseminated in the new polytechnic institution, in its branches, cycles, social and rural orientation, among others",socialist; education; congress; National Polytechnic Institute; educational reform; Journal History of Latin American Education. Educação socialista e a criação do Instituto Politécnico Nacional (1935-1938),marcadores,cion secretaria,objective article aims outline socialist reform education mexico its impact creation ipn main institution higher education found during cardena era 45 rev hist edu latinoam vol 28 no 48 enero junio 2026 issn 0122-7238 pp 43 68 la educacion socialista la creacion del instituto politecnico nacional 1935-1938 originality contribution article present novel insight into impact socialist reform article constitution mexican higher education particularly its technological dimension also reveal previously unpublish information participation manuel palacio manuel gamio enrique beltran intellectual affiliat institute socialist orientation ios found ipn method based reconstruction intellectual dilemma surround higher education post-revolutionary mexico thought experienc ios member reveal their expect regard higher education mexico particularly ipn strategi information gather much research based unpublish documentary sourc rescu public education secretariat section general archive nation origin foundation ipn collection national institute anthropology history gonzalo vazquez vela historical archive also based recent historical research found ipn conclusion study conclud member ios institute socialist organiz play significant role development mexican higher education which manifest through main idea manuel palacio manuel gamio enrique beltran disseminat new polytechnic institution its branch cycl social rural orientation among other,socialist education congres national polytechnic institute educational reform journal history latin american education educacao socialista criacao do instituto politecnico nacional 1935-1938,cion secretaria objective article aims outline socialist reform education mexico its impact creation ipn main institution higher education found during cardena era 45 rev hist edu latinoam vol 28 no 48 enero junio 2026 issn 0122-7238 pp 43 68 la educacion socialista la creacion del instituto politecnico nacional 1935-1938 originality contribution article present novel insight into impact socialist reform article constitution mexican higher education particularly its technological dimension also reveal previously unpublish information participation manuel palacio manuel gamio enrique beltran intellectual affiliat institute socialist orientation ios found ipn method based reconstruction intellectual dilemma surround higher education post-revolutionary mexico thought experienc ios member reveal their expect regard higher education mexico particularly ipn strategi information gather much research based unpublish documentary sourc rescu public education secretariat section general archive nation origin foundation ipn collection national institute anthropology history gonzalo vazquez vela historical archive also based recent historical research found ipn conclusion study conclud member ios institute socialist organiz play significant role development mexican higher education which manifest through main idea manuel palacio manuel gamio enrique beltran disseminat new polytechnic institution its branch cycl social rural orientation among other socialist education congres national polytechnic institute educational reform journal history latin american education educacao socialista criacao do instituto politecnico nacional 1935-1938,1.0.0,02f9ba60cc417d32
2256-5248,Rhela-28-48-m-69-90.pdf,Rhela-28-48-m-69-90_0,es,Francisco Alejandro Torres Vivar1,"Objetivo: analizar las prácticas educativas en la Escuela Regional Campesina en 1939-1940, la enseñanza de los contenidos educativos del nacionalismo revolucionario y los principios socialistas a través de la práctica educativa de sus profesores. Originalidad/aporte: aborda las prácticas educativas de la Escuela Regional Campesina en 1939-1940 con base en los informes y planes de trabajo que los maestros entregaban al director del plantel. 70 Rev. hist.edu.latinoam - Vol. 28 No. 48, enero - junio 2026 - ISSN: 0122-7238 - pp. 69 - 113 Francisco Alejandro Torres Vivar, Marisol Vite Vargas Método: la metodología es de tipo documental; se utilizan documentos de un archivo privado que se denominará “Archivo PH” y se triangulará con bibliografía y conceptos de distintos autores que permitan comprender las prácticas educativas de manera holística en los agentes educativos. Estrategias/Recolección de información: recupera experiencias de primer orden provenientes de un archivo privado que triangulamos con fuentes secundarias como artículos y libros. Conclusiones: los reportes de los docentes enfatizan las dificultades que tenían para llevar a cabo su labor educativa, pero aun así resolvieron las deficiencias con los elementos materiales que les proporcionaba la comunidad o la escuela. Los documentos citados nos dejan ver que la creatividad, el compromiso con los ideales de la Revolución mexicana y la vocación social de los maestros permitieron mantener viva la misión educativa de esos años",Mexe; educación rural; nacionalismo revolucionario; acción social; historia de la educación. Educational Practices in the Regional Peasant School in 1939-1940 in Mexico: An Analysis Based on the Sources,marcadores,francisco alejandro torr vivar1,objetivo analizar practic educativ escuela regional campesina 1939-1940 ensenanza contenid educativ nacionalismo revolucionario principi socialist trav 