2256-5248,Rhela-28-48-m-69-90.pdf,Rhela-28-48-m-69-90_0,en,manera holística en los agentes educativos.,"Objective: To analyze the educational practices at the Regional Peasant School in 1939-1940, and how its teachers taught educational content based on revolutionary nationalism and socialist principles. Originality/Contribution: This study addresses the educational practices of the Regional Peasant School in 1939-1940 based on the reports and work plans that the teachers submitted to the school principal. Method: The methodology is of a documentary nature. Documents from a private archive called the ‘PH Archive’ are used alongside bibliography and concepts from different authors to provide a holistic understanding of educational practices among educational agents. Strategies/Information Gathering: We retrieve first-hand accounts from a private archive and corroborate them with secondary sources, such as articles and books. Conclusions: Although the teachers’ reports emphasize the difficulties they faced in carrying out their work, they still managed to overcome the deficiencies in the materials provided by the community or the school. The cited documents demonstrate that the teachers’ creativity, commitment to the 71 Rev. hist.edu.latinoam - Vol. 28 No. 48, enero - junio 2026 - ISSN: 0122-7238 - pp. 69 - 113 Las prácticas educativas en la escuela regional campesina en México, 1939-1940: un análisis desde las fuentes ideals of the Mexican Revolution and social vocation enabled them to fulfil their educational mission during that period","Mexe; rural education; revolutionary nationalism; social action; history of education. Práticas educacionais em escolas rurais regionais no México, 1939-1940: uma análise a partir das fontes",marcadores,manera holistica en los agent educativo,objective analyze educational practic regional peasant school 1939-1940 how its teacher taught educational content based revolutionary nationalism socialist principl originality contribution st