plementado dich zonas geografic constaba 16 oficin corre atendian requer postal total 264 oficin salitrer identificad documento examinado investigacion concluye historia social poblacion habito pampa salitrera tambien estuvo ligada funcionamiento regimen comunicacion postal doctor proces cambio social universidad valladolid espana decano facultad cienci social artes humanidad universidad antofagasta ricardo gaete uantof cl https orcid org 0000-0003-2359-2304 hist mem no 32 ano 2026 pp 281 318 ricardo gaete-quezada 282 epoca permitio transmitir forma escrita sus vivenci necesidad hacia resto pais correspondencia desierto atacama historia social oficin salitrer siglo xix postal service and the chilean saltpetre industry in the late 19th century,1.0.0,0bafd6f9c84ef627
2322-777X,Servicio+postal+e+industria+salitrera+chilena+de+finales+del+siglo+XIX.pdf,Servicio+postal+e+industria+salitrera+chilena+de+finales+del+siglo+XIX_0,en,atendían los requerimientos postales,"The Chilean saltpetre economy experienced significant growth between 1880 and 1930, with a major impact on public finances, making it a focus of numerous historiographical studies. This study analyses how the postal service was organised in the Chilean provinces where the saltpetre industry operated in the Atacama Desert in the late 19th century, following the end of the War of the Pacific between Chile and the Confederation of Bolivia and Peru. It develops a quantitative content analysis based on information from the Postal Geographic Dictionary of the Republic of Chile, published in 1899. The results show that the postal correspondence system implemented in these geographic areas consisted of 16 post offices serving the postal needs of 264 nitrate offices. The research concludes that the population inhabiting the nitrate pampas was also closely linked to the functioning of the postal communication regime of the time, which allowed them to convey in writing their experiences and needs to the rest of the country","correspondence, Atacama desert, social history, saltpetre offices, 19th century. Service postal et industrie du salpêtre au Chili à la fin du XIXe siècle Résumé L’économie chilienne du salpêtre connaît un important apogée entre 1880 et 1930, avec un impact significatif sur les finances publiques, devenant un épisode d’intérêt pour de nombreuses Servicio postal e industria salitrera chilena de",marcadores,atendian los requerimiento postal,chilean saltpetre economy experienc significant growth between 1880 1930 major impact public financ making focu numerou historiographical studi study analys how postal service organis chilean provinc where saltpetre industry operat atacama desert late 19th century follow end war pacific between chile confederation bolivia peru 