2322-777X,"«Comercio+de+noticias».+Política+y+ámbitos+de+información.+Entre+Ríos,+1819-1821.pdf","«Comercio+de+noticias».+Política+y+ámbitos+de+información.+Entre+Ríos,+1819-1821_0",en,"1  Doctor en Historia, Universidad de Buenos Aires (UBA). Instituto Ravignani,","The main objective of this article is to examine the relationship between forms of information and the political sphere. In this articulation, politics operates as a driving force that produces governmental or factional actions, or other substantive matters related to the dynamics of power. The aim here is to highlight the various ways in which information circulated and functioned. Particular attention is paid to how, in this exchange of news, the press and public opinion acquired a central role. The study focuses on the province of Entre Ríos during the administrations of Francisco Ramírez and, to a lesser extent, the early government of Lucio Mansilla, roughly between the late 1810s and early 1820s. The goal is to contribute to the study of politics during the independence revolutions and to reflect on the analytical possibilities offered by studying the ‘news’ received by political actors as they engaged in political action. The methodological approach follows one of the contemporary perspectives of political history—among them that promoted by Pierre Rosanvallon—seeking to determine whether actors imagined and executed a ‘rational politics’ or a ‘despotic politics.’ The primary sources consist of correspondence exchanged among politically influential figures","Francisco Ramírez, Lucio Mansilla, public opinion, politics, press. hist.mem., Nº. 32. Año 2026, pp. 211 - 243 213 «Comercio de noticias». Política y ámbitos de información. Entre Ríos, 1819-1821 «Commerce de nouvelles». Politique et sphères d’information dans le cadre de l’«Entre Ríos» de 18191821 Résumé L’objectif principal de cet article est d’examiner les relations entre formes de l’inform",marcadores,doctor en historia universidad de bueno aire uba instituto ravignani,main objective article examine relationship between form information political sphere articulation politic operat driv force produc governmental factional action other substantive matter relat dynamic power aim here highlight variou ways which information circulat function particular attention paid how exchange news pres public opinion acquir central role study focus province entre rios during administr francisco ramirez lesser extent early government lucio mansilla roughly between late 1810s early 1820s goal contribute study politic during independence revolution reflect analytical possibiliti offer study news receiv political actor they engag political action methodological approach follow one contemporary perspectiv political history--among them promot pierre rosanvallon--seek determine whether actor imagin execut rational politic despotic politic primary sourc consist correspondence exchang among politically influential figur,francisco ramirez lucio mansilla public opinion politic pres hist mem no 32 ano 2026 pp 211 243 213 comercio de noticia politica ambito de informacion entre rios 1819-1821 commerce de nouvell politique et spher information dans le cadre de entre rios de 18191821 resume objectif principal de cet article est examiner les relation entre form de inform,doctor en historia universidad de bueno aire uba instituto ravignani main objective article examine relationship between form information political sphere articulation politic operat driv force produc governmental factional action other substantive matter relat dynamic power aim here highlight variou ways which information circulat function particular attention paid how exchange news pres public opinion acquir central role study focus province entre rios during administr francisco ramirez lesser extent early government lucio mansilla roughly between late 1810s early 1820s goal contribute study politic during independence revolution reflect analytical possibiliti off