2339-3874,Investigacion-5539.pdf,Investigacion-5539_0,en,Artículo de Investigación,"introduction: The Wayuu ethnic group is mainly distributed in La Guajira, Colombia. Multiple factors, including ethnicity, determine head and face shape and related indices. They also affect oral and general health, as well as measures such as weight, height, and head circumference. This study describes oral health, somatic growth, and nutritional status of Wayuu children and adolescents in La Guajira. Materials and methods: Prospective cross-sectional study with 538 participants aged 2–17 years from Riohacha and Nazareth. Random and systematic errors were calculated; descriptive and Pearson correlation analyses were performed using SPSS 20.0.Results: The predominant facial 1 Odontóloga. Especialista en Periodoncia. Institución Universitaria Colegios de Colombia UNICOC. Bogotá, Cundinamarca, Colombia. ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7519-5656. Correo: jaguirre@unicoc.edu.co 2 Odontólogo. Institución Universitaria Colegios de Colombia UNICOC. Bogotá, Cundinamarca, Colombia. ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9393-6286. Correo: mmarco@unicoc.edu.co 3 Nutricionista. Especialista en Epidemiología. Especialista en Administración de Salud. Magíster en Planeación socioeconómica. Institución Universitaria Colegios de Colombia UNICOC. Bogotá, Cundinamarca, Colombia. ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9305-1012. Correo: lagarcia@unicoc.edu.co. Cvlac: https://scienti.minciencias.gov.co/cvlac/visualizador/generarCurriculoCv.do?cod_rh=0001709742 4 Odontóloga. Magíster en odontología. Docente de cátedra. Institución Universitaria Colegios de Colombia UNICOC. Bogotá, Cundinamarca, Colombia. ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8282-8500. Correo: ynlopezr@unal.edu.co 5 Odontóloga. Especialista en Semiología y Cirugía Oral. Magíster en Ciencias Básicas Biomédicas. Institución Universitaria Colegios de Colombia UNICOC. Bogotá, Cundinamarca, Colombia. ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5564-2316. Correo: dirinvestigacion@unicoc.edu.co. Cvlac: https://scienti.minciencias.gov.co/cvlac/visualizador/generarCurriculoCv.do?cod_rh=0001386579 p. 2 Archivos de Medicina Aguirre-Acevedo J., Martínez–Oropeza M.A., Ruíz García L.A., López Rodríguez Y.N., Aguilera-Rojas S.E. Characterization of Oral Health Conditions and Somatic Growth of Wayuu Children and Adolescents in the Department of La Guajira, Colombia: A Cross-Sectional Study. Arch Med (Manizales). 2026;26(1) index corresponded to euryprosopic and leptoprosopic types; the cranial index was leptoprosopic. Additionally, 44% presented with at least one decayed tooth, and 39% showed gingival inflammation. Furthermore, 63.6% were underweight for their age.. Conclusion: Oral health, somatic, and craniofacial growth were described, exploring correlations of craniofacial growth profiles","Child, Growth and development, cross-sectional study, indigenous, Oral Health. Caracterización de las condiciones de salud oral y crecimiento somático de niños y adolescentes Wayuu del departamento de la Guajira, Colombia: un estudio transversal",marcadores,articulo de investigacion,introduction wayuu ethnic group mainly distribut la guajira colombia multiple factor includ ethnicity determine head face shape relat indic they also affect oral general health well measur such weight height head circumference study describ oral health somatic growth nutritional statu wayuu children adolescent la guajira material method prospective cross-sectional study 538 participant aged 2-17 year riohacha nazareth random systematic error calculat descriptive pearson correlation analys perform using spss 20 result predominant facial odontologa especialista en periodoncia institucion universitaria colegio de colombia unicoc bogota cundinamarca colombia orcid http orcid org 0000-0001-7519-5656 correo jaguirre unicoc edu co odontologo institucion universitaria colegio de colombia unicoc bogota cundinamarca colombia orcid http orcid org 0000-0001-9393-6286 correo