2344-7214,1316-110-PB.pdf,1316-110-PB_2,en,Jhon Jairo Alba Noriega is a Systems Engineer from the,"— This document provides a comprehensive view of the importance of software solutions in the context of digital transformation, highlighting their role in innovation and improving efficiency in organizations.In addition, information systems are analyzed and relevant conclusions are drawn about their importance and usefulness. Finally, the theoreticalconceptual approach focuses on understanding digital transformation as a profound change in the culture and way of working in companies. requiring a strategic vision and the incorporation of new strategies, processes, cultures and skills in the organization. Likewise, the importance of strategic approaches, dynamic capabilities and user-centric considerations to achieve an effective digital transformation is highlighted",— Artificial intelligence; Digital transformation; Information systems; Organizational innovation; Software solutions,marcadores,jhon jairo alba noriega system engineer,-- document provid comprehensive view importance software solution context digital transformation highlight their role innovation improv efficiency organiz addition information system analyz relevant conclusion drawn about their importance usefulnes finally theoreticalconceptual approach focus understand digital transformation profound change culture way work compani requir strategic vision incorporation new strategi process cultur skill organ likewise importance strategic approach dynamic capabiliti user-centric consider achieve effective digital transformation highlight,-- artificial intelligence digital transformation information system organizational innovation software solution,jhon jairo alba noriega system engineer -- document provid comprehensive view importance software solution context digital transformation highlight their role innovation improv efficiency organiz addition information system analyz relevant conclusion drawn about 