2 numero 2026 e1608 issn 2346-0806 e1608,1.0.0,3ac8ce6e669458f3
2346-0806,sph10-e1608.pdf,sph10-e1608_0,en,ón estática e igualdad sexualidad-sexo). Resultados:,"Introduction: To what extent have legislative advances on gender and sexual diversity transformed social conceptions in Cuba and Spain? Objective: To analyze conceptions of gender and sexuality in a sample composed of Cuban and Spanish nationals. Materials and methods: This study began with this question and employed a quantitative design, collecting data from 156 participants (Cuban and Spanish) using scales that assess conceptions of gender (binary, sex-gender equality, and static conception) and sexuality (heteronormativity, monogamy, static conception, and sexuality-sex equality). Results: Significant differences were found: the Cuban participants held more traditional conceptions than the Spanish participants. Furthermore, a significant interaction was found between nationality and educational level; thus, the differences between countries diminished at higher academic levels. Conclusions: These findings reinforce the need to integrate content on gender and sexuality at all educational levels as a way to transform social representations and move toward a more egalitarian society","cross-cultural, educational level, gender diversity, LGBT, social conception",marcadores,estatica igualdad sexualidad-sexo resultado,introduction what extent have legislative advanc gender sexual diversity transform social conception cuba spain objective analyze conception gender sexuality sample compos cuban spanish national material method study began question employ quantitative design collect data 156 participant cuban spanish using scal asses conception gender binary sex-gender equality static conception sexuality heteronormativity monogamy static conception sexuality-sex equality result significant differenc found cuban participant held more traditional conception than spanish participant furthermore significant interaction found between nationality educational level thus differenc between countri diminish higher academic level conclusion these finding reinforce need integrate content gender sexuality all educational level way transform social represent move toward more egalitarian society,cross-cultural educational level gender diversity lgbt social conception,estatica igualdad sexualidad-sexo resultado introduction what extent have legislative advanc gender sexual diversity transform social conception cuba spain objective analyze conception gender sexuality sample compos cuban spanish national material method study began question employ quantitative design collect data 156 participant cuban spanish using scal asses conception gender binary sex-gender equality static conception sexuality heteronormativity monogamy static conception sexuality-sex equality result significant differenc found cuban participant held more traditional conception than spanish participant furthermore significant interaction found between nationality educational level thus differenc between countri diminish higher academic level conclusion these finding reinforce need integrate content gender sexuality all educational level way transform social represent move toward more egalitarian society cross-cultural educational level gender diversity lgbt social conception,1.0.0,ba68b87664ea7d77
2346-0806,sph100-e1404+(3).pdf,sph100-e1404+(3)_0,es,Artículo de reflexión,"Introducción: este artículo de reflexión aborda la importancia de la construcción de paz desde el ámbito universitario en el contexto colombiano actual. Objetivo: analizar experiencias curriculares y de extensión social que fomenten una cultura de paz. Materiales y métodos: la metodología empleada consistió en una revisión crítica y reflexiva de diversas iniciativas institucionales y su impacto en la comunidad académica y social. Resultados: resultados, se destacan la identificación de estrategias pedagógicas transversales y el fortalecimiento del compromiso social de las instituciones de educación superior. Conclusiones: la educación superior debe ser un espacio de transformación social donde los currículos y la extensión se articulen para formar ciudadanos comprometidos con la reconciliación y la justicia social","educación para la paz, currículo universitario, extensión universitaria, construcción de paz, memoria histórica. Sophia Recibido: 30/04/2025-Aceptado: 01/12/2025-Publicado: 22/03/2026 DOI: https://doi.org/10.18634/sophiaj.22v.1i.1404 Volumen 22, número 1, 2026, p: e1404 ISSN 2346-0806 e1404",marcadores,articulo reflexion,introduccion este articulo reflexion aborda importancia construccion paz desde ambito universitario contexto colombiano actual objetivo analizar experienci curricular extension social fomenten cultura paz material metod metodologia empleada consistio revision critica reflexiva divers iniciativ institucional impacto comunidad academica social resultad resultad destacan identificacion estrategi pedagogic transversal fortalecimiento compromiso social institucion educacion superior conclusion educacion superior debe ser espacio transformacion social donde curricul extension articulen formar ciudadan comprometid reconciliacion justicia social,educacion paz curriculo universitario extension universitaria construccion paz memoria historica sophia recibido 30 04 2025-ace