2346-0806,sph100-e1404+(3).pdf,sph100-e1404+(3)_0,en,ateriales y métodos: la metodología empleada consistió en una,Introduction: This reflective article addresses the importance of peacebuilding within the university setting in the current Colombian context. Objective: To analyze curricular and community outreach experiences that foster a culture of peace. Materials and methods: The methodology employed consisted of a critical and reflective review of various institutional initiatives and their impact on the academic and social community. Results: The results highlight the identification of cross-cutting pedagogical strategies and the strengthening of the social commitment of higher education institutions. Conclusions: Higher education should be a space for social transformation where curricula and outreach are integrated to educate citizens committed to reconciliation and social justice,"peace education, university curriculum, university extension, peacebuilding, historical memory",marcadores,aterial metodo la metodologia empleada consistio en una,introduction reflective article address importance peacebuild within university sett current colombian context objective analyze curricular community outreach experienc foster culture peace material method methodology employ consist critical reflective review variou institutional initiativ their impact academic social community result result highlight identification cross-cutt pedagogical strategi strengthen social commitment higher education institution conclusion higher education should space social transformation where curricula outreach integrat educate citizen committ reconciliation social justice,peace education university curriculum university extension peacebuild historical memory,aterial metodo la metodologia empleada consistio en una introduction reflective article address importance peacebuild within university sett current colombian context objective analyze curricular community outreach experienc foster cultu