2346-206X,document (2).pdf,document (2)_0,en,la Asociación Nacional de Empresarios (ANDI),"Colombia has enormous potential to develop sustainable proposals for nature tourism and research based on its megadiversity. However, it has driven nature’s scientific tourism through different public actions. Nevertheless, there is no adopted definition for this type of tourism. The purpose of this study is to understand the current state of scientific tourism in nature and to develop a relevant definition for the Colombian context. A review was conducted in three databases based on a combination of terms, resulting in 27 search equations and 4,000 indexed documents. Of these, 152 were reviewed after being filtered by inclusion and exclusion criteria. A documentary analysis was carried out on the 25 most relevant articles presenting some kind of definition. This analysis extracted and combined the key elements for the definition with a review of regulatory and national tourism policy documents","scientific tourism, academic tourism, research tourism, science & knowledge, territorial management, natural and cultural heritage 1. Justificación En la última década, el turismo se ha considerado un sector con impactos positivos en el ámbito económico. Además, gestionado bajo criterios de sostenibilidad, es un sector importante para el desarrollo sostenible a nivel mundial. Ejemplo de esto",marcadores,la asociacion nacional de empresario andi,colombia has enormou potential develop sustainable proposal nature tourism research based its megadiversity however has driven nature scientific tourism through different public action nevertheles there no adopt definition type tourism purpose study understand current state scientific tourism nature develop relevant definition colombian context review conduct three databas based combination term result 27 search equation 000 index document these 152 review after being filter inclusion exclusion criteria documentary analysi carri out 25 most relevant articl present some kind definition analysi extract combin key element definition review regulatory national tourism policy document,scientific tourism academic tourism research tourism science knowledge territorial management natural cultural heritage justificacion en la ultima decada el turismo se ha considerado un sector con impacto positivo en el ambito economico adema gestionado bajo criterio de sostenibilidad es un sector importante para el desarrollo sostenible nivel mundial ejemplo de esto,la asociacion nacional de empresario andi colombia has enormou potential develop sustainable proposal nature tourism research based its megadiversity however has driven nature scientific tourism through different public action nevertheles there no adopt definition type tourism purpose study understand current state scientific tourism nature develop relevant definition colombian context review conduct three databas based combination term result 27 search equation 000 index document these 152 review after being filter inclusion exclusion criteria documentary analysi carri out 25 most relevant articl present some kind definition analysi extract combin key element definition review regulatory national tourism policy document scientific tourism academic tourism research tourism science knowledge territorial management natural cultural heritage justificacion en la ultima decada el turismo se ha considerado un sector con impacto positivo en el ambito economico adema gestionado bajo criterio de sostenibilidad es un sector importante para el desarrollo sostenible nivel mundial ejemplo de esto,1.0.0,68e2ee960c7afff1
2346-206X,document (3).pdf,document (3)_0,es,ALBERTO JOSÉ RECINOS SÁNCHEZ,"Este estudio analiza el papel del turismo en los mecanismos de integración regional en Latinoamérica, mediante un enfoque cualitativo basado en análisis documental y revisión bibliométrica. Se examinan nueve iniciativas regionales promovidas por distintos bloques de integración, con el propósito de identificar tendencias institucionales, mecanismos de cooperación turística y limitaciones en la gobernanza regional. Los resultados evidencian que la incorporación del turismo en los procesos de integración ha sido desigual y predominantemente declarativa, con escasos mecanismos operativos de implementación. No obstante, han existido experiencias relevantes, como la armonización de cuentas satélite de turismo en la Comunidad Andina y los procesos de promoción turística en el marco del Sistema de la Integración Centroamericana (SICA). A partir de estos hallazgos, se propone un esquema conceptual de gobernanza turística regional que puede contribuir al fortalecimiento de la cooperación turística en América Latina","turismo, integración regional, desarrollo regional, cooperación internacional, políticas turísticas",marcadores,alberto jose recin sanchez,este estudio analiza papel turismo mecanism integracion regional latinoamerica mediante enfoque cualitativo basado analisis documental revision bibliometrica examinan nueve iniciativ regional promovid distint bloqu integracion proposito identificar tendenci institucional mecanism cooperacion turistica limit gobernanza regional resultad evidencian incorporacion turismo proces integracion ha sido desigual predominante declarativa escas mecanism operativ implementacion no obstante han existido experienci relevant como armonizacion cuent satelite turismo comunidad andina proces promocion turistica marco sistema integracion centroamericana sica partir estos hallazg propone esquema conceptual gobernanza turistica regional puede contribuir fortalecimiento cooperacion turistica america latina,turismo integracion regional desarrollo regional cooperacion internacional politic turistic,alberto jose recin sanchez este estudio analiza papel turismo mecanism integracion regional latinoamerica mediante enfoque cualitativo basado analisis documental revision bibliometrica examinan nueve iniciativ regional promovid distint bloqu integracion proposito identificar tendenci institucional mecanism cooperacion turistica limit gobernanza regional resultad evidencian incorporacion turismo proces integracion ha sido desigual predominante declarativa escas mecanism operativ implementacion no obstante han existido experienci relevant como armonizacion cuent satelite turismo comunidad andina proces promocion turistica marco sistema integracion centroamericana sica partir estos hallazg propone esquema conceptual gobernanza turistica regional puede contribuir fortalecimiento cooperacion turistica america latina turismo integracion regional desarrollo regional cooperacion internacional politic turistic,1.0.0,dba6d0009610d1dc
2346-206X,document (3).pdf,document (3)_0,en,"s bloques de integración, con el propósito de identificar tendencias institucionales,","This study uses a qualitative approach based on documentary analysis and bibliometric review to analyze the role of tourism in regional integration mechanisms in Latin America. It examines nine regional initiatives promoted by different integration blocks to identify institutional trends, tourism cooperation mechanisms, and limitations in regional governance. The results reveal that incorporating tourism into integration processes has been inconsistent and largely declarative, with few A l b e r t o J o s é R e c i n o s S á n c h e z 26 Rev. Turismo y Sociedad, vol. XXXIX, julio-diciembre 2026, pp. 25-42 operational implementation mechanisms. Nevertheless, notable examples are identified, such as the harmonization of tourism satellite accounts within the Andean Community and the tourism promotion processes under the Central American Integration System (SICA). Based on these findings, the study proposes a conceptual framework for regional tourism governance that could strengthen tourism cooperation in Latin America","tourism, regional integration, regional development, international cooperation, tourism policies. 1",marcadores,bloqu de integracion con el proposito de identificar tendencia institucional,study uses qualitative approach based documentary analysi bibliometric review analyze role tourism regional integration mechanism latin america examin nine regional initiativ promot different integration block identify institutional trend tourism cooperation mechanism limit regional governance result reveal incorporat tourism into integration process has been inconsistent largely declarative few 26 rev turismo sociedad vol xxxix julio-diciembre 2026 pp 25-42 operational implementation mechanism nevertheles notable exampl identifi such harmon tourism satellite account within andean community tourism promotion process under central american integration system sica based these finding study propos conceptual framework regional tourism governance could strengthen tourism cooperation latin america,tourism regional integration regional development international cooperation tourism polici,bloqu de integracion con el proposito de identificar tendencia institucional study uses qualitative approach based documentary analysi bibliometric review analyze role tourism regional integration mechanism latin america examin nine regional initiativ promot different integration block identify institutional trend tourism cooperation mechanism limit regional governance result reveal incorporat tourism into integration process has been inconsistent largely declarative few 26 rev turismo sociedad vol xxxix julio-diciembre 2026 pp 25-42 operational implementation mechanism nevertheles notable exampl identifi such harmon tourism satellite account within andean community tourism promotion process under central american integration system sica based these finding study propos conceptual framework regional tourism governance could strengthen tourism cooperation latin america tourism regional integration regional development international cooperation tourism polici,1.0.0,fb9f26092145da2a
2346-206X,document (4).pdf,document (4)_0,en,"Political Sciences, Universitas Bojonegoro, Indonesia","This study offers a thorough examination of sustainable ecotourism and investment policies, emphasizing the global and interdisciplinary involvement across different geographic regions and academic fields. Using bibliometric analysis with VOSviewer, the study maps publication trends, leading authors, and key research themes from 2013 to 2023. The results demonstrate a robust global interest in sustainable ecotourism, with China, Spain, and Italy emerging as leaders in research output. Journals such as Sustainability Switzerland and Journal of Sustainable Tourism emerge as central platforms for disseminating research and underpinning the importance of sustainable tourism practices. The research demonstrates the increasing integration of economic, environmental, and social perspectives in tourism sustainability. Recurrent themes include governance, community impact, and economic development, alongside emerging concerns about the negative impacts of tourism, such as discrimination and poverty. This study underscores the need for continued interdisciplinary research and international collaboration to develop effective policies that ensure tourism benefits are realized sustainably. This analysis enriches our understanding of sustainable ecotourism and guides future policy formulation and research directions","Sustainable ecotourism, investment policy instruments, green financing, bibliometric mapping, community participation, policy driven sustainability outcomes",marcadores,political scienc universita bojonegoro indonesia,study offer thorough examination sustainable ecotourism investment polici emphasiz global interdisciplinary involvement acros different geographic region academic field using bibliometric analysi vosviewer study maps publication trend lead author key research them 2013 2023 result demonstrate robust global interest sustainable ecotourism china spain it