2346-2183,04_121933.FINALl.pdf,04_121933.FINALl_0,en,Universidad Nacional de Colombia.,"In recent years, there has been substantial interest in obtaining geospatial information on specific physical characteristics of buildings, such as roof materials, information that is key for estimating property values. However, collecting this data is resource-intensive and requires extensive fieldwork. This review article presents a bibliometric and descriptive analysis of the main trends in the study and mapping of roof materials and urban land covers, whit a focus on indirect methods such as remote sensing. Among the most notable findings is that artificial intelligence algorithms have become the primary tool for processing Earth observation data, and that multiple sensor data integration is one of the most commonly used techniques for data preparation in the study of roof materials. The way forward for remote sensing and urban land cover studies requires, therefore, innovation in the use of emerging technologies to improve identification, classification, and mapping accuracy of urban features and covers","roof materials; urban land-cover; remote sensing; hyperspectral imaging; artificial intelligence algorithms. Percepción remota de materiales de tejados: una revisión de métodos, inteligencia artificial y brechas de conocimiento",marcadores,universidad nacional de colombia,recent year there has been substantial interest obtain geospatial information specific physical characteristic building such roof material information key estimat property valu however collect data resource-intensive requir extensive fieldwork review article present bibliometric descriptive analysi main trend study mapp roof material urban land cover whit focu indirect method such remote sens among most notable finding artificial intelligence algorithm have become primary tool process earth observation data multiple sensor data integration one most commonly used techniqu data preparation study roof material way forward remote sens urban land cover studi requir therefore innovation use emerg technologi improve identification classification mapp accuracy urban featur cover,roof material urban land-cover remote sens hyperspectral imag artificial intelligence algorithm percepcion remota de material de tejado una revision de metodo inteligencia artificial brecha de conocimiento,universidad nacional de colombia recent year there has been substantial interest obtain geospatial information specific physical characteristic building such roof material information key estimat property valu however collect data resource-intensive requir extensive fieldwork review article present bibliometric descriptive analysi main trend study mapp roof material urban land cover whit focu indirect method such remote sens among most notable finding artificial intelligence algorithm have become primary tool process earth observation data multiple sensor data integration one most commonly used techniqu data preparation study roof material way forward remote sens urban land cover studi requir therefore innovation use emerg technologi improve identification classification mapp accuracy urban featur cover roof material urban land-cover remote sens hyperspectral imag artificial intelligence algorithm percepcion remota de material de tejado una revision de metodo inteligencia artificial brecha de conocimiento,1.0.0,eb6129164eba59ec
2346-2183,04_121933.FINALl.pdf,04_121933.FINALl_0,es,he main trends in the study and mapping of roof materials and urban land,"En los últimos años, ha habido un interés sustancial en obtener información geoespacial sobre características físicas específicas de los edificios, como los materiales de los techos, información clave para estimar valores de propiedad. Sin embargo, recopilar estos datos requiere muchos recursos y un extenso trabajo de campo. Este artículo de revisión presenta un análisis bibliométrico y descriptivo de las principales tendencias en el estudio y mapeo de materiales de techos y coberturas urbanas, con un enfoque en métodos indirectos como la percepción remota. Entre los hallazgos más notables se encuentra que los algoritmos de inteligencia artificial se han convertido en la herramienta principal para procesar datos de observación de la Tierra, y que la integración de datos de múltiples sensores es una de las técnicas más utilizadas para la preparación de datos en el estudio de materiales de techos. El camino por seguir para los estudios de percepción remota y cobertura urbana requiere, por lo tanto, innovación en el uso de tecnologías emergentes para mejorar la identificación, clasificación y precisión del mapeo de características y coberturas urbanas",materiales de cubiertas; cobertura del suelo urbano; percepción remota; imágenes hiperespectrales; algoritmos de inteligencia artificial. 1,marcadores,he main trends in the study and mapping of roof materials and urban land,ultim anos ha habido inter sustancial obtener informacion geoespacial sobre caracteristic fisic especific edifici como material tech informacion clave estimar valor propiedad sin embargo recopilar estos datos requiere much recurs extenso trabajo campo este articulo revision presenta analisis bibliometrico descriptivo principal tendenci estudio mapeo material tech cobertur urban enfoque metod indirect como percepcion remota entre hallazg mas notabl encuentra algoritm inteligencia artificial han convertido herramienta principal procesar datos observacion tierra integracion datos multipl sensor tecnic mas utilizad preparacion datos estudio material tech camino seguir estudi percepcion remota cobertura urbana requiere tanto innovacion uso tecnologi emergent mejorar identificacion clasificacion precision mapeo caracteristic cobertur urban,material cubiert cobertura suelo urbano percepcion remota imagen hiperespectral algoritm inteligencia artificial,he main trends in the study and mapping of roof materials and urban land ultim anos ha habido inter sustancial obtener informacion geoespacial sobre caracteristic fisic especific edifici como material tech informacion clave estimar valor propiedad sin embargo recopilar estos datos requiere much recurs extenso trabajo campo este articulo revision presenta analisis bibliometrico descriptivo principal tendenci estudio mapeo material tech cobertur urban enfoque metod indirect como percepcion remota entre hallazg mas notabl encuentra algoritm inteligencia artificial han convertido herramienta principal procesar datos observacion tierra integracion datos multipl sensor tecnic mas utilizad preparacion datos estudio material tech camino seguir estudi percepcion remota cobertura urbana requiere tanto innovacion uso tecnologi emergent mejorar identificacion clasificacion precision mapeo caracteristic cobertur urban material cubiert cobertura suelo urbano percepcion remota imagen hiperespectral algoritm inteligencia artificial,1.0.0,552466d18c5af8a1
2346-2183,05_124994.FINAL.pdf,05_124994.FINAL_0,en,Universidad Nacional de Colombia.,"Environmental performance is a key factor in optimizing the operations of the Colombian manufacturing industry and mitigating its negative impacts. In response, the sector has incorporated various green practices; however, there is limited systematization of these advances. Therefore, this study develops a systematic review to identify trends and understand the behavior of environmental performance in Colombian manufacturing. Thirty-six articles published between 2014 and 2025 in Scopus, Web of Science and Google Scholar were analyzed, following an environmental approach and the PRISMA 2020 methodology. Quality and risk of bias were assessed using the ROBIS and AMSTAR-2 tools according to their established domains. The results show sustained growth in research focused on green practices and their contribution to improving environmental performance in the country. Finally, it is suggested that future research should investigate the barriers that limit the effective adoption of these practices in the manufacturing sector",environmental management; green practices; manufacturing industry; environmental performance; sustainable production; performance evaluation; Colombia. Prácticas verdes para la gestión del desempeño ambiental de la industria manufacturera en Colombia: revisión sistemática de la literatura,marcadores,universidad nacional de colombia,environmental performance key factor optimiz oper colombian manufactur industry mitigat its negative impact response sector has incorporat variou green practic however there limit systemat these advanc therefore study develop systematic review identify trend understand behavior environmental performance colombian manufactur thirty-six articl publish between 2014 2025 scopu web science google scholar analyz follow environmental approach prisma 2020 methodology quality risk bias assess using robi amstar-2 tool accord their establish domain 