2357-4720,HyS51.pdf,HyS51_4,en,rganismos gubernamentales. A partir de,"| This article analyzed the career of Enrique Julio – founder of La Nueva Provincia in 1898, the most important newspaper in the history of Bahía Blanca (Argentina) and one of the most prominent cultural producers in the city – and the main factors that built his figure as a “local hero” after his death in 1940. The study examines biographies, institutional books, press releases, municipal regulations, and research on the cultural past of the city and the surrounding region, with the aim of recovering the principal representations built around his memory A repertoire of initiatives by his heirs to build a distinguished public image of the founder could be identified, which were accompanied by tributes in various spaces of sociability and government agencies. Based on these recognitions, it was possible to understand the effort of the Julio family and social sectors related to their interests to outline a famous image of the family patriarch as a man of the press, of culture and a defender of local interests as a way of legitimizing the hegemony of his companies over his competitors, consolidated by his descendants after his death","| cultural history; written press; businessman; journalist; Argentina; 20th century Professor, jornalista, empresário e produtor cultural: Enrique Julio, vida e representações de seu papel como “herói local” em Bahía Blanca (Argentina, 1898–1998)",marcadores,rganismo gubernamental partir de,article analyz career enrique julio founder la nueva provincia 1898 most important newspaper history bahia blanca argentina one most prominent cultural producer city main factor built his figure local hero after his death 1940 study examin biographi institutional book pres releas municipal regul research cultural past city surround region aim recover principal represent built around his memory repertoire initiativ his heir build distinguish public image founder could identifi which accompani tribut variou spac sociability government agenci based these recognition possible understand effort julio family social sector relat their interest outline famou image family patriarch man pres culture defender local interest way legitimiz hegemony his compani over his competitor consolidat his descendant after his death,cultural history written pres businessman journalist argentina 20th century professor jornalista empresario produtor cultural enrique julio vida representaco de seu papel como heroi local em bahia blanca argentina 1898-1998,rganismo gubernamental partir de article analyz career enrique julio founder la nueva provincia 1898 most important newspaper history bahia blanca argentina one most prominent cultural producer city main factor built his figure local hero after his death 1940 study examin biographi institutional book pres releas municipal regul research cultural past city surround region aim recover principal represent built around his memory repertoire initiativ his heir build distinguish public image founder could identifi which accompani tribut variou spac sociability government agenci based these recognition possible understand effort julio family social sector relat their interest outline famou image family patriarch man pres culture defender local interest way legitimiz hegemony his compani over his competitor consolidat his descendant after his death cultural history written pres businessman journalist argentina 20th century professor jornalista empresario produtor cultural enrique julio vida representaco de seu papel como heroi local em bahia blanca argentina 1898-1998,1.0.0,0d2403f570238e79
2357-4720,HyS51.pdf,HyS51_5,es,"Encuentro Iberoamericano de Retórica, Sociedad Portuguesa de Retórica, Universidad","| Este artículo explora el proceso de exclusión legal de las mujeres del trabajo en el sector gastronómico en Buenos Aires, Argentina, durante la primera mitad del siglo XX. Se sostiene que la apropiación masculina de oficios como cocineros, maîtres y mozos requirió tanto de su exclusión como de la construcción de estas tareas como inapropiadas para ellas. Diversos argumentos contribuyeron a configurar la gastronomía como un ámbito moralmente reprobable para las mujeres: su desarrollo en la esfera pública, las largas jornadas laborales, los riesgos de accidentes, el trabajo nocturno, la cercanía con bebidas alcohólicas y el contacto con un público mayoritariamente masculino. El análisis se basa en un corpus de fuentes que incluye normativas, debates parlamentarios, peticiones ante la Cámara de Diputados, el Boletín Informativo del Departamento Nacional del Trabajo y tesis sobre el trabajo de mujeres y niños. Estas se complementan con notas periodísticas, publicidades, avisos clasificados y sentencias de tribunales laborales. Entre los resultados se destaca cómo se construyeron históricamente desigualdades y jerarquías de género en el mercado laboral, así como el papel de las dimensiones espacial y temporal: mientras en ciertos ámbitos y momentos las mujeres podían —y debían— realizar tareas como cocinar y servir, en otros les estaban prácticamente vedadas","| gastronomía; nocturnidad; alcohol; género; Argentina; siglo XX. Proteger el cuerpo y la moral 134-158 Cómo citar / How to Cite Item: Garazi, Débora. 2026. “Proteger el cuerpo y la moral: exclusión de las mujeres del trabajo en el sector gastronómico (Buenos Aires, Argentina, primera mitad del siglo XX)”. Historia y Sociedad, (51): 134-158. https://doi.org/10.15446/hys.n51.123324 ? *Recibido",marcadores,encuentro iberoamericano retorica sociedad portuguesa retorica universidad,este articulo explor