ecessary support agricultural plann objective study evaluate performance brown holt-winter sarima long short-term memory lstm model predict monthly price cape gooseberri colombia during period 2015-2025 methodological design quantitative time seri analysi approach used therefore stationarity seri evaluat using statistical test logarithmic transformation appli stabilize variance data subsequently database divid into train test sets estimate validate model performance model under study evaluat using mean absolute error mae mean absolute percentage error mape root mean squar error rmse indicator result obtain demonstrate brown holt-winter model adequately represent overall trend seri however they tend over-smooth abrupt vari sarima model exhibit lowest level fitnes affect nonlinear behavior lack seasonal pattern contrast lstm model achiev best performance rmse 379 58 cop kg mae 292 51 cop kg mape 13 compar rmse 674 96 cop kg mae 560 64 cop kg mape 12 12 sarima model weakest performer confirm lstm greater capacity capture price dynamic cape gooseberry agricultural economic horticultural market deep learn predictive analytic physali peruviana gelv navarro economica cuc vol 47 no pp e237119 enero junio 2026 prediccion del precio de la uchuva en colombia comparacion entre metodo clasico una red neuronal lstm 2015-2025,1.0.0,e6c34da1ebc382b0
