2389-9050,06-Persistencias.pdf,06-Persistencias_0,en,s violencias endémicas experimentadas en el,"Introduction The Colombian State, colored by endemic violence, experiences the complex transitional scenario, a process that requires the realization of renewed readings to interpret the homicidal violence in Co lombian intermediate cities. Objective The article seeks to interpret, based on the relation al sociology of Pierre Bourdieu, the logic and muta tions of historical and structural violence in a region that denies the armed conflict such as the region of the Colombian coffee axis, with emphasis on the capital city of Risaralda: Pereira. Methodology A qualitative methodological approach was used, with ethnographic and documentary designs based on research carried out in the Colombian coffee region, with emphasis on a critical period alluding to homicidal violence such as the period between 2023 and 2026 in the city of Pereira. Results The existence of a subfield of illegal economies is highlighted as one of the axes that articulate the endemic violence experienced in the territory. Like wise, the historical logic that underlies homicidal vi olence is exalted, as well as the factors that have led to its permanence and escalation in the post-agree ment scenario. Conclusions Based on the analyzes constructed, an interpreta tion model is proposed based on the concept of vi olent social practice as an axis of analysis for the understanding of institutionalized violence in the territory, constitutive of hegemonic forms of territo rial power, criminal logic and regional development, in which the role of the gray agent is central to inter pret such violence","urban violence; armed conflict; racketeering; urban sociology; citizen security; territorial governance; violent social practices; development; territory; public policy; Pereira; Colombia. Sociedad y Economía N° 58 (2026) / e-ISSN: 2389-9050 / e10315398 https://doi.org/10.25100/sye.v0i58.15398 Persistencias y transformaciones de las violencias en Pereira, Colombia: lecturas posibles de las vio",marcadores,violencia endemica experimentada en el,introduction colombian state color endemic violence experienc complex transitional scenario proces requir real renew reading interpret homicidal violence co lombian intermediate citi objective article seek interpret based relation al sociology pierre bourdieu logic muta tion historical structural violence region deni armed conflict such region colombian coffee axis emphasi capital city risaralda pereira methodology qualitative methodological approach used ethnographic documentary design based research carri out colombian coffee region emphasi critical period allud homicidal violence such period between 2023 2026 city pereira result existence subfield illegal economi highlight one axes articulate endemic violence experienc territory like wise historical logic underli homicidal vi olence exalt well factor have led its permanence escalation post-agree ment scenario conclusion based analyz construct interpreta tion model propos based concept vi olent social practice axis analysi understand institutionaliz violence territory constitutive hegemonic form territo rial power criminal logic regional development which role gray agent central inter pret such violence,urban violence armed conflict racketeer urban sociology citizen security territorial governance violent social practic development territory public policy pereira colombia sociedad economia ndeg 58 2026 e-issn 2389-9050 e10315398 http doi org 10 25100 sye v0i58 15398 persistencia transformacion de las violencia en pereira colombia lectura posibl de las vio,violencia endemica experimentada en el introduction colombian state color endemic violence experienc complex transitional scenario proces requir real renew reading interpret homicidal violence co lombian intermediate citi objective article seek interpret based relation al sociology pierre bourdieu logic muta tion historical structural 