2389-993X,N42e20715543-PDF.pdf,N42e20715543-PDF_0,en,entre la mayoría de las acciones lo que demostró que las UMA constituyen un recurso,"Homelessness represents one of the most extreme forms of social exclusion, resulting from the interaction of structural, institutional, relational, and individual factors. Mobile Outreach Units operate as key mechanisms for contact, engagement, and direct service delivery within the Outreach model. This article presents the results of a study carried out in Santa Cruz de Tenerife during 2023 to analyze the relationships between different types of care, to identify differences by sex, origin, type of Mobile Outreach Unit /UMA), use of housing resources and the presence of an Individualized Care Plan (PAI). It was also proposed to explore geographical variations, to identify user profiles according to the frequency and nature of interventions, as well as to examine seasonal trends in service provision. A quantitative, non-experimental, observational, descriptive, and retrospective study was carried out based on 450 service users and 28,416 recorded interventions. Nonparametric analyses, Spearman correlations, cluster analysis (kmeans), and monthly trend analyses were applied following a rigorous process of debugging, categorizing, and verifying the consistency of records. The results showed that UMA 1 concentrated 73,7 % of attentions while UMA 2 concentrated 26,3 %. Positive correlations were observed between most of the actions, which demonstrated that the UAMs constitute an essential resource for social care in homelessness. The findings provide evidence to improve service planning and to tailor interventions from a gender-sensitive, intercultural, and intersectional perspective. Further mixed methods of research are recommended",Homeless person; Outreach intervention; Mobile Outreach Units; Social exclusion; Social integration. Sumario: 1,marcadores,entre la mayoria de las accion lo que demostro que las uma constituyen un recurso,homelessnes represent one most extreme form social exclusion result interaction structural institutional relational individual factor mobile outreach unit operate key mechanism contact engagement direct service delivery within outreach model article present result study carri out santa cruz de tenerife during 2023 analyze relationship between different type care identify differenc sex origin type mobile outreach unit uma use hous resourc presence individualiz care plan pai also propos explore geographical vari identify user profil accord frequency nature intervention well examine seasonal trend service provision quantitative non-experimental observational descriptive retrospective study carri out based 450 service user 28 416 record intervention nonparametric analys spearman correl cluster analysi kmean monthly trend analys appli follow rigorou proces debugg categoriz verify consistency record result show uma concentrat 73 attention while uma concentrat 26 positive correl observ between most action which demonstrat uams constitute essential resource social care homelessnes finding provide evidence improve service plann tailor intervention gender-sensitive intercultural intersectional perspective further mixed method research recommend,homeles person outreach intervention mobile outreach unit social exclusion social integration sumario,entre la mayoria de las accion lo que demostro que las uma constituyen un recurso homelessnes represent one most extreme form social exclusion result interaction structural institutional relational individual factor mobile outreach unit operate key mechanism contact engagement direct service delivery within outreach model article present result study carri out santa cruz de tenerife during 2023 analyze relationship between different type care identify differenc sex origin type mobile outreach unit uma use hous resourc presence individualiz care plan pai also propos explore geographical vari identify user profil accord frequency nature intervention well examine seasonal trend service provision quantitative non-experimental observational descriptive retrospective study carri out based 450 service user 28 416 record intervention nonparametric analys spearman correl cluster analysi kmean monthly trend analys appli follow rigorou proces debugg categoriz verify consistency record result show uma concentrat 73 attention while uma concentrat 26 positive correl observ between most action which demonstrat uams constitute essential resource social care homelessnes finding provide evidence improve service plann tailor intervention gender-sensitive intercultural intersectional perspective further mixed method research recommend homeles person outreach intervention mobile outreach unit social exclusion social integration sumario,1.0.0,06cf6ee83b4fa7db
2389-993X,N42e20815690-PDF.pdf,N42e20815690-PDF_0,es,"Correspondencia: Isaac Francisco Ruiz-Muñoz. Universidad Alberto Hurtado. Concepción, Chile. Correo-e:","Este artículo reflexiona en torno a la colonialidad del saber y su incidencia en las formas hegemónicas de producción de conocimiento en el Trabajo Social. Desde una perspectiva decolonial, se problematiza la racionalidad académica neoliberal y eurocéntrica que delimita los criterios de validez científica, jerarquiza epistemologías y margina los saberes situados que emergen desde las prácticas profesionales. Se propone recuperar la sistematización de experiencias y prácticas sociales como una metodología crítica, históricamente vinculada a la identidad del Trabajo Social latinoamericano, que permite no solo comprender las prácticas, sino también producir conocimiento ético, político y transformador. A través de la revisión teórica, se analizan las tensiones entre universidad, academia y disciplina, y se presenta una discusión de los principios metodológicos estructurados en fases, principios y herramientas que potencian la sistematización como estrategia epistémica contrahegemónica. Finalmente, se propone una lectura que explicite bajo qué condiciones la sistematización puede operar como estrategia epistémica contrahegemónica en Trabajo Social —no por el método en sí mismo, sino por su orientación ético-política, su diseño participativo y la disputa de legitimidad que sostiene—, afirmándola como vía situada para producir conocimiento crítico desde la práctica",Trabajo Social; Sistematización de experiencias; Colonialidad,marcadores,correspondencia isaac francisco ruiz-munoz universidad alberto hurtado concepcion chile correo-e,este articulo reflexiona torno colonialidad saber incidencia form hegemonic produccion conocimiento trabajo social desde perspectiva decolonial problematiza racionalidad academica neoliberal eurocentrica delimita criteri validez cientifica jerarquiza epistemologi margina saber situad emergen desde practic profesional propone recuperar sistematizacion experienci practic social como metodologia critica historica vinculada identidad trabajo social latinoamericano permite no solo comprender practic sino tambien producir conocimiento etico politico transformador trav revision teorica analizan tension entre universidad academia disciplina presenta discusion principi metodologic estructurad fases principi herramient potencian sistematizacion como estrategia epistemica contrahegemonica final propone lectura explicite bajo condicion sistematizacion puede operar como estrategia epistemica contrahegemonica trabajo social --no metodo si mismo sino orientacion etico-politica diseno participativo disputa legitimidad sostiene-- afirmandola como via situada producir conocimiento critico desde practica,trabajo social sistematizacion experienci colonialidad,correspondencia isaac francisco ruiz-munoz universidad alberto hurtado concepcion chile correo-e este articulo reflexiona torno colonialidad saber incidencia form hegemonic produccion conocimiento trabajo social desde perspectiva decolonial problematiza racionalidad academica neoliberal eurocentrica delimita criteri validez cientifica jerarquiza epistemologi margina saber situad emergen desde practic profesional propone recuperar sistematizacion experienci practic social como metodologia critica historica vinculada identidad trabajo social latinoamericano permite no solo comprender practic sino tambien producir conocimiento etico politico transformador trav revision teorica analizan tension entre universidad academia disciplina presenta discusion principi metodologic estructurad fases principi herramient potencian sistematizacion como estrategia epistemica contrahegemonica final propone lectura explicite bajo condicion sistematizacion puede operar como estrategia epistemica contrahegemonica trabajo social --no metodo si mismo sino orientacion etico-politica diseno participativo disputa legitimidad sostiene-- afir