2390-0016,3_343_El+principio+de+convencionalidad.pdf,3_343_El+principio+de+convencionalidad_0,en,rativa de los principios como reglas de base y de la participación jurisdiccional; todo lo,"This article provides an account of a historical, social, political and legal analysis on the existence of a set of elements that enable the emergence, scope and application of the principle of conventionality as a legal and constitutional tool with international roots that, in the Colombian case, arises from a new political reality (Social Rule of Law). It is also an application mechanism, resulting from the national Constitution, the approval and ratification of international treaties on human rights, the imperative importance of principles as basic rules and jurisdictional participation. All of the above is for the protection of the human right to political asylum in Colombia, as well as other rights of equal category. This result is achieved from qualitative research, under a deductive and inductive method, based on a methodology and content analysis that is carried out through an explanatory, comparative description and empirical and analytical observation","Principle of Conventionality, Constitutionality Block, Principles, Convention, 1991 colombian Constitution, Inter-American System, Proportionality Test, Principality Exception",marcadores,rativa de los principio como regla de base de la participacion jurisdiccional todo lo,article provid account historical social political legal analysi existence set element enable emergence scope application principle conventionality legal constitutional tool international root colombian case aris new political reality social rule law also application mechanism result national constitution approval ratification international treati human right imperative importance principl basic rule jurisdictional participation all above protection human right political asylum colombia well other right equal category result achiev qualitative research under deductive inductive method based methodology content analysi carri out through explanatory comparative description empirical analytical observation,principle conventionality constitutionality block principl convention 1991 colombian constitution inter-american system proportionality test principality exception,rativa de los principio como regla de base de la participacion jurisdiccional todo lo article provid account historical social political legal analysi existence set element enable emergence scope application principle conventionality legal constitutional tool international root colombian case aris new political reality social rule law also application mechanism result national constitution approval ratification international treati human right imperative importance principl basic rule jurisdictional participation all above protection human right political asylum colombia well other right equal category result achiev qualitative research under deductive inductive method based methodology content analysi carri out through explanatory comparative description empirical analytical observation principle conventionality constitutionality block principl convention 1991 colombian constitution inter-american system proportionality test principality exception,1.0.0,b86a7020d2cb92bb
2390-0016,4_395_El+orden+corporativista.pdf,4_395_El+orden+corporativista_0,es,El orden corporativista:,"En este artículo muestro la forma en la que se relacionan el derecho y el poder en La República en la América española de Sergio Arboleda. Aunque los resultados del estado del arte sobre la obra muestran que la literatura académica se ha concentrado en estudiar las ideas de Arboleda como una interpretación racial de la historia o a partir del problema de la imitación, en este artículo propongo que estudiar sus ideas bajo la óptica corporativista es útil para encontrar más relaciones entre el derecho y el poder en su pensamiento","Sergio Arboleda, Derecho, Poder, Corporativismo, Interpretación racial de la historia, Imitación",marcadores,orden corporativista,este articulo muestro forma relacionan derecho poder republica america espanola sergio arboleda aunque resultad estado arte sobre obra muestran literatura academica ha concentrado estudiar ideas arboleda como interpretacion racial historia partir problema imitacion este articulo propongo estudiar sus ideas bajo optica corporativista util encontrar mas relacion entre derecho poder pensamiento,sergio arboleda derecho poder corporativismo interpretacion racial historia imitacion,orden corporativista este articulo muestro forma relacionan derecho poder republica america espanola sergio arboleda aunque resultad estado arte sobre obra muestran literatura academica ha concentrado estudiar ideas arboleda como interpretacion racial historia partir problema imitacion este articulo propongo estudiar sus ideas bajo optica corporativista util encontrar mas relacion entre derecho poder pensamiento sergio arboleda derecho poder corporativismo interpretacion racial historia imitacion,1.0.0,6a6987423b8c153f
