2422-3182,3862_v12n29_PDF.pdf,3862_v12n29_PDF_0,en,a explorar factores que,"Objective: In the context of digital commerce, companies seek not only to satisfy consumer needs but also to create experiences that foster consumer happiness and strengthen connections with their brands. This has encouraged firms to enhance consumer experiences by d eveloping strategies that generate a meaningful impact. Against this backdrop, this study aimed to analyze the effect of e-service quality and brand value on consumer happiness across e -commerce platforms such as Amazon, Mercado Libre, Shein, Temu, and Sho pee. Design/Methodology: A quantitative methodology with a descriptive and correlational design was employed. The sample consisted of 196 individuals selected through simple random sampling. The instrument included items designed to measure consumer happiness, brand value, and e -service quality. Data were analyzed using SPSS v.25 for descriptive analyses and Smart PLS v.4.1 for structural equation modeling ( PLS -SEM ). Findings: E -service quality was found to influence consumer happiness both directly and indirectly. The indirect effect occurs through brand value, particularly through the loyalty dimension, which also impacts consumer happiness. Conclusions: The results suggest that e -commerce companies should strengthen the quality of their digital services and implement strategies aimed at building brand value, especially those focused on fostering customer loyalty, in order to enhance consumer happiness an d satisfaction. Originality: This study presents a structural equation model linking e -service quality, brand value, and consumer happiness, while highlighting the mediating role of brand value in e -commerce environments. It also contributes to the understanding of the factors that i nfluence consumer happiness, considering service quality and brand value as key variables","e-service quality, consumer happiness, brand value, digital markets. Highlights ▪ In digital markets, service quality is a determining factor in enhancing brand value. ▪ Brand value increases consumer happiness in digital environments. ▪ Consumer happiness is positively influenced by brand value and service quality. ▪ Loyalty is a key factor in enhancing consumer happiness. Davi",marcadores,explorar factor que,objective context digital commerce compani seek not only satisfy consumer need but also create experienc foster consumer happines strengthen connection their brand has encourag firm enhance consumer experienc evelop strategi generate meaningful impact against backdrop study aimed analyze effect e-service quality brand value consumer happines acros -commerce platform such amazon mercado libre shein temu sho pee design methodology quantitative methodology descriptive correlational design employ sample consist 196 individual select through simple random sampl instrument includ item design measure consumer happines brand value -service quality data analyz using spss 25 descriptive analys smart pls structural equation model pls -sem finding -service quality found influence consumer happines both directly indirectly indirect effect occur through brand value particularly through loyalty dimension which also impact consumer happines conclusion result suggest -commerce compani should strengthen quality their digital servic implement strategi aimed build brand value especially those focus foster customer loyalty order enhance consumer happines satisfaction originality study present structural equation model link -service quality brand value consumer happines while highlight mediat role brand value -commerce environment also contribut understand factor nfluence consumer happines consider service quality brand value key variabl,e-service quality consumer happines brand value digital market highlight digital market service quality determin factor enhanc brand value brand value increas consumer happines digital environment consumer happines positively influenc bra