2462-8603,Modalidades+de+enseñanza+como+espejos+de+la+desigualdad.pdf,Modalidades+de+enseñanza+como+espejos+de+la+desigualdad_0,en,"a citar este artículo: Hernández, O. G. (2026). Modalidades de enseñanza como","This study examines performance gaps on the Saber Pro exam in Colombia between 2016 and 2024, using a quantitative approach and a national dataset of more than 200,000 students enrolled in teachertraining programs. Multivariate statistical models were employed to compare overall scores across instructional modalities (facetoface, virtual, and distance) while also taking into account sociocultural variables. The results reveal consistent differences: performance is highest in facetoface programs, followed by virtual programs, and lowest in distance programs. Although the gaps narrow depending on the socioeconomic status variable, variables such as parental education, gender, and area of residence do not disappear, indicating a pedagogical effect inherent to each modality. Moreover, each modality clusters distinct social profiles, reflecting segmentation within the educational system. Overall, each modality operates as a mechanism that makes social inequities visible; while it does not generate inequality, it reinforces and amplifies it. These findings underscore the need to strengthen pedagogical practices in virtual and distance modalities and to reduce the social disparities that shape learning outcomes","teacher education; instructional modality; educational inequality; sociocultural factors; Colombia Modalidades de ensino como espelho da desigualdade na formação docente na Colômbia: análise dos resultados do Saber Pro Resum0 Este estudo analisa as disparidades de desempenho no exame Saber Pro, na Colômbia, entre 2016 e 2024, utilizando uma abordagem quantitativa com uma base nacional compost",marcadores,citar este articulo hernandez 2026 modalidad de ensenanza como,study examin performance gaps saber pro exam colombia between 2016 2024 using quantitative approach national dataset more than 200 000 student enroll teachertrain program multivariate statistical model employ compare overall scor acros instructional modaliti facetoface virtual distance while also taking into account sociocultural variabl result reveal consistent differenc performance highest facetoface program follow virtual program lowest distance program although gaps narrow depend socioeconomic statu variable variabl such parental education gender area residence do not disappear indicat pedagogical effect inherent each modality moreover each modality cluster distinct social profil reflect segmentation within educational system overall each modality operat mechanism make social inequiti visible while does not generate inequality reinforc amplifi these finding underscore need strengthen pedagogical practic virtual distance modaliti reduce social dispariti shape learn outcom,teacher education instructional modality educational inequality sociocultural factor colombia modalidad de ensino como espelho da desigualdade na formacao docente na colombia analise dos resultado do saber pro resum0 este estudo analisa disparidad de desempenho no exame saber pro na colombia entre 2016 2024 utilizando uma abordagem quantitativa com uma base nacional compost,citar este articulo hernandez 2026 modalidad de ensenanza como study examin performance gaps saber pro exam colombia between 2016 2024 using quantitative approach national dataset more than 200 000 student enroll teachertrain program multivariate statistical model employ compare overall scor acros instructional modaliti facetoface virtual distance while also taking into account sociocultural variabl result reveal consistent differenc performance highest facetoface program follow virtual program lowest distance program although gaps narrow depend socioeconomic statu variable variabl such parental education gender area residence do not disappear indicat pedagogical effect inherent each modality moreover each modality