ia aunque dispositiv escolar configuran subjetividad docil mediante practic control conductual infanci contemporane despliegan agenci politic contestatari desbordan normativa institucional discute potencial estas practic disident reconfigurar praxis pedagogica hacia model democratic superen simulacro participativo concluye escuela debe transitar control validacion subjetividad politica ninos ninas reconoc disidencia no como indisciplina sino como forma legitima construccion ciudadania identidad participacion infantil gubernamentalidad sociologia educacion subjetividad politica infancia participacion social politica citar este articulo ortega agudelo 2026 participacion infantil disidente tension entre gubernamentalidad escolar agencia politica infancia praxis saber 17 48 1-14 https doi org 10 19053 uptc 22160159 v17 n48 2026 204,1.0.0,6a35c200b45ff424
2462-8603,Participación+infantil+disidente.pdf,Participación+infantil+disidente_0,en,2026). Participación infantil,"Child participation in schools has historically oscillated between invisibility and adultcentric tutelage, limiting students’ capacity for agency. The purpose of this reflective article is to analyze the emergence of dissident child participation (DCP) as an analytical category that unsettles the mechanisms of governmentality operating in contemporary educational contexts. Methodologically, the study uses a dual-corpus documentary triangulation design. It combines a systematic bibliometric literature review with a Foucauldian archaeological analysis of school archives, contrasted against recent studies (2011–2024). The main findings demonstrate that while school dispositifs cultivate docile subjects through behavioral control practices, contemporary children exercise a counter-hegemonic political agency that surpasses institutional norms. This paper discusses the potential of these dissident practices to reconfigure pedagogical praxis toward democratic models that move beyond simulated participation. It concludes that schools must transition from behavioral control to the validation of children’s political subjectivity, framing dissidence not as indiscipline, but as a legitimate expression of citizenship and identity","Child Participation; Governmentality; Sociology of Education; Political Subjectivity; Childhood; Social Participation; Public Policy Participação infantil dissidente: tensões entre governamentalidade escolar e agência política da infância Resum0 A participação infantil na escola tem oscilado historicamente entre a invisibilidade e a tutela adultocêntrica, limitando a capacidade de agência dos",marcadores,2026 participacion infantil,child participation school has historically oscillat between invisibility adultcentric tutelage limit student capacity agency purpose reflective article analyze emergence dissident child participation dcp analytical category unsettl mechanism governmentality operat contemporary educational context methodologically study uses dual-corpu documentary triangulation design combin systematic bibliometric literature review foucauldian archaeological analysi school archiv contrast against recent studi 2011-2024 main finding demonstrate while school dispositif cultivate docile subject through behavioral control practic contemporary children exercise counter-hegemonic political agency surpass institutional norm paper discuss potential these dissident practic reconfigure pedagogical praxi toward democratic model move beyond simulat participation conclud school must transition behavioral control validation children political subjectivity fram dissidence not indiscipline but legitimate expression citizenship identity,child participation governmentality sociology education political subjectivity childhood social participation public policy participacao infantil dissidente tenso entre governamentalidade escolar agencia politica da infancia resum0 participacao infantil na escola tem oscilado historicamente entre invisibilidade tutela adultocentrica limitando capacidade de agencia dos,2026 participacion infantil child participation school has historically oscillat between invisibility adultcentric tutelage limit student capacity agency purpose reflective article analyze emergence dissident child participation dcp analytical category unsettl mechanism governmentality operat contemporary educational context methodologically study uses dual-corpu documentary triangulation design combin systematic bibliometric literature review foucauldian archaeological analysi school archiv contrast against recent studi 2011-2024 main finding demonstrate while school dispositif cultivate docile subject through behavioral control practic contemporary children exercise counter-hegemonic political agency surpass institutional norm paper discuss potential these dissident practic reconfigure pedagogical praxi toward democratic model move beyond simulat participation conclud school must transition behavioral control validation children political subjectivity fram dissidence not indiscipline but legitimate expression citizenship identity child participation governmentality sociology education political subjectivity childhood social participation public policy participacao infantil dissidente tenso entre governamentalidade escolar agencia politica da infancia resum0 participacao infantil na escola tem oscilado historicamente entre invisibilidade tutela adultocentrica limitando capacidade de agencia dos,1.0.0,01c2d3b4aa91c41b
2462-8603,Simondon+La+filosofía+y+la+enseñanza.pdf,Simondon+La+filosofía+y+la+enseñanza_0,es,Simondon: la filosofía y la enseñanza como técnicas de,"El texto presenta resultados de uno de los objetivos del proyecto de investigación2, el cual se ocupó del aparato teórico-metodológico que construyó Gilbert Simondon sobre la técnica y la filosofía de la técnica, con el fin de leer su apuesta sobre la filosofía, la educación y la enseñanza como técnicas de la cultura. El proyecto hace un rastreo teórico-conceptual en la obra de Simondon y propone una estrategia de lectura y análisis desde ella misma; de igual forma, se acude a algunos comentaristas expertos en la obra para plantear la aplicación categorial y enunciativa de sus conceptos. El texto parte de la concepción de filosofía en el autor, y a partir de ella, dialoga con su concepción de ciencia, cultura y formación, lo que permite resignificar las posibilidades de la educación moderna y contemporánea en problematización constante con la técnica y los objetos técnicos. Los resultados de la investigación llevan a mostrar que Simondon reconoce la potencia de transgredir las prácticas modernas de educación y enseñanza","filosofía; enseñanza de la filosofía; técnica; filosofía de la educación; cultura; Simondon 2.Proyecto Ética y biopolítica. Prácticas socioeducativas universitarias entre tecnología y salud, liderado por la UNAM de México y la UPTC de Colombia, realizado durante los años 2021 y 2023 con la participación de varias universidades latinoamericanas. Código de proyecto: PAPIIT IN305521 y PAPIIT IN4",marcadores,simondon filosofia ensenanza como tecnic,texto presenta resultad uno objetiv proyecto investigacion2 cual ocupo aparato teorico-metodologico construyo gilbert simondon sobre tecnica filosofia tecnica fin leer apuesta sobre filosofia educacion ensenanza como tecnic cultura proyecto hace rastreo teorico-conceptual obra simondon propone estrategia lectura analisis desde ella misma igual forma acude algun comentarist expert obra plantear aplicacion categorial enunciativa sus concept texto parte concepcion filosofia autor partir ella dialoga concepcion ciencia cultura formacion permite resignificar posibilidad educacion moderna contemporanea problematizacion constante tecnica objet tecnic resultad investigacion llevan mostrar simondon reconoce potencia transgredir practic modern educacion ensenanza,filosofia ensenanza filosofia tecnica filosofia educacion cultura simondon proyecto etica biopolitica practic socioeducativ universitari entre tecnologia salud liderado unam mexico uptc colombia realizado durante anos 2021 2023 participacion vari universidad latinoamerican codigo proyecto papiit in305521 papiit in4,simondon filosofia ensenanza como tecnic texto presenta resultad uno objetiv proyecto investigacion2 cual ocupo aparato teorico-metodologico construyo gilbert simondon sobre tecnica filosofia tecnica fin leer apuesta sobre filosofia educacion ensenanza como tecnic cultura proyecto hace rastreo teorico-conceptual obra simondon propone estrategia lectura analisis desde ella misma igual forma acude algun comentarist expert obra plantear aplicacion categorial enunciativa sus concept texto parte concepcion filosofia autor partir ella dialoga concepcion ciencia cultura formacion permite resignificar posibilidad educacion moderna contemporanea problematizacion constante tecnica objet tecnic resultad investigacion llevan mostrar simondon reconoce potencia transgredir practic modern educacion ensenanza filosofia ensenanza filosofia tecnica filosofia educacion cultura simondon proyecto etica biopolitica practic socioeducativ universitari entre tecnologia salud liderado unam mexico uptc colombia realizado durante anos 2021 2023 participacion vari universidad latinoamerican codigo proyecto papiit in305521 papiit in4,1.0.0,cdae38164024b321
2462-8603,Simondon+La+filosofía+y+la+enseñanza.pdf,Simondon+La+filosofía+y+la+enseñanza_0,en,"T., & Espinel, O. (2026). Simondon:","The text presents the results of one of the objectives of the research project, which dealt with the theoretical-methodological apparatus constructed by Gilbert Simondon on technology and the philosophy of technology, with the aim of interpreting his approach to philosophy, education, and teaching as techniques of culture. The project conducts a theoretical-conceptual review of Simondon’s work and proposes a strategy for reading and analyzing it; similarly, it draws on some expert commentators on the work to propose the categorical and enunciative application of its concepts. The text starts from the author’s conception of philosophy and, based on this, engages in dialogue with his conception of science, culture, and education, allowing for a reinterpretation of the possibilities of modern and contemporary education in constant dialogue with technology and technical objects. The results of the research show that Simondon recognizes the power of transgressing modern practices of education and teaching","philosophy; teaching philosophy; technique; philosophy of education; culture; Simondon Simondon: a filosofia e o ensino como técnicas da cultura Resum0 O texto apresenta os resultados de um dos objetivos do projeto de pesquisa, que tratou do aparato teórico-metodológico construído por Gilbert Simondon sobre a técnica e a filosofia da técnica, com o objetivo de interpretar sua abordagem sobre",marcadores,espinel 2026 simondon,text present result one objectiv research project which dealt theoretical-methodological apparatu construct gilbert simondon technology philosophy technology aim interpret his approach philosophy education teach techniqu culture project conduct theoretical-conceptual review simondon work propos strategy read analyz similarly draw some expert commentator work propose categorical enunciative application its concept text