2462-8794,document (5).pdf,document (5)_0,en,"Antioquia, Medellín, Colombia","The development of mathematical understanding has been one of the fundamental challenges in the processes of teaching and learning mathematics. This article presents a reflection of Pirie and Kieren's model as a didactic alternative for the understanding of the concept of trigonometric ratio, derived from a doctoral thesis study in the field of mathematics education that seeks to develop a learning scheme for this fundamental concept of mathematics within the framework of this model. For the fulfillment of this purpose, the methodological alternative of content analysis with a qualitative perspective was approached in order to find and describe understandings and meanings of the use of this model for the teaching and understanding of mathematical concepts. At a general level, it is concluded that, by means of the proposed model, it is possible to make visible and promote the evolution of the understanding of mathematical concepts; thanks to the characteristics of the theory that allow the cognitive mobilization and the study of the different representations within the process of understanding mathematical objects and concepts","Pirie and Kieren Model, Mathematics Didactics, Mathematical Comprehension, Trigonometric Ratio",marcadores,antioquia medellin colombia,development mathematical understand has been one fundamental challeng process teach learn mathematic article present reflection pirie kieren model didactic alternative understand concept trigonometric ratio deriv doctoral thesi study field mathematic education seek develop learn scheme fundamental concept mathematic within framework model fulfillment purpose methodological alternative content analysi qualitative perspective approach order find describe understanding meaning use model teach understand mathematical concept general level conclud mean propos model possible make visible promote evolution understand mathematical concept thank characteristic theory allow cognitive mobil study different represent within proces understand mathematical object concept,pirie kieren model mathematic didactic mathematical comprehension trigonometric ratio,antioquia medellin colombia development mathematical understand has been one fundamental challeng process teach learn mathematic article present reflection pirie kieren model didactic alternative understand concept trigonometric ratio deriv doctoral thesi study field mathematic education seek develop learn scheme fundamental concept mathematic within framework model fulfillment purpose methodological alternative content analysi qualitative perspective approach order find describe understanding meaning use model teach understand mathematical concept general level conclud mean propos model possible make visible promote evolution understand mathematical concept thank characteristic theory allow cognitive mobil study different represent within proces understand mathematical object concept pirie kieren model mathematic didactic mathematical comprehension trigonometric ratio,1.0.0,5223490fe4d199ce
2462-8794,document (6).pdf,document (6)_0,es,Impacto de la modelación con integral definida en la determinación del nivel de líquido,"El estudio se centró en cómo la modelación potencia las interacciones en las clases de matemáticas, específicamente al usar la integral definida para estimar el nivel de líquido en un tanque entre estudiantes de ingeniería en cálculo integral. Se utilizó una metodología cualitativa descriptiva e interpretativa, con una perspectiva fenomenológica en un estudio de caso. Los hallazgos indicaron una fuerte concordancia entre los datos reales y los modelados. Esta alineación demuestra que integrar estos métodos en la enseñanza motiva y compromete más a los estudiantes, enriqueciendo sus interacciones y profundizando su comprensión sobre la aplicación de la integral definida en contextos prácticos. Este hallazgo subraya la relevancia de incluir enfoques prácticos y escenarios reales en la didáctica matemática, buscando fomentar una comprensión profunda y un mayor interés estudiantil","Modelación Matemática, Contexto De Aprendizaje, Realidad, Resignificación. Francisco Javier Córdoba-Gómeza, Fermín Álvarez-Maceab, Cesar Augusto Hernández-Suárezc aMagíster en Matemática Educativa, franciscocordoba@itm.edu.co, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3371-3643, Docente Instituto Tecnológico Metropolitano, Medellín, Colombia. bDoctorando en Ciencias de la Educación, fermin.alvarez@udea.ed",marcadores,impacto modelacion integral definida determinacion nivel liquido,estudio centro como modelacion potencia interaccion clas matematic especifica usar integral definida estimar nivel liquido tanque entre estudiant ingenieria calculo integral utilizo metodologia cualitativa descriptiva interpretativa perspectiva fenomenologica estudio caso hallazg indicaron fuerte concordancia entre datos real modelad esta alineacion demuestra integrar estos metod ensenanza motiva compromete mas estudiant enriquec sus interaccion profundiz comprension sobre aplicacion integral definida context practic este hallazgo subraya relevancia incluir enfoqu practic escenari real didactica matematica busc fomentar comprension profunda mayor inter estudiantil,modelacion matematica contexto aprendizaje realidad resignificacion francisco javier cordoba-gomeza fermin alvarez-maceab cesar augusto hernandez-suarezc amagister matematica educativa franciscocordoba itm edu co https orcid org 0000-0002-3371-3643 docente instituto tecnologico metropolitano medellin colombia bdoctor cienci educacion fermin alvarez udea ed,impacto modelacion integral definida determinacion nivel liquido estudio centro como modelacion potencia interaccion clas matematic especifica usar integral definida estimar nivel liquido tanque entre estudiant ingenieria calculo integral utilizo metodologia cualitativa descriptiva interpretativa perspectiva fenomenologica estudio caso hallazg indicaron fuerte concordancia entre datos real modelad esta alineacion demuestra integrar estos metod ensenanza motiva compromete mas estudiant enriquec sus interaccion profundiz comprension sobre aplicacion integral definida context practic este hallazgo subraya relevancia incluir enfoqu practic escenari real didactica matematica busc fomentar comprension profunda mayor inter estudiantil modelacion matematica contexto aprendizaje realidad resignificacion francisco javier cordoba-gomeza fermin alvarez-maceab cesar augusto hernandez-suarezc amagister matematica educativa franciscocordoba itm edu co https orcid org 0000-0002-3371-3643 docente instituto tecnologico metropolitano medellin colombia bdoctor cienci educacion fermin alvarez udea ed,1.0.0,85891ea395d272fc
2462-8794,document (6).pdf,document (6)_0,en,interés estudiantil.,"The study focused on how modeling enhances interactions in mathematics classes, specifically by using the definite integral to estimate the liquid level in a tank among engineering students in integral calculus. A descriptive and interpretive qualitative methodology was employed, with a phenomenological perspective in a case study. The findings indicated strong agreement between real and modeled data. This alignment demonstrates that integrating these methods in teaching motivates and engages students more, enriching their interactions and deepening their understanding of the application of the definite integral in practical contexts. This finding underscores the relevance of including practical approaches and real-world scenarios in mathematics education, aiming to foster a profound understanding and increased student interest","Mathematical Modeling, Learning Context, Reality, Mathematical Modeling, Resignification",marcadores,inter estudiantil,study focus how model enhanc interaction mathematic class specifically using definite integral estimate liquid level tank among engineer student integral calculu descriptive interpretive qualitative methodology employ phenomenological perspective case study finding indicat strong agreement between real model data alignment demonstrat integrat these method teach motivat engag student more enrich their interaction deepen their understand application definite integral practical context find underscor relevance includ practical approach real-world scenario mathematic education aiming foster profound understand increas student interest,mathematical model learn context reality mathematical model resignification,inter estudiantil study focus how model enhanc interaction mathematic class specifically using definite integral estimate liquid level tank among engineer student integral calculu descriptive interpretive qualitative methodology employ phenomenological perspective case study finding indicat strong agreement between real model data alignment demonstrat integrat these method teach motivat engag student more enrich their interaction deepen their understand application definite integral practical context find underscor relevance includ practical approach real-world scenario mathematic education aiming foster profound understand increas student interest mathematical model learn context reality mathematical model resignification,1.0.0,e2de5b5371f045e1
2462-8794,document (7).pdf,document (7)_0,es,Sobre el operador q-integral fraccional generalizado de tipo Kober que envuelve la,"En este artículo se pretende aplicar el operador q-integral fraccional generalizado de tipo kober establecido por Castillo y Galué, a la análoga básica de la función hipergeométrica generalizada. Usando la representación en serie del operador y de la análoga básica de la función hipergeométrica generalizada se obtiene un nuevo resultado, al cual, después de hacer cambios adecuados en sus parámetros, se verifica que contiene formas generalizadas de las integrales q-fraccionales de las funciones hipergeométricas básicas eq (x), Eq (x) ,Jν (1) (x;q) ,Jν (2) (x;q), Ln α (x;q), Pn (α,β) (x;q),Wn (x;b,q),Sn (x;p,q) y varias q-funciones elementales. Tales resultados constituyen una nueva tabla de integrales, la cual generaliza a las establecidas por otros investigadores","Análoga básica de la función hipergeométrica generalizada, Aplicaciones, Cálculo Q-fraccional, Operador Q-integral fraccional, Q-funciones elementales y especiales. Jaime Antonio Castillo-Péreza*, Leda Galué-Lealb a*Doctor en Ciencias Matemáticas, jcastillo@uniguajira.edu.co, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7850-4159, Universidad de la Guajira, Riohacha, Colombia. bDoctor en Ciencias Matemátic",marcadores,sobre operador q-integral fraccional generalizado tipo kober envuelve,este articulo pretende aplicar operador q-integral fraccional generalizado tipo kober establecido castillo galue analoga basica funcion hipergeometrica generalizada usando representacion serie operador analoga basica funcion hipergeometrica generalizada obtiene nuevo resultado cual despu hacer cambi adecuad sus parametr verifica contiene form generalizad integral q-fraccional funcion hipergeometric basic eq eq jn jn ln pn wn sn vari q-funcion elemental tales resultad constituyen nueva tabla integral cual generaliza establecid otros investigador,analoga basica funcion hipergeometrica generalizada aplic calculo q-fraccional operador q-integral fraccional q-funcion elemental especial jaime antonio castillo-pereza leda galue-lealb doctor cienci matematic jcastillo uniguajira edu co https orcid org 0000-0002-7850-4159 universidad guajira riohacha colombia bdoctor cienci matematic,sobre operador q-integral fraccional generalizado tipo kober envuelve este articulo pretende aplicar operador q-integral fraccional generalizado tipo kober establecido castillo galue analoga basica funcion hipergeometrica generalizada usando representacion serie operador analoga basica funcion hipergeometrica generalizada obtiene nuevo resultado cual despu hacer cambi adecuad sus parametr verifica contiene form generalizad integral q-fraccional funcion hipergeometric basic eq eq jn jn ln pn wn sn vari q-funcion elemental tales resultad constituyen nueva tabla integral cual generaliza establecid otros investigador analoga basica funcion hipergeometrica generalizada aplic calculo q-fraccional operador q-integral fraccional q-funcion elemental especial jaime antonio castillo-pereza leda galue-lealb doctor cienci matematic jcastillo uniguajira edu co https orcid org 0000-0002-7850-4159 universidad guajira riohacha colombia bdoctor cienci matematic,1.0.0,edaec5dfa196a399
2462-8794,document (7).pdf,document (7)_0,en,"(x;b,q),Sn (x;p,q) y varias q-funciones elementales. Tales resultados constituyen una","This paper aims to apply the generalized fractional q-integral operator of the Kober type established by Castillo and Galué, to the basic analogue of the generalized hypergeometric function. Using the series representation of the operator and the basic analogue of the generalized hypergeometric function, a new result is obtained, which by making appropriate changes in its parameters, is verified to contain generalized forms of the q-fractional integrals of the basic hypergeometric functions eq (x), Eq (x) ,Jν (1) (x;q) ,Jν (2) (x;q), Ln α (x;q), Pn (α,β) (x;q),Wn (x;b,q),Sn (x;p,q) and several elementary q-functions. Such results constitute a new table of integrals, which generalizes those established by other researchers","Basic analogue of the generalized hypergeometric function, Applications, Elementary and Special Q-functions, Fractional Q-integral operator, Q-fractional calculus",marcadores,sn varia q-funcion elemental tale resultado constituyen una,paper aims apply generaliz fractional q-integral operator kober type establish castillo galue basic analogue generaliz hypergeometric function using seri representation operator basic analogue generaliz hypergeometric function new result obtain which making appropriate chang its parameter verifi contain generaliz form q-fractional integral basic hypergeometric function eq eq jn jn ln pn wn sn several elementary q-function such result constitute new table integral which generaliz those establish other researcher,basic analogue generaliz hypergeometric function applic elementary special q-function fractional q-integral operator q-fractional calculu,sn varia q-funcion elemental tale resultado constituyen una paper aims apply generaliz fractional q-integral operator kober type establish castillo galue basic analogue generaliz hypergeometric function using seri representation operator basic analogue generaliz hypergeometric function new result obtain which making appropriate chang its parameter verifi contain generaliz form q-fractional integral basic hypergeometric function eq eq jn jn ln pn wn sn several elementary q-function such result constitute new table integral which generaliz those establish other researcher basic analogue generaliz hypergeometric function applic elementary special q-function fractional q-integral operator q-fractional calculu,1.0.0,44c9a998d102addc
2462-8794,document (9).pdf,document (9)_0,en,Epistemology of teaching practices in mathematical problem solving: An emerging,"The study addresses the need to develop heuristic frameworks in mathematics education that facilitate problem solving and close the gap between theory and practice. This article, based on a qualitative ethnographic methodology, analyzes the interactions and emerging meanings in teaching practices in the Colombian context. The sample included teachers, students and graduates of engineering and management careers, intentionally selected to represent diverse perspectives. Through in-depth interviews, participant observation and document analysis, data were collected, categorized and coded inductively. The main results highlight the importance of effective instructional strategies, the incorporation of ICT, and adaptation to changes such as those imposed by the COVID-19 pandemic. In addition, teachers' beliefs and attitudes were identified as significantly influencing their pedagogical practices and students' ability to solve complex mathematical problems. The configuration of the epistemology of teaching practice is based on the description of these emerging elements and their interactions to improve the teaching and learning of mathematics in university contexts, offering a comprehensive understanding of the educational dynamics that can inform policies and practices to improve the teaching and learning of mathematics in university contexts","Mathematics education, teaching practice, problemsolving, educational ethnography, educational technology. Maryuri Astrid Borrero-Rodríguez1*, Leydi Yaritza Martínez-Pardo2, Karen Marbeny Díaz-García3, Zulmary Carolina Nieto-Sánchez4 dDra. en educacion, zulmary.nieto.s@uniminuto.edu.co, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6725-4601, Corporacion Univesitaria Minuto de Dios, Cúcuta, a*PhD. en Educació",marcadores,epistemology teach practic mathematical problem solv emerg,study address need develop heuristic framework mathematic education facilitate problem solv close gap between theory practice article based qualitative ethnographic methodology analyz interaction emerg meaning teach practic colombian context sample includ teacher student graduat engineer management career intentionally select represent diverse perspectiv through in-depth interview participant observation document analysi data collect categoriz coded inductively main result highlight importance effective instructional strategi incorporation ict adaptation chang such those impos covid-19 pandemic addition teacher belief attitud identifi significantly influenc their pedagogical practic student ability solve complex mathematical problem configuration epistemology teach practice based description these emerg element their interaction improve teach learn mathematic university context offer comprehensive understand educational dynamic can inform polici practic improve teach learn mathematic university context,mathematic education teach practice problemsolv educational ethnography educational technology maryuri astrid borrero-rodriguez1 leydi yaritza martinez-pardo2 karen marbeny diaz-garcia3 zulmary carolina nieto-sanchez4 ddra en educacion zulmary nieto uniminuto edu co http orcid org 0000-0001-6725-4601 corporacion univesitaria minuto de dios cucuta phd en educacio,epistemology teach practic mathematical problem solv emerg study address need develop heuristic framework mathematic education facilitate problem solv close gap between theory practice article based qualitative ethnographic methodology analyz interaction emerg meaning teach practic colombian context sample includ teacher student graduat engineer management career intentionally select represent diverse perspectiv through in-depth interview participant observation document analysi data collect categoriz coded inductively main result highlight importance effective instructional strategi incorporation ict adaptation chang such those impos covid-19 pandemic a