e knowledge about contraceptive methods 92 showed attitud of acceptance and 70 of students talked with their parents about sex education focus groups included 15 students parents and 15 teachers where perception of sexuality as dimension of the human being perception of sex education role of the stakeholders contraceptive methods and sexual and reproductive rights were the emerging five categori conclusions as sex education is limited by multiple barriers the need for engaging parents school and students is emphasized to enhance family communication which strengthens the educational process key words sex education contraception knowledge attitude sexual health reproductive health 2026 universidad fucs this is an open access article under the cc by-nc-nd license http creativecommons org licens by-nc-nd introduccion oficial bogota diligenciaron cuestionario sobre conoc actitud sobre anticoncepcion aspecto cualitativo mediante grup focal indagaron experienci sobre educacion sexual estudiant padr profesor resultad 127 estudiant 70 tenian conoc adecuad sobre metod anticonceptiv 92 actitud aceptacion 70 comunicacion sus padr sobre educacion sexual grup focal participaron 15 estudiant padr 15 docent emergieron categori final percepcion sobre sexualidad como dimension ser humano percepcion educacion sexual rol actor involucrad metod anticonceptiv identificacion derech sexual reproductiv conclusion educacion sexual recibida esta limitada multipl barrer enfatiza necesidad participacion padr colegi estudiant fin mejorar comunicacion famili cual fortalece proceso educativo educacion sexual anticoncepcion conocimiento actitud salud sexual salud reproductiva 2026 universidad fucs este articulo open access bajo licencia cc by-nc-nd http creativecommons org licens by-nc-nd adolescencia etapa ciclo vital transicion entre ninez adultez caracteriza ser periodo transformacion involucra cambi fisi,1.0.0,d23319dfac798418
