2463-0470,document (3).pdf,document (3)_0,en,Evolution of the principle of territorial fiscal autonomy:,"Background and objectives: This study explores how the principle of fiscal autonomy has changed in Colombia since the 1991 Constitution, which laid the foundations for decentralization and strengthened the financial capacity of local governments. Methods: Through a review of the available literature, the main approaches, challenges and opportunities that have marked the implementation of fiscal autonomy in the country are identified. Using bibliometric analysis tools, the work shows a steady increase in academic interest on the topic, particularly in response to fiscal reforms and decentralization policies in recent decades. findings: The results highlight that, although fiscal autonomy has allowed municipalities some capacity to manage their income and expenditure, they still face important limitations. Dependence on resources from the central government and disparities in administrative capacities between municipalities limit their true autonomy. Despite these obstacles, the potential of fiscal autonomy is evident, as it allows for public management more aligned with local needs and encourages citizen participation and transparency in decision-making. Conclusion: This article provides a comprehensive overview of the development of fiscal autonomy in Colombia and highlights the factors that determine its implementation. The findings provide a solid basis for future research aimed at strengthening the capacities of local governments and perfecting the model of fiscal decentralization in the country","Fiscal autonomy; decentralization, local government; municipal tax collection; bibliometric review. JEL: H30; H39 NUMBER OF REFERENCES 16 NUMBER OF FIGURES 5 NUMBER OF TABLES 1 ORIGINAL RESEARCH PAPER ARTICLE INFO Article History: Received: 21/07/2025 Accepted: 03/09/2025 Published: 15/10/2025 *Correspond",marcadores,evolution principle territorial fiscal autonomy,background objectiv study explor how principle fiscal autonomy has chang colombia since 1991 constitution which laid found decentral strengthen financial capacity local government method through review available literature main approach challeng opportuniti have mark implementation fiscal autonomy country identifi using bibliometric analysi tool work show steady increase academic interest topic particularly response fiscal reform decentral polici recent decad finding result highlight although fiscal autonomy has allow municipaliti some capacity manage their income expenditure they still face important limit dependence resourc central government dispariti administrative capaciti between municipaliti limit their true autonomy despite these obstacl potential fiscal autonomy evident allow public management more align local need encourag citizen participation transparency decision-mak conclusion article provid comprehensive overview development fiscal autonomy colombia highlight factor determine its implementation finding provide solid basi future research aimed strengthen capaciti local government perfect model fiscal decentral country,fiscal autonomy decentral local government municipal tax collection bibliometric review jel h30 h39 number referenc 16 number figur number tabl original research paper article info article history receiv 21 07 2025 accept 03 09 2025 publish 15 10 2025 correspond,evolution principle territorial fiscal autonomy background objectiv study explor how principle fiscal autonomy has chang colombia since 1991 constitution which laid found decentral strengthen financial capacity local government method through review available literature main approach challeng opportuniti have mark implementation fiscal autonomy country identifi using bibliometric analysi tool work show steady increase academic interest topic particularly response fiscal reform decentral polici recent decad finding result highlight although fiscal autonomy has allow municipaliti some