2463-0470,document (4).pdf,document (4)_0,en,Effects of public procurement on the innovation,"Background and objectives: In the Colombian case, a structural gap persists in the development of innovation capacities within Colombian manufacturing firms. This study analyzes the role of the National Government and innovation in the Colombian manufacturing sector, by identifying the factors that enhance or limit public procurement on firms' innovation capacity. Methods: On this regard, the relationship between national government and the propensity to innovate was estimated using a Probit model using cross-sectional data provided by the National Administrative Department of Statistics (DANE). Explanatory and control variables were included to understand firm characteristics. Findings: Public procurement has positive and significant effects on the innovation propensity of Colombian manufacturing firms. The expected effect persists when considering control variables such as firm size, expenditure on innovation activities, and technological intensity. Conclusion: Public procurement influences companies' propensity to innovate. This highlights the role of the Colombian state in fostering innovation in the manufacturing sector. This has significant policy implications, such as the fact that targeted public investments in key manufacturing activities will enhance companies' capacity for innovation and boost the pace of innovation in Colombia",Public procurement; Innovation drivers; Manufacturing firms; Probit estimation. JEL: O30; O31; O32 NUMBER OF REFERENCES 46 NUMBER OF FIGURES 2 NUMBER OF TABLES 3 ORIGINAL RESEARCH PAPER ARTICLE INFO Article History: Received: 09/06/2025 Accepted: 25/08/2025 Published: 15/10/2025 *Corresponding author,marcadores,effect public procurement innovation,background objectiv colombian case structural gap persist development innovation capaciti within colombian manufactur firm study analyz role national government innovation colombian manufactur sector identify factor enhance limit public procurement firm innovation capacity method regard relationship between national government propensity innovate estimat using probit model using cross-sectional data provid national administrative department statistic dane explanatory control variabl includ understand firm characteristic finding public procurement has positive significant effect innovation propensity colombian manufactur firm expect effect persist when consider control variabl such firm size expenditure innovation activiti technological intensity conclusion public procurement influenc compani propensity innovate highlight role colombian state foster innovation manufactur sector has significant policy implic such fact target public investment key manufactur activiti will enhance compani capacity innovation boost pace innovation colombia,public procurement innovation driver manufactur firm probit estimation jel o30 o31 o32 number referenc 46 number figur number tabl original research paper article info article history receiv 09 06 2025 accept 25 08 2025 publish 15 10 2025 correspond author,effect public procurement innovation background objectiv colombian case structural gap persist development innovation capaciti within colombian manufactur firm study analyz role national government innovation colombian manufactur sector identify factor enhance limit public procurement firm innovation capacity method regard relationship between national government propensity innovate estimat using probit model using cross-sectional data provid national administrative department statistic dane explanatory control variabl includ understand firm characteristic finding public procurement has positive significant effect innovation propensity colombian manufactur firm expect effect persist when consider control variabl such firm size expenditure innovation activiti technological intensity conclusion public procurement influenc compani propensity innovate highlight role colombian s