2500-5421,v2_07+estado+arte+IA+RIIEP19_vol1.pdf,v2_07+estado+arte+IA+RIIEP19_vol1_0,en,ersidad del Atlántico.,"Objective. To examine the influence of Artificial Intelligence (AI) on the development of mathematical thinking in educational settings. Method. Systematic review of literature published between 2019 and 2024 through searches in academic databases. A total of 138 articles were identified, and 45 met the inclusion criteria. Results. Three main trends emerged: (1) the use of intelligent tutoring systems to personalize learning, (2) AI-based learning analytics to assess mathematical thinking, and (3) adaptive learning environments that foster mathematical reasoning. Conclusion. AI technologies are transforming mathematics education, providing opportunities for personalized and precise assessment, and opening new directions for future pedagogical research","artificial intelligence, mathematics education, mathematical thinking, intelligent tutor systems, adaptive learning. REVISTA INTERAMERICANA DE INVESTIGACIÓN, EDUCACIÓN Y PEDAGOGÍA DOI: https://doi.org/10.15332/j2av3v41 207 ISSN: 1657-107X e-ISSN: 2500-5421 Estado da Arte sobre Inteligência Artificial e Pensamento Matemático: Uma Revisão Sistemática",marcadores,ersidad del atlantico,objective examine influence artificial intelligence ai development mathematical think educational setting method systematic review literature publish between 2019 2024 through search academic databas total 138 articl identifi 45 met inclusion criteria result three main trend emerg use intelligent tutor system personalize learn ai-bas learn analytic asses mathematical think adaptive learn environment foster mathematical reason conclusion ai technologi transform mathematic education provid opportuniti personaliz precise assessment open new direction future pedagogical research,artificial intelligence mathematic education mathematical think intelligent tutor system adaptive learn revista interamericana de investigacion educacion peda