bliometrix meio da linguagem programacao do pacote biblioshiny em formato planilha xls trabalho no google sheets complementar as analis das palavras-chave periodic realizou-se separacao dos dados em period dez anos totaliz seis period 1970-1979 1980-1989 1990-1999 2000-2009 2010-2019 2020-2024 como resultad apresenta os indicador metric gerais atrelad producao cientifica associada paleontologia brasileira identifica os principais periodic publicacao caracteriza desenvolvimento tematico da paleontologia brasileira meio da analise das palavras-chave conclui os resultad sao relevant compreender paleontologia brasileira destac sua orientacao nacional em estud dos fosseis bem como enfase em estud abordam evolucao no contexto geo-bio-paleontologico no brasil na america do sul paleontologia estud metric da informacao cientometria paleontologia brasileira web of science ciencia da informacao paleontologia brasileira uma analise da literatura publicada indexada na web of science 2026 universidad antioquia publicado universidad antioquia colombia este artigo deriva pesquisa realizada no ambito do mestrado em ciencia da informacao,1.0.0,880ac6db2bbc7796
2538-9866,v49n2e358489.pdf,v49n2e358489_0,en,ia brasileira; Web of Science; Ciência da Informação.,"This article sought to carry out a scientometric analysis of Paleontology in Brazil based on data collected on the Web of Science. The main general objective is to map scientific production in Paleontology associated with Brazil, over time, using the Web of Science as a database. The literature review presented concepts for Paleontology, for the national context of this science, as well as for Information Metric Studies. The research used a mixed approach of qualitative and quantitative elements. The main contribution of this study is the realization of a comprehensive mapping of the bibliometric characteristics of intellectual production in national Paleontology. Regarding the results, general metric indicators linked to scientific production associated with Brazilian Paleontology were presented based on information collected on the Web of Science; identified the main journals that publish research in Paleontology carried out in Brazil; and characterized the thematic development of Brazilian Paleontology through the analysis of","used in studies throughout the decades from 1970 to 2020. The results are relevant to understanding Brazilian Paleontology, highlighting its national orientation in fossil studies, the wide production located in the Southeast, the emphasis on studies that address evolution in the geo-bio-paleontological context in Brazil and South America. Keywords: paleontology; information metric studies",marcadores,ia brasileira web science ciencia da informacao,article sought carry out scientometric analysi paleontology brazil based data collect web science main general objective map scientific production paleontology associat brazil over time using web science database literature review present concept paleontology national context science well information metric studi research used mixed approach qualitative quantitative element main contribution study real comprehensive mapp bibliometric characteristic intellectual production national paleontology regard result general metric indicator link scientific production associat brazilian paleontology present based information collect web science identifi main journal publish research paleontology carri out brazil characteriz thematic development brazilian paleontology through analysi,used studi throughout decad 1970 2020 result relevant understand brazilian paleontology highlight its national orientation fossil studi wide production locat southeast emphasi studi addres evolution geo-bio-paleontological context brazil south america keyword paleontology information metric studi,ia brasileira web science ciencia da informacao article sought carry out scientometric analysi paleontology brazil based data collect web science main general objective map scientific production paleontology associat brazil over time using web science database literature review present concept paleontology national context science well information metric studi research used mixed approach qualitative quantitative element main contribution study real comprehensive mapp bibliometric characteristic intellectual production national paleontology regard result general metric indicator link scientific production associat brazilian paleontology present based information collect web science identifi main journal publish research paleontology carri out brazil characteriz thematic development brazilian paleontology through analysi used studi throughout decad 1970 2020 result relevant understand brazilian paleontology highlight its national orientation fossil studi wide production locat southeast emphasi studi addres evolution geo-bio-paleontological context brazil south america keyword paleontology information metric studi,1.0.0,9479259649c09a57
2538-9866,v49n2e358942.pdf,v49n2e358942_0,es,Santa Catarina (UFSC).,"Este estudio realiza un análisis bibliométrico de metadatos en el contexto museológico, retomando la literatura científica internacional producida entre 2014 y 2024, con el objetivo de identificar los temas predominantes y principales contribuciones en este campo. Se empleó una metodología que combina enfoques cuantitativos y cualitativos, utilizando datos de ocho fuentes de investigación: SciELO, Scopus, Web of Science, ProQuest (Library & Information Science Abstracts e Arts & Humanities Database), Brapci, EBSCO, LA Referencia y Dialnet, y herramientas como Zotero y VOSviewer. Se recuperaron 1.050 documentos, de los cuales 62 conformaron la muestra final. Fue revelada la existencia de ocho autores clave en el área, destacando la importancia de la integración del conocimiento cultural. Se concluye que es crucial superar las barreras que limitan la exploración de contenidos científicos y promover una mayor interoperabilidad entre los sistemas de gestión en museos, lo que permitirá optimizar el acceso a los datos e informaciones disponibles","metadatos; museos; análisis de coocurrencia; revisiones de literatura; análisis de dominio. Análisis bibliométrico de publicaciones científicas sobre metadatos en el contexto museológico (2014-2024)* © 2026 Universidad de Antioquia. Publicado por Universidad de Antioquia, Colombia. * Artículo derivado del proyecto de investigación Documentación museológica y desafíos contemporáneos financiado",marcadores,santa catarina ufsc,este estudio realiza analisis bibliometrico metadat contexto museologico retom literatura cientifica internacional producida entre 2014 2024 objetivo identificar temas predominant principal contribucion este campo empleo metodologia combina enfoqu cuantitativ cualitativ utiliz datos ocho fuent investigacion scielo scopus web of science proquest library information science abstracts arts humaniti database brapci ebsco referencia dialnet herramient como zotero vosviewer recuperaron 050 document cual 62 conformaron muestra final fue revelada existencia ocho autor clave area destac importancia integracion conocimiento cultural concluye crucial superar barrer limitan exploracion contenid cientific promover mayor interoperabilidad entre sistem gestion muse permitira optimizar acceso datos inform disponibl,metadat muse analisis coocurrencia revision literatura analisis dominio analisis bibliometrico public cientific sobre metadat contexto museologico 2014-2024 2026 universidad antioquia publicado universidad antioquia colombia articulo derivado proyecto investigacion documentacion museologica desafi contemporane financiado,santa catarina ufsc este estudio realiza analisis bibliometrico metadat contexto museologico retom literatura cientifica internacional producida entre 2014 2024 objetivo identificar temas predominant principal contribucion este campo empleo metodologia combina enfoqu cuantitativ cualitativ utiliz datos ocho fuent investigacion scielo scopus web of science proquest library information science abstracts arts humaniti database brapci ebsco referencia dialnet herramient como zotero vosviewer recuperaron 050 document cual 62 conformaron muestra final fue revelada existencia ocho autor clave area destac importancia integracion conocimiento cultural concluye crucial superar barrer limitan exploracion contenid cientific promover mayor interoperabilidad entre sistem gestion muse permitira optimizar acceso datos inform disponibl metadat muse analisis coocurrencia revision literatura analisis dominio analisis bibliometrico public cientific sobre metadat contexto museologico 2014-2024 2026 universidad antioquia publicado universidad antioquia colombia articulo derivado proyecto investigacion documentacion museologica desafi contemporane financiado,1.0.0,1cea935abc3829f4
2538-9866,v49n2e358942.pdf,v49n2e358942_0,en,Un enfoque complementario fue propuesto por,"This study conducts a bibliometric analysis of metadata in the museum context within the international scientific literature from 2014 to 2024, aiming to identify the predominant themes and key contributions in this field. A methodology combining quantitative and qualitative approaches was employed, using data from eight research sources (SciELO, Scopus, Web of Science, ProQuest (Library & Information Science Abstracts and Arts & Humanities Database), Brapci, EBSCO, LA Referencia, and Dialnet) and tools such as Zotero and VOSviewer. A total of 1.050 documents were retrieved, of which 62 constituted the final sample. The existence of eight key authors in the area was revealed, highlighting the importance of integrating cultural knowledge. The study concludes that it is crucial to overcome the barriers that limit the exploration of scientific content and to promote greater interoperability among management systems in museums, which will facilitate optimized access to available data and information",metadata; museums; co-occurrence analysis; literature reviews; domain analysis. 1,marcadores,un enfoque complementario fue propuesto por,study conduct bibliometric analysi metadata museum context within international scientific literature 2014 2024 aiming identify predominant them key contribution field methodology combin quantitative qualitative approach employ using data eight research sourc scielo scopu web science proquest library information science abstract arts humaniti database brapci ebsco la referencia dialnet tool such zotero vosviewer total 050 document retriev which 62 constitut final sample existence eight key author area reveal highlight importance integrat cultural knowledge study conclud crucial overcome barrier limit exploration scientific content promote greater interoperability among management system museum which will facilitate optimiz acces available data informa